window.TMD=window.TMD||{};TMD["S08"]=[{"z":"致老师","t":"To The Teachers","k":"text","p":[2,3],"b":[["h2","To The Teachers","致老师",0],["p","You're probably wondering whether or not you need to use this book. If you are going to be teaching S8, then the answer is \"Yes!\" If you are a new teacher, you should read the first portion of this book very carefully. If you have been teaching for a while, it 's a useful tool for you to brush up on your teaching practices, so a quick review will sharpen your skills.","你可能在想自己是否需要用这本书。如果你要教 S8，答案是“需要！”如果你是新老师，请非常仔细地阅读本书的前半部分。如果你已经教了一段时间，这本书是帮你温习教学方法的好工具，快速浏览一遍就能让你的技巧更纯熟。",0],["h2","How To Teach S8","如何教 S8",0],["h3","● Teaching Materials: Introduction","● 教材介绍",0],["p","There are two series, which are S series(See It & Say It) and EEC series(Easy English Conversation) , for students learning English more confidently. Here are the introductions of teaching materials for S8 students:","我们有两个系列，S 系列（See It & Say It）和 EEC 系列（Easy English Conversation），帮助学生更有自信地学英语。以下是 S8 学生教材的介绍：",0],["h2","S Series","S 系列",0],["h3","● Student's Books","● 学生用书",0],["p","Classroom Readers 8 Classroom Activities 8A and 8B Homework Exercises 8A and 8B","Classroom Readers 8（课堂读本）　Classroom Activities 8A、8B（课堂活动）　Homework Exercises 8A、8B（家庭作业）",0],["h3","● Progress Report Book","● 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["p","Today's Lesson Evaluation Sheet","今日课程（Today's Lesson）、评估表（Evaluation Sheet）",0],["h3","● VCD/MP3",null,0],["p","S SeriesClassroom Readers, Classroom Activities, Homework Exercises, E Series-","S 系列：课堂读本、课堂活动、家庭作业；E 系列——",0],["h3","● Evaluation Sheets","● 评估本",0],["p","Listening labs Quizzes Tests Activity Sheets S series, which has twelve levels, consists of five books:","听力练习、小测验、考试、活动单　S 系列共有十二级，每级包含五本书：",0],["p","Classroom Readers 8 , Classroom Activities 8A and 8B, (used in the classroom), and Homework Exercises 8A and 8B, (intended for home use). These sets have a three-month (24 session) time span in which to be completed. There are fifteen lessons, three test days, three game/activity days and three review days. This teacher's manual gives teachers a clear presentation for each lesson and informs teachers of the pace, grammar, communication and phonetic objectives. Each lesson, time permitting, should include some type of game/exercise based on that day's lesson or as a review of previous lessons. It is important to read this section of the book thoroughly before teaching Lesson 1. Methods for teaching the alphabet, phonics, classroom activities, songs and games are explained to supplement the lesson presentations.","Classroom Readers 8、Classroom Activities 8A 和 8B（课堂使用），以及 Homework Exercises 8A 和 8B（回家使用）。这套教材要在三个月（24 堂课）内完成，包含十五课、三次考试日、三次游戏／活动日和三次复习日。这本教师手册为每一课提供清楚的教学呈现，并告诉老师进度、语法、沟通与发音目标。时间许可的话，每一课都应包含根据当天课程或复习前几课所设计的游戏／练习。在教第 1 课之前，务必详读本书这一部分。字母、自然拼读、课堂活动、歌曲和游戏的教法都在这里说明，作为各课教学的补充。",0],["h3","● Classroom Readers: CR","● Classroom Readers：CR",0],["p","The teaching functions of this book are sentence pattern, vocabulary and phonics teaching. It is an extremely important initial stage for the students. If they could not learn it well, they would feel frustrated and give up learning for the following classes. Of course, you can see all the content on Jordan's Web Site, which is a good resource for teaching and a fun way of learning English.","这本书的教学功能是字母、单词和自然拼读教学。这对完全初学的学生来说是非常重要的起步阶段；如果没有学好，他们会感到挫折，之后的课程也可能放弃学习。当然，您也可以在乔登的网站上看到所有内容，这是很好的教学资源，也是学英语的有趣方式。",0],["h3","● Classroom Activities: CA","● Classroom Activities：CA",0],["p","There are a total of two books for the Classroom Activities :","Classroom Activities 共有两本：",0],["p","8A and 8B, which provide a variety of activities and exercises to strengthen conversation skills and reinforce grammar patterns. There is also a strong emphasis on phonetics and pronunciation to help students develop good reading and speaking habits. With the exception of matching exercises, puzzles or phonetic activities, this book should be used as an ORAL guide to stimulate English communication. It is NOT intended as a reader or a workbook. The blank portions are necessary for the activities so that the language is produced orally and not simply read by the students. The exercises are also intended as a guide for teachers to emphasize Key Grammar/Sentence/Question Patterns.","8A 和 8B 提供各种活动和练习，加强会话能力并巩固语法句型，也非常重视音标和发音，帮助学生养成良好的阅读和口语习惯。除了配对练习、拼图或音标活动之外，这本书应作为“口语”引导来促进英语沟通，不是读本也不是作业本。空白部分是活动所需，让学生用口语说出来，而不只是照着念。这些练习也是老师强调重点语法／句型／问句的指引。",0],["h3","● Homework Exercises: HE","● Homework Exercises：HE",0],["p","It is extremely convenient way to have 8A and 8B Homework Exercises each for the teacher and student, because teachers need a reasonable time to correct the homework. Hence, students can do one of the books while the teachers are correcting another one. Moreover, students have a great chance to practice what they have learned from school that day by writing in these books, and also teachers can easily understand their students' learning results.","老师和学生各有 8A、8B 两本家庭作业非常方便，因为老师需要合理的时间批改作业。学生可以写其中一本，老师同时批改另一本。此外，学生写这些作业能好好练习当天在学校学到的内容，老师也能轻松了解学生的学习成果。",0],["h2","Progress Report Book: PRB","学习进度手册：PRB",0],["h3","● Today's Lesson","● 今天的课程",0],["p","There are totally twenty-four times for students and teachers to record the rate of progress for each class. The teacher is responsible for filling out a Daily Progress Report Form. These forms are located in the Class Progress Report Book that each student should have. Check each student's book after they have already finished filling out the form, and record their performances in class.","师生共有二十四次记录每堂课的学习进度。老师负责填写每日进度报告表，这些表格在每位学生都应该有的 Class Progress Report Book（课堂进度报告本）里。学生填完表格后检查每个人的本子，并记录他们的课堂表现。",0],["h3","● Evaluation Sheet","● 评估表",0],["p","There are totally three evaluation sheets, which should be recorded in Class 8, Class 16, and Class 24 in this term. These evaluation sheets, which are for students to evaluate by themselves, will help the parents to understand how much the students have learned from the English course and also their participation in class. Before they start to do it, explain the sheet as clearly as possible. After finishing the explanation, students should check the appropriate space according to their perception of their performances. Example: Good Fair Failed","本学期共有三张评估表，分别在第 8 课、第 16 课和第 24 课填写。这些评估表是让学生自我评估用的，可以帮助家长了解孩子在英语课学到多少，以及上课的参与情况。开始前，请尽量清楚地说明表格内容。说明完后，学生依照自己对表现的感受，在适当的栏打钩。例如：好（Good）、普通（Fair）、再加油（Try Harder）",0],["h2","VCD/MP3",null,0],["h3","Here are the contents of the S8 MP3","以下是 S8 MP3 的内容",0],["h3","Animation","动画",0],["li","● Classroom Readers 8","● Classroom Readers 8（课堂读本 8）",0],["li","● Classroom Activities 8A and 8B","● Classroom Activities 8A、8B（课堂活动 8A、8B）",0],["h3","Sounds","音档",0],["h3","S Series","S 系列",0],["li","● Classroom Readers 8","● Classroom Readers 8（课堂读本 8）",0],["li","● Classroom Activities 8A and 8B","● Classroom Activities 8A、8B（课堂活动 8A、8B）",0],["li","● Homework Exercises 8A and 8B","● Homework Exercises 8A、8B（家庭作业 8A、8B）",0],["li","● EEC Book 4 Lesson 7-Lesson 12 The teacher should introduce the new lesson or review the lesson, which has been taught by using the cassettes/CD/MP3. This will help students to be familiar with different learning experiences. Moreover, please encourage students to review or preview the lesson from listening to the cassettes/CD/MP3, and also on the touchscreen all-in-ones.","● EEC 第 4 册 第 7 课－第 12 课　老师应使用录音带／CD／MP3 介绍新课或复习教过的课，帮助学生熟悉不同的学习经验。此外，请鼓励学生听录音带／CD／MP3，也用触控一体机来复习或预习课程。",0],["h2","Evaluation Volume","评估本",0],["h3","● Quiz","● 小测验",0],["p","There are totally three quizzes on Class 6, Class 14 and Class 22 in this term. This is the preparation for the coming test. Students can find their mistakes from their own learning and have a chance to attend to them again. And as well, teachers can realize the weakest learning area of each student and strengthen it.","本学期共有三次小测验，分别在第 6 课、第 14 课和第 22 课。这是为之后的测验做准备。学生可以从中找出自己的错误，有机会进步；老师也能了解每位学生最弱的学习部分，并加强它。",0],["h3","● Listening Lab","● 听力练习（Listening Lab）",0],["p","There are totally three listening lab tests in this term, which always occurs on the formal quiz days in Class 6, Class 14 and Class 22. It's a great chance to improve students' listening comprehension by using the Listening Lab Tape. Please notice your students' reaction while taking this test. If they have difficulty to understand the questions, please play it again. Don't let your students feel frustrated and inadequate. Building their confidence is the most important mission, especially in S8.","本学期共有三次听力测验，都在第 6、14、22 堂课的正式小测验日进行。利用听力录音带是提升学生听力理解的好机会。请注意学生考试时的反应，如果他们听不懂题目，请再播一次。别让学生感到挫折和能力不足。建立他们的信心是最重要的任务，在 S8 尤其如此。",0],["h3","● Test","● 测验",0],["p","There are totally three tests in Class 7, Class 15 and Class 23 in this term. The teacher can see students' achievements from the tests. One of the most important ideals for students is whether they can be promoted to the highest level or not.","本学期共有三次考试，在第 7、15、23 堂课。老师可以从考试看出学生的学习成果。对学生来说，最重要的目标之一就是能否升到最高级别。",0],["h3","● Activity Sheet","● 活动单",0],["p","This is a resource for teachers teaching in class while carrying out the games or activities. Of course, students can play games or activities by using these sheets for group work, and practice what they have learned form today's lesson as well. Furthermore, parents can easily view the students' performances in class.","● 活动单：这是老师在课堂上进行游戏或活动时使用的资源。学生也可以通过分组合作，用活动单玩游戏或进行活动，同时练习当天学到的内容。此外，家长也能轻松了解孩子在课堂上的表现。",0],["h2","Spelling Quiz:","拼写小测验：",0],["p","Give a spelling quiz covering the words taught in previous lessons during warm-ups. Have the students write the quiz","在热身时考前几课教过的拼写小测验。让学生把小测验的",0],["h3","words in their notebooks or Progress Report Books. Before","单词写在笔记本或进度报告本上。小测验",0],["p","the quiz, the teacher may review the vocabulary that the quiz will cover.","之前，老师可以先复习小测验范围的单词。",0],["h2","EEC Series","EEC 系列",0],["p","Text Book Easy English Conversation Book 4 Lesson7-12 MP3 Basically, there are six books in EEC series. The idea of using these series with S series is to enhance students' speaking and listening abilities. Indeed, they are the useful and worthy conversation books. Easy English Conversation (EEC) Book eight is focused on teaching children a very basic level of English. For each lesson, there is a detailed explanation about how to teach dialogues, vocabulary and activities. The daily dialogues are designed to teach mannerisms and speech in a western style. EEC Book four contains three sections: Let's See and Say, Let's Check, What Can I do? Each section has specific learning objectives.","课本 Easy English Conversation 第 4 册 第 7–12 课 MP3　EEC 系列基本上共有六本。搭配 S 系列使用，是为了加强学生的口语和听力能力，确实是实用又有价值的会话书。Easy English Conversation（EEC）这一册着重教孩子非常基础的英语。每一课都详细说明如何教对话、单词和活动。日常对话的设计是要教西方的礼仪和说话方式。EEC 第四册包含三个部分：Let's See and Say、Let's Check、What Can I do?，每个部分都有特定的学习目标。",0],["h3","● Let's See And Say",null,0],["p","This section contains a dialogue and a main picture to let students know what they are going to learn from it. The picture presents the meaning of the situation, which will help them understand the roles and stories well. There are simple and short sentences in each dialogue. Teachers should explain a situation by showing the main picture to help students understand what kind of situation it is.","这个部分包含一段对话和一张主图，让学生知道接下来要学什么。图片呈现情境的意思，能帮助学生了解角色和故事。每段对话都是简单的短句。老师应展示主图说明情境，帮助学生了解这是什么样的情境。",0],["h3","● Let's Check",null,0],["p","In this section, there are listening comprehension and writing activities for students to practice, which are designed to show what students have learned from the unit. The exercise of listening comprehension is for reviewing the dialogue and sequence of each unit .The writing exercises enhance the students' ability to learn vocabulary.","这个部分有听力理解和书写活动让学生练习，目的是呈现学生在这个单元学到了什么。听力理解练习用来复习每个单元的对话和顺序；书写练习则加强学生学习单词的能力。",0],["h3","● What Can I Do?",null,0],["p","This section is the student's self-evaluation. Before the end of the class, teachers should tell the students to open their books","这一部分是学生的自我评估。下课前，老师应让学生打开书",0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"教学技巧","t":"Teaching Skills","k":"text","p":[4,5,6,7],"b":[["p","and to finish this evaluation. First , teachers should read each item for students and explain the meaning. After finishing the explanation, students should check the appropriate space according to their perception of their performances. Also they can explain the meaning of the list to their parents at home . Example: Good Fair Try Harder What Can I Do? (From Lesson 7) Try I CAN Good Fair Harder I can count I can ask \" How about drinks?\" I can use western finger symbols. I can say \"I love this juice.\"","完成这份评估。首先，老师逐项念给学生听并解释意思。解释完后，学生依自己对表现的感受在适当的栏打钩。他们也可以回家向父母解释清单的意思。范例：Good Fair Try Harder What Can I Do?（取自第 7 课）Try I CAN Good Fair Harder I can count. I can ask \"How about drinks?\" I can use western finger symbols. I can say \"I love this juice.\"",0],["h2","Teaching Skills","教学技巧",0],["h3","● IPA Symbols (Phonetic Symbols)","● 国际音标（音标符号）",0],["p","Tell the students learning IPA symbols provides the way to pronounce a new word correctly. Let Ss know why they should learn IPA symbols. Teachers can follow these steps while teaching IPA symbols:","告诉学生，学国际音标能让他们正确念出新单词，让学生知道为什么要学国际音标。老师教国际音标时可以照下列步骤：",0],["li","1. Tell Ss the phonetic rules, ex.: i-e [aɪ]","1. 告诉学生发音规则，例如：i-e [aɪ]",0],["li","2. Take some examples, ex.: kite, rice, tiger, mice. It can be done via the teacher or students.","2. 举一些例子，例如：kite、rice、tiger、mice。可以由老师或学生来举。",0],["li","3. Do some group/individual practice of IPA symbols by listening practice below:","3. 用以下听力练习进行国际音标的分组／个别练习：",0],["p","Listen and check: Listen to the word and check if it has the sound of a certain IPA symbol. Listen and fill in the blanks: Give Ss a word in IPA spelling with blanks, pronounce the word. Have Ss listen to the sound and fill in the blank with the missing IPA symbols.","听一听并勾选：听单词，勾选它是否有某个国际音标的音。听一听并填空：给学生一个有空格的用国际音标拼写的单词，念出这个字，请学生听音，在空格中填入缺少的国际音标。",0],["h3","● Spelling","● 拼写",0],["p","Teaching the children how to spell in S8 is mandatory. There really isn't any way to learn spelling other than constant repetition and drilling. Ask the students to practice spelling the new words at home. Call out individual students to spell the review words as you take attendance. A good method to teach it is to follow these procedures EACH time a new word is introduced:","在 S8 一定要教孩子拼写。除了不断反复练习，真的没有别的方法学拼写。请学生在家练习拼新单词。点名时叫个别学生拼复习单词。好方法是每次介绍新单词时都照下列步骤进行：",0],["li","1. Say the word and spell it, with the students repeating. Do this several times.","1. 念出单词并拼出来，让学生跟着复诵。重复几次。",0],["li","2. Write the word on the board. Introduce it phonetically. Point to a student to say the first letter. Point to another student to say the next letter. Point to students randomly, not in seating order. Keep them on their toes. Spell out the word this way, then start over again. Keep going until everyone has said a letter. This should be done very fast almost as if you are spelling the word yourself. Point to the students rather than calling them by name. It is faster and you aren't interrupting the spelling.","2. 把单词写在黑板上，用自然拼读介绍它。指一位学生说出第一个字母，再指另一位学生说下一个字母。随机指学生，不要照座位顺序，让大家随时保持专注。用这种方式拼完整个字，再从头开始，直到每个人都说过一个字母。速度要非常快，就像您自己在拼写一样。用手指学生而不是叫名字，这样比较快，也不会打断拼写。",0],["h3","● Vocabulary","● 单词",0],["li","1. Say the word to the students, have them repeat it after you.","1. 念出单词，请学生跟着您复诵。",0],["li","2. Phonetic Spelling: See also \"How to teach spelling\"","2. 用自然拼读拼写：请参考“如何教拼写”。",0],["li","3. Explain the meaning to the students by using V.A.C. (from digital material) or situational stories. For example: When teaching \"believe\"","3. 用 V.A.C.（数字教材）或情境故事向学生解释意思。例如教 \"believe\" 时：",0],["d","(Point to S1) He says he is Spiderman. I don't believe it.","T",0],["p","Do you believe it?","Do you believe it?（你相信吗？）",0],["li","4. Make sentences by using the vocabulary.","4. 用单词造句。",0],["h3","● Songs","● 歌曲",0],["p","Songs should be taught the last 5-10 minutes of class.","歌曲应在下课前最后 5–10 分钟教。",0],["li","1. Get students familiar with the song before you teach it. Tell them what the song is about, preferably in English. Use dramatic visuals and gestures.","1. 教歌之前先让学生熟悉这首歌，最好用英语告诉他们这首歌在讲什么，搭配生动的视觉辅助和手势。",0],["li","2. Go through the words. It is important the Ss understand them, or at least the key words necessary for singing the song meaningfully.","2. 看一遍歌词。学生理解歌词很重要，至少要懂得有意义地唱这首歌所需的关键字。",0],["li","3. Have students pay attention to any vocabulary they might have had before and ask them to recall the context and illustrate with gestures and visuals.","3. 请学生注意之前学过的单词，请他们回想当时的情境，并用手势和图像说明。",0],["li","4. Speak the song line by line. Have students repeat the words.","4. 一行一行念出歌词，让学生跟着念。",0],["li","5. Sing a line at a time. Teach the refrain at first","5. 一次唱一句，先教副歌。",0],["h3","● Eclectic Teaching For S8","● S8 的综合教学法",0],["li","1. T.P.R. (Total Physical Response) Teacher says the commands and the students show their actions by following them. Those commands are all from the classroom languages. For example: Stand up、Sit down、Go to...、Raise your hand...etc. Or teach students different vocabulary. For example: Point to the bathroom/ the bedroom.. etc. Show me \"call\"/ \"scared\"...","1. T.P.R.（全身反应教学法）老师说出指令，学生照着做动作。这些指令都来自课堂用语，例如：Stand up、Sit down、Go to...、Raise your hand... 等。或教学生不同的单词，例如：Point to the bathroom / the bedroom... 等。Show me \"call\" / \"scared\"...",0],["li","2. V.A.C. (Visual Aids Concept) The best way to help students to understand the meaning of English is to use pictures, flashcards, objects, gestures, and other tools to teach in class. These teaching methods will heighten students' interest in English learning.","2. V.A.C.（视觉辅助概念）帮助学生理解英语意思最好的方法，是在课堂上用图片、单词卡、实物、手势和其他工具教学。这些教学方法能提高学生学英语的兴趣。",0],["h3","3. Repetition","3. 重复练习",0],["p","This is a common way for teaching in class, but it's very useful.","这是课堂上常用的教学方式，但非常有用。",0],["d","everything","T",0],["d","everything","Ss",0],["d","everything, everything, everything.","T",0],["d","everything, everything, everything.","Ss",0],["d","Everything is ok.","T",0],["d","Everything is ok.","Ss",0],["h3","4. Chain Drill","4. 接龙练习",0],["p","Have students to practice the certain sentence pattern in turns. For example:","让学生轮流练习某个句型。例如：",0],["d","Where were you?","S1",0],["d","I was in the kitchen . Where were you ?","S2",0],["d","I was in the living room. ( and continue the drill until all the students have done it)","S3",0],["h3","5. Ball Drill","5. 传球练习",0],["p","There are varied ways to play with a ball for practicing English in the teacher's manual. Here is one of the ways below:","教师手册中有各种用球练习英语的方式，以下是其中一种：",0],["p","Teacher throws a ball to an unsuspecting student and asks a question that should be answered right away and then throw the ball either back to the teacher or to one of the classmates.","老师把球丢给没有防备的学生并问一个问题，学生要马上回答，再把球丢回给老师或其中一位同学。",0],["d","What did you do yesterday morning?","T",0],["p","(throws the ball to S1)","（把球丢给 S1）",0],["d","I played baseball yesterday morning. What did you do yesterday afternoon? (S1 throw the ball to S2)","S1",0],["d","I studied English yesterday afternoon.","S2",0],["h3","6. Chart Drill","6. 图表练习",0],["p","There are varied ways to play Chart Drill for practicing English in the Teacher's Manual. Here is one of the ways below:","教师手册中有许多用图表练习英语的玩法，以下是其中一种：",0],["p","yesterday today tomorrow bake cake ● cook soup watch TV go shopping",null,0],["d","(put a magnet on one of the squares and have S1 make a sentence)","T",0],["d","I baked a cake yesterday..","S1",0],["h3","7. Substitution Drill","7. 替换练习",0],["p","Write down a sentence pattern on the board. For example:","在黑板上写一个句型。例如：",0],["p","She took some medicine last .","She took some medicine last .（她上……吃了药。）",0],["d","(show one of the flashcards: month, and have S1 finish the complete sentence)","T",0],["d","She took some medicine last month.","S1",0],["h3","8. Role Play","8. 角色扮演",0],["li","-Pair students up and have them practice the dialogue or conversation.","- 让学生两两一组练习对话。",0],["li","-Have students come up to the front and act the dialogue out in pairs.","- 请学生两人一组到台前演出对话。",0],["h3","9. Cloze","9. 克漏字",0],["p","Eliminate some key words from the sentences and have students to fill in the blanks.","把句子中的一些关键字去掉，请学生填空。",0],["h3","10. Question & Answer","10. 问与答",0],["p","The best time to carry out \"Question & Answer\" is at the beginning of each class for 5-10 minutes. Teacher asks the questions from the previous lessons to enhance students' learning results.","进行“问与答”最好的时机是每堂课开始的 5–10 分钟。老师问之前课程的问题，加强学生的学习成果。",0],["h3","11. Matching","11. 配对",0],["p","It is good for practicing vocabulary and IPA symbols. For example:","这很适合练习单词和国际音标。例如：",0],["p","Prepare vocabulary cards and IPA symbol cards.","准备单词卡和国际音标卡。",0],["d","(show the vocabulary \"medicine\")","T",0],["d","(find the vocabulary card \"medicine\") medicine.","S1",0],["p","The doctor gave Andy some medicine. Or T.: (Write the word on the board \"bedroom\".) S1.: (Find the IPA symbol card \"[uː]\".)","The doctor gave Andy some medicine.（医生给了 Andy 一些药。）或 T.：（在白板上写 \"bedroom\"。）S1.：（找出国际音标卡 \"[uː]\"。）",0],["h3","12. Expansion Drill","12. 扩展练习",0],["p","It is an effective way to practice English. For example:","这是练习英语的有效方法。例如：",0],["p","Have students sit around a circle and start this drill.","请学生围成一圈坐好，开始这个练习。",0],["d","I had spaghetti for dinner yesterday.","S1",0],["d","He had spaghetti for dinner yesterday. I had noodles for dinner yesterday.","S2",0],["d","He had spaghetti for dinner yesterday. She had noodles for dinner yesterday. I had a hamburger for dinner yesterday.","S3",0],["p","(Continue this drill until all the students have done it)","（持续进行，直到所有学生都练习过）",0],["h3","13. Transformation","13. 句型转换",0],["p","Teacher writes down a sentence, such as \"This is my bicycle. \" And have one of the students to change the sentence into another form:","老师写一个句子，例如 \"This is my bicycle.\"，让一位学生把句子改成另一种形式：",0],["p","This bicycle is mine. This is a useful way to practice grammar and sentence structures. For example:","This bicycle is mine.（这辆自行车是我的。）这是练习语法和句子结构的实用方式。例如：",0],["d","This is my bicycle. \"mine\".","T",0],["d","This bicycle is mine.","S1",0],["d","He","T",0],["d","This bicycle is his.","S2",0],["h3","14. Situational Practice","14. 情境练习",0],["p","Create different kinds of situations depending on the contents of the lessons to help students understand the meaning of English exactly and also enjoy learning English.","依照课程内容设计各种情境，帮助学生确实了解英语的意思，也享受学英语的乐趣。",0],["h3","● Suggested Games and Ways of Scoring","● 建议的游戏与计分方式",0],["h3","1. Ghostbusters","1. 捉鬼敢死队",0],["p","Have students form a circle. Choose a student to be \"it\" and give him/her a newspaper stick. When the teacher calls student A, it has to hit student A on his/her desk with the newspaper before student A calls another student.","请学生围成一圈，选一位学生当“鬼”，给他一根报纸棒。老师叫 A 同学时，A 同学要在叫出另一位同学之前，“鬼”就要用报纸棒打到 A 同学的桌子。",0],["h3","2. Blind Man's Bluff","2. 蒙眼抓人",0],["p","Have a student wear a blindfold and walk around in the classroom to grab a student. When he/she has someone. Ask a question to the student who is caught by the blind man. The blind man has to guess who he/she is according to the voice of the answer.","让一位学生戴上眼罩，在教室里走动去抓一位学生。抓到人时，问被抓到的学生一个问题，蒙眼的人要根据回答的声音猜出他／她是谁。",0],["h3","3. IPA translation relay","3. 国际音标翻译接力",0],["p","Divide students into groups and mark them with numbers. Say a word and let students spell it in IPA phonetic symbols. The teacher can let them finish the spelling in the relay way by calling the initial number.","把学生分组并标上号码。说一个字，让学生用国际音标拼出来。老师可以叫号码，让他们用接力的方式完成拼写。",0],["h3","4. Odd one out","4. 找出不同类",0],["p","Call out a series of words that have something in common except one, like doll, ball, chair, kite. Students must identify the word that doesn't fit, in this case, \"chair\" is not a kind of toy. The activity can be also used in identifying phonetic sounds in words.","念出一串除了一个以外都有共同点的字，例如 doll、ball、chair、kite。学生要找出不属于同类的字，在这个例子中，\"chair\" 不是一种玩具。这个活动也可以用来辨识字中的音。",0],["h3","5. Search","5. 寻宝",0],["p","The teacher determines a topic ex.: \"What will you do tomorrow?\" Each student writes something on a piece of paper. The paper are collected and redistributed to students. Students must use the dialogue provided by the teacher to find the owner of the paper.","老师选一个主题，例如 \"What will you do tomorrow?\"，每位学生在纸上写一些东西，收回后再重新发给学生，学生要用老师提供的对话找出纸条的主人。",0],["h3","6. Find Someone Who...","6. 找到某个……的人",0],["p","Divide students into groups. Write a list on the board, ex:","把学生分组，在黑板上写一张清单，例如：",0],["p","Who Does something played bal yesterday has a birthday party in June ...... Each group selects a runner to ask other students the ques-tions. The first team to find someone for each item on thelist wins.","找到做过某件事的人：昨天打过球的、六月办生日派对的……　每组选一位跑者去问其他学生问题。最先为清单上每一项都找到人的队伍获胜。",0],["h3","7. Forgetful Teacher","7. 健忘的老师",0],["p","After covering the lesson in the reader, ask students to close their books. Read one of the sentences, pretending that you have forgotten how to read one of the words. Student must tell you the word you have forgotten.","教完读本的课文后，请学生合上课本。念其中一个句子，假装忘了怎么念其中一个字，学生要告诉您忘记的字。",0],["h3","8. What's missing","8. 少了哪一个",0],["p","Write some letters, words, numbers, or draw some pictures on the whiteboard. Divide the class into teams Have Ss put their heads down. Erase one thing off the board. Tell Ss to look. Ask, \"What's missing?\" to choose a student to tell you the answer. This way, everyone will have a chance to participate.","在白板上写一些字母、单词、数字或画一些图。把全班分队，让学生趴下，擦掉白板上的一样东西，再叫学生看，问 \"What's missing?\" 并选一位学生回答。这样每个人都有机会参与。",0],["h3","9. Sentence Building","9. 造句",0],["p","Choose five words that are not really related. Ask students to make a sentence or short story using these words. Ex: went/ movies/ friends","选五个彼此不太相关的单词，请学生用这些字造句或编一个小故事。例如：went / movies / friends",0],["d","I went to the movies with my friends.","S",0],["h3","10. Phonics Tic-Tac-Toe","10. 发音圈圈叉叉",0],["p","Draw a Tic-Tac-Toe grid on the board. Write different IPA symbols in each space. Divide the class into teams. The first player chooses a space by saying a word with the initial/middle/final sound of the IPA symbol in the space.","在黑板上画井字格，每格写不同的国际音标，把全班分队。第一位玩家说出一个词首／词中／词尾有该格国际音标的单词，就能选那一格。",0],["h3","11. Spelling phonics","11. 拼写发音",0],["p","Divide the students into teams. The students have their numbers. The teacher says a word and calls a number to spell the word in phonetic symbols or alphabets on the board.","把学生分队，每位学生有自己的号码。老师说一个字并叫一个号码，让学生到白板用音标或字母拼出那个字。",0],["h3","12. Phonics switch","12. 发音变变变",0],["p","Write a word they know on the board, ex.: boy. Have students pronounce it chorally. Then change one of the letters in the word. For example, boy→ Roy. The first student who pronounces the word correctly wins a point.","在黑板上写一个学生认识的字，例如 boy，请学生一起念出来，再把其中一个字母换成另一个字母，例如 boy → Roy，最先念对的学生得一分。",0],["h3","13. Crosswords","13. 填字游戏",0],["p","Draw a big grid on the board. The teacher begins by writing a word such as notebook. The student makes a word that has a letter of notebook. The words can be written forwards, backwards and diagonally. The students get points by the amount of letters in the words they make.","在白板上画一个大格子。老师先写一个字，例如 notebook。学生组成一个含有 notebook 中某个字母的字，字可以正写、倒写或斜写。学生依组成的字的字母数得分。",0],["h3","14. Paper airplane game","14. 纸飞机游戏",0],["p","Divide students into groups. Each group has to make their own paper airplane. Give them a minute to test their planes. Set the score for each target. For instance, 10 for landing on the chairs, 50 for landing on the desks, etc.. After answering questions correctly, they can shoot their airplanes and get points according to the target they landed on.","把学生分组，每组做一架纸飞机，给他们一分钟试飞。为每个目标设定分数，例如降落在椅子上 10 分、降落在桌上 50 分等。答对问题后就可以射出纸飞机，依降落的目标得分。",0],["h3","15. Frog","15. 青蛙",0],["p","Divide students into groups. Each group has to make their own paper frogs. Give them a minute to test their frogs. Draw two parallel lines on the floor. Put the frogs right behind the starting line. After answering questions correctly, they can propel their frogs once. The frog that goes the longest distance is the winner.","把学生分组，每组自己折一只纸青蛙，给他们一分钟试跳。在地上画两条平行线，把青蛙放在起跑线后面。学生答对问题就可以弹青蛙一次，跳得最远的青蛙获胜。",0],["h3","16. My name is John","16. 我的名字是 John",0],["p","Divide students into teams. Take turns to come out and make sentences such as \"My name is John. I am twelve years old. I live in Beijing. Each sentence is worth a point. Students have to make the next sentence within ten seconds or the teacher should say \"Stop!\"","把学生分队，轮流出来造句，例如 \"My name is John. I am twelve years old. I live in Beijing.\"。每句得一分。学生要在十秒内说出下一句，否则老师要喊 \"Stop!\"。",0],["h3","17. Hot Rock","17. 烫手石头",0],["p","Have students make a circle. The ones in even numbers are in a team while the ones in odd numbers are in the other. Make a paper ball or any thing that could be passed by students safely as the hot rock. Have students pass the hot rock when the teacher says a question. The student has the hot rock in hands when the question goes to the last word must answer it correctly. If he/she failed, the team will get a sad face. The team that gets more sad faces in the end is the loser.","让学生围成一圈，单号一队、双号一队。做一个纸球或任何能安全传递的东西当烫手山芋。老师说一个问题时让学生传烫手山芋，问题说到最后一个字时，拿着烫手山芋的学生必须答对。答错的话，他的队伍得一个哭脸。最后哭脸比较多的队伍输。",0],["h3","18. Monster face","18. 怪兽脸",0],["p","Draw a big monster face (the crazier the better) on the board. For different areas of the face -the eyes, the nose, the mouth, etc., assign different point values. (The smaller the area, the bigger the point value.)The S does what T asks him/her to do correctly can throw the sticky ball to the monster face. Wherever it hits determines how many points the S gets.","在白板上画一张大怪物脸（越疯狂越好），为脸上不同区域——眼睛、鼻子、嘴巴等——设定不同的分数（区域越小分数越高）。正确做到老师要求的学生可以把黏黏球丢向怪物脸，打中哪里就决定得几分。",0],["h3","19. Spy Code","19. 密码游戏",0],["p","Assign each alphabet letter a number, for example a=1, b=2, etc.. Write a series of codes on the board \"1,16,16,12,5\". Students must translate the code into Letters and say apple\" as fast as they can.","为每个字母设定一个数字，例如 a=1、b=2 等。在白板上写一串密码 \"1,16,16,12,5\"，学生要把密码翻成字母，尽快说出 \"apple\"。",0],["h3","20. Scramble words","20. 单词重组",0],["p","Write the word in a scrambled fashion-\"oyb\" for \"boy\". Have students unscramble it on the board.","写一个字母打乱的单词，例如用 \"oyb\" 代表 \"boy\"，请学生在黑板上重组。",0],["h3","21. Simple scoring (short)","21. 简单计分（快速）",0],["p","Give the winner a point.","给获胜者一分。",0],["h3","22. Die score","22. 骰子计分",0],["p","Throw the die to get points. It can be extended to many ways like '-1,3,5/+2,4,6'.Teachers can be creative to make it different every time.","掷骰子得分。可以延伸出很多玩法，例如“1、3、5 扣分／2、4、6 加分”，老师可以发挥创意，每次都不一样。",0],["d","Teachers can draw a railroad, an apple tree, stone steps to a treasure island, etc. Ss go their steps by the number they get with the die. Some traps or lucky things can be added in the games above in order to make it exciting.","Extend",0],["d","#22-A parts collection If the die goes to 1 or 4 points ,they can get eyes; if 2 or 5 points, they can get a mouth; if 3 or 6 points ,they can get a face.","Extend",0],["p","The team that collects eyes, a mouth and a face can form a smiling face successfully and win a point. Teachers can vary the \"parts\" into many other things.","集满眼睛、嘴巴和脸的队伍可以成功组成一张笑脸并得一分。老师可以把“部件”换成任何其他东西。",0],["h3","23. Sticky ball score","23. 黏黏球计分",0],["p","Throw the sticky ball to get points. Teachers can draw different kind of targets on the board.","丢黏黏球得分，老师在黑板上画各种目标。",0],["d","Teachers can put some alphabets, IPA symbols or words in the target, then ask students to say a word initial with the alphabet chant, pronounce the symbols or make a sentence with the word to get points..","Extend",0],["h3","24. Bingo","24. 宾果",0],["p","Draw a 3*3 grid on the board. Each team has its own mark. The first team that has three marks in a row is the winner.","在黑板上画 3×3 的格子，每队有自己的记号，最先连成一线的队伍获胜。",0],["d","chess board--Make the grids into 4*4,5*5 or even larger, have Ss to put 3,4 or more marks in a row.","Extend",0],["li","25. Maze:","25. 迷宫：",0],["p","There are several ways Ss can choose at the beginning. After start going, Ss have to change their directions at every corner then get unknown rewards at the end.","一开始学生有几条路可以选。出发后，学生每到一个转角都要改变方向，最后在终点得到未知的奖励。",0],["h3","26. Matching and memorization","26. 配对记忆",0],["p","Draw a concealed grid on the board. Teachers can arrange pictures-words, Vocabulary-IPA symbols, and any other things in the grid. Have Ss to choose any two squares then T show them on the board. If they match, Ss can get points. If they don't, the teacher erases them. Ss try to memorize the location and try it next time.","在白板上画一个盖起来的格子。老师可以在格子里安排图片－单词、单词－国际音标或任何其他配对。让学生选任两格，老师在白板上翻开。配对成功就得分；不成功的话老师把它们擦掉（盖回去）。学生要试着记住位置，下次再试。",0],["h3","27. Big or Small","27. 比大小",0],["p","Students choose \"big\" or \"small\", the teacher throws the die to determine the standard number, then have students throw the die to get the final number.","学生选“大”或“小”。老师掷骰子决定标准数字，再请学生掷骰子得到最后的数字。",0],["d","Big!","S1",0],["p","T.:(throw the die)The standard number is 3!","T：（掷骰子）The standard number is 3!",0],["d","(throw the die)The final number is 6!","S1",0],["p","T.:S1 can get a point!","T.：S1 得一分！",0],["h3","● Digital Teaching: www.jordan.com.tw","● 数字教学：www.jordan.com.tw",0],["p","All the contents of S8 are on Jordan's Web Site, which includes Classroom Readers, Classroom Activities, and Easy English Conversation Book4. Students will have a lot of fun in learning English by watching and practicing animated pictures from this web site. And Teachers can teach well through this fashionable and interesting teaching idea. The teaching steps of digital teaching are found in the teacher's manual for each class. And also, please encourage students to practice English with this web site on the touchscreen all-in-one in class as well as at home. Preview, Assist, Review are the three important steps for teachers, students and parents while they make use of it. It is a high-technology multimedia, but it is easy to operate.","S8 的所有内容都在乔登网站上，包括课堂读本、课堂活动和 Easy English Conversation 第 4 册。学生在网站上看动画、做练习，会学得很开心，老师也能用这种新潮有趣的方式好好教学。数字教学的步骤都在教师手册每堂课中。也请鼓励学生在课堂上和家里用触控一体机上这个网站练习英语。预习、辅助、复习是老师、学生和家长使用时三个重要的步骤。它是高科技的多媒体，但很容易操作。",0],["h3","● How to visit Jordan's Website","● 如何进入乔登网站",0],["p","www.jordan.com.tw ↓ 乔登美语教学网 ↓ e-Learning ↓ e-Learning白金会员 ↓ Enter the password ↓ Big Kid大儿童学习区 ↓ Lesson V儿童高阶 ↓ Book8",null,0],["h2","Classroom Language","课堂用语",0],["h3","1. Classroom Commands","1. 课堂指令",0],["p","Stand up. Sit down Say _______. Close your books. Turn around. Again. Look at _______. Count the _______.","站起来。坐下。说……。合上书。转过去。再一次。看……。数一数……。",0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"班级管理","t":"Classroom Management","k":"text","p":[8,9],"b":[["p","Stop. No Chinese! No eating! Put it away! Come here. Open/Close your eyes. Open your books to page ______ Great job! Excellent! Well done! I knew you could do it! Yippee! All right! Hand in your homework, please! Are you sure? Be careful! Notice your spelling! Notice the tense!","停。不准说中文！不准吃东西！收起来！过来。张开／闭上眼睛。把书翻到第……页。做得好！太棒了！很好！我就知道你做得到！耶！太好了！请交作业！你确定吗？小心！注意拼写！注意时态！",0],["h3","2. Classroom Interaction","2. 课堂互动用语",0],["p","How do you say.......? What's the past tense of...? Make a sentence with..... Make a question. Who can correct the error? What does it mean? How do you spell... in alphabets? How do you spell .... in IPA symbols? Am I clear? Do you understand? Pardon me. How do you pronounce the word? Don't give up! You can do it! That's OK. Take it easy. Try it again! Give me five! Go! Good Luck!! Mary, Mary, go, go, go!","How do you say.......? What's the past tense of...? Make a sentence with..... Make a question. Who can correct the error? What does ..... mean? How do you spell... ? How do you spell .... in 国际音标 symbols? Am I clear? Do you understand? Pardon me. How do you pronounce this word? Don't give up! You can do it! That's OK. Take it easy. Try it again! Give me five! Go! Good Luck!! Mary, Mary, go, go, go!",0],["li","● The following suggestions should be useful to ensure future success and accomplishment:","● 下列建议有助于确保日后的成功与成就：",0],["h2","Classroom Management","班级管理",0],["h3","Class Preparation","课前准备",0],["li","(1) Please arrive at School thirty minutes earlier to do class preparation.","(1) 请提早三十分钟到学校做课前准备。",0],["li","-Fill out the Teacher's Handbook","- 填写教师手册（Teacher's Handbook）",0],["li","-Prepare Teaching Materials","- 准备教材",0],["li","-Log on to Jordan's Web Site and get familiar with today's lesson by operating the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 登录乔登网站，操作触控一体机熟悉今天的课程。",0],["li","-Help the absent students make up the missing class","- 协助缺席的学生补课",0],["li","(2) Please go into the classroom five minutes earlier to get everything done, and also interact with students.","(2) 请提早五分钟进教室把一切准备好，并和学生互动。",0],["li","-Check that the touchscreen all-in-one is ready for the coming class.","- 确认触控一体机已为接下来的课程准备就绪。",0],["h3","Discipline","秩序管理",0],["p","The teacher should maintain proper discipline at all times. Swearing, spitting, throwing objects, standing on chairs/desks, hitting others, kicking walls, etc. ... are prohibited. Eating and drinking during class time will be left up to the individual schools/teachers, but these actions should be discouraged. A simple, common sense approach to discipline is usually best. Discipline involves keeping everyone happy. Even the students who are disciplined should end up happy. The student should understand that it is not them the teacher is unhappy with, just their behavior. Discipline should never be a personal criticism. The student should know that the teacher likes them, and only wants their behaviors to be improved. Some basic things to remember about classroom behaviors:","- 确认触控一体机已为接下来的课程准备就绪。秩序管理：老师应随时维持良好的课堂秩序。禁止骂脏话、吐口水、丢东西、站在椅子／桌子上、打人、踢墙壁等行为。上课时间是否可以吃喝由各分校／老师决定，但应尽量避免。简单、合乎常理的管理方式通常最好。秩序管理是要让每个人都开心，即使是被管教的学生，最后也应该开心。学生应该明白，老师不高兴的不是他这个人，而是他的行为。管教绝不应是对人的批评；学生应该知道老师喜欢他，只是希望他的行为能改进。关于课堂行为，有几点基本原则要记住：",0],["li","-A misbehaving class is usually a bored class. A quick pace will help to ensure the students maintain attention.","- 秩序不好的班级通常是无聊的班级。快速的节奏有助于让学生保持专注。",0],["li","-Have your teaching aids and materials at hand to avoid lengthy delays, which give the students the opportunity to start misbehaving.","- 把教具和教材准备在手边，避免拖延太久，让学生有机会开始捣蛋。",0],["li","-Call on students at random order. If a student doesn't know when it is his/her turn they will pay closer attention.","- 随机点学生。如果学生不知道什么时候轮到自己，就会更专心。",0],["li","-Mix choral work with pair work and individual practice. If possible, switch from one type of practice to another often to help keep interest and variety. Finally, return to group work to follow-up/reinforce the lesson. Minimize individual work if time is short. If a student is creating a problem in class, give him/her a long stare or a tap on the shoulder to let him/her know you disapprove. If the student persists, tell him/her to stop the disruptive behavior. If the problem continues, take away reward cards or have him/her stand up. Finally, if the student won't stop, send him/her out of the classroom to see the secretary. The student's parents should be notified of the behavior. You should treat the student well after each of these steps. You must show the individual that you are still friends, but you don't approve of their actions.","- 全班齐声练习、两人练习和个别练习交替进行。可能的话，经常变换练习方式，保持新鲜感和变化。最后回到全班练习，延伸／巩固本课内容。时间不够时，尽量减少个别练习。如果有学生在课堂上制造问题，先盯着他看久一点，或拍拍他的肩膀，让他知道您不认同。如果学生仍然继续，请他停止干扰行为。问题若持续，就收回奖励卡或请他站起来。最后，如果学生还是不停止，请他到教室外找行政人员，并通知家长学生的行为。每一步之后都要好好对待这位学生，让他知道你们还是朋友，只是您不认同他的行为。",0],["h3","Introduce Your New student","介绍新同学",0],["p","Sometimes there would be new students in your class. You should introduce the new students to your class and give students a chance to introduce themselves. The teacher should help the new students to join the class smoothly by giving them some extra help and explaining the class rules clearly to the new ones. In some cases, giving the new students a chance to proof their English ability is a good way to get the class to accept them. It's also a chance to eliminate their fear of being in a new class.","有时班上会有新同学加入。你应该向全班介绍新同学，并让学生有机会自我介绍。老师应多给新同学一些协助，清楚说明班规，帮助他们顺利融入班级。有些情况下，给新同学一个展现英语能力的机会，是让全班接纳他们的好方法，也能消除他们进入新班级的恐惧。",0],["h3","● Homework And Grading","● 作业与评分",0],["p","Establish from the first day of class that students need to turn in homework in a timely fashion. You must let students know you want their homework EVERY time the class meets. The homework helps to reinforce key lesson concepts and without completing it prior to the next class the student may begin to fall behind. Be very firm about making sure they turn it in on time! Correct the homework exercises carefully, this is a very important process for the very beginner. Be strict! That will help them in cultivating a good habit to write clearly and neatly.","从第一天上课就要让学生知道，作业必须准时缴交。您要让学生知道，“每次”上课都要交作业。作业能帮助巩固课程的重要观念，如果下次上课前没有完成，学生可能会开始落后。务必坚持要求准时交作业！仔细批改作业，这对初学者是非常重要的过程。要严格！这能帮助他们养成书写清楚整齐的好习惯。",0],["h3","How to help the beginners doing homework successfully,","以下是帮助初学者",0],["h3","here are some tips","顺利完成作业的一些秘诀：",0],["li","1. Make full use of the \"Reinforcement\" section of lesson plans in each class. Have students open the Homework Exercises to preview all the items about today's lesson.","1. 充分利用每堂课教案中的“Reinforcement（加强复习）”部分。请学生打开 Homework Exercises，预习今天课程的所有题目。",0],["li","2. Make a clear explanation for them to understand the content of today's Homework Exercises. And ask them to practice some exercises to make sure they understand. Grading of homework and tests should be consistent between the FT and the CT.A good rule of thumb to follow when grading homework is to subtract two points for a missing or incorrect word and one point for a missing or incorrect letter. If you are using letter grades (A, B, C, etc.) convert the number total to a letter grade as follows:","2. 清楚说明今天 Homework Exercises 的内容，让学生了解，并请他们先练习几题，确认他们都懂了。外籍老师（FT）和中籍老师（CT）批改作业和测验的标准要一致。批改作业有个好用的原则：漏写或写错一个字扣两分，漏写或写错一个字母扣一分。如果您用等第（A、B、C 等），请依照以下方式把分数换算成等第：",0],["p","90-100 A 70-80 C 80-90 B 60-70 D",null,0],["h3","Quizzes And Tests","小测验与测验",0],["p","Review lessons will always precede test days. The reviews are designed to cover key grammar and communication points as well as vocabulary to be tested. Always follow the exercise with a game/activity of your own (see games/ activities section for suggestions) that addresses the material you want to emphasize. Quizzes should be given after checking attendance. It is up to the teacher to decide whether or not the students will need a quick review before a quiz. If a student scores less than 80% on a test or quiz, he/she will be required to take it again after class.","测验日之前一定会有复习课。复习课的设计涵盖重要的语法和沟通重点，以及要考的单词。练习之后，一定要接着进行您自己设计、针对想强调内容的游戏／活动。小测验应在点名后进行。是否需要在小测验前快速复习，由老师决定。学生测验或小测验分数低于 80% 时，必须在下课后重考。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching","电话教学",0],["p","As teachers, we are not only concerned with students' achievements in class, but also concerned with their study habits while they are at home. Therefore, we've designed \"Telephone Teaching Material (TTM)\" to help students review English at home by answering some questions on the phone and let the parents know about their kids' ability in speaking English. The teacher should grade students' responses by using the \"ABC\" scoring system, write comments in the \"Teacher's Handbook\", and, for encouragement, give them reward cards according to their performance during the following class. For doing well on telephone teaching, the teacher may lead students to prepare those questions in class and give students 2 or 3 attempts to answer each question. In addition, while doing Telephone Teaching, be sure to greet students at the beginning of a conversation and give students some encouragement after they've answered a question. Procedures:","身为老师，我们不只关心学生在课堂上的表现，也关心他们在家的学习习惯。因此我们设计了电话教学教材（TTM），让学生在电话中回答问题，在家复习英语，也让家长了解孩子的英语口语能力。老师应用等第（A、B、C 或 D）为学生的回答评分，把评语写在“教师手册（Teacher's Handbook）”中，并在下次上课时依照表现给予奖励卡作为鼓励。为了让电话教学顺利，老师可以在课堂上带学生准备这些问题，每题给学生 2 到 3 次回答机会。此外，进行电话教学时，对话开始时一定要先问候学生，学生每回答一题后也要给予鼓励。步骤：",0],["li","1. Greetings: Say hello to students or their family. Let them know you want to talk to the student.","1. 问候：向学生或家人问好，让他们知道您想跟学生说话。",0],["h3","Suggestions","建议用语",0],["li","(1) Good afternoon, good evening.",null,0],["li","(2) Hello! (Student's name), this is (teacher's name). How are you today?",null,0],["li","2. Questions and Answers: Try to encourage students to answer with complete sentences.","2. 问与答：尽量鼓励学生用完整的句子回答。",0],["h3","Suggestions","建议用语",0],["li","(1) I know you knew that, try again!",null,0],["li","(2) Good! Very good! You did a good job! Wonderful! Very nice! Good boy! Good girl!",null,0],["li","3. Ending: Continue to encourage the students again and remind them of something if it's needed for the next class:","3. 结尾：再次鼓励学生，必要时提醒他们下一堂课要准备的事：",0],["h3","Suggestions","建议用语",0],["li","(1) You are very good. Please finish your homework.",null,0],["li","(2) Don't forget to let your parent sign the \"Progress Report Book.\"",null,0],["li","(3) You are a good boy/girl. Did you prepare for the quiz/test next class?",null,0],["li","(4) You always do a great job! Is your daddy or mommy home? Please ask him/her to come to the phone, Thank you.","(4) You always do a great job! Is your daddy or mommy home? Please ask him/her to come to the phone, thank you.",0],["li","(5) How was school today?",null,0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"课程大纲","t":"Syllabus","k":"img","p":[10],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"学习目标","t":"Learning Goals","k":"text","p":[11],"b":[["h2","Learning Goals","学习目标",0],["h2","A) Grammar Goals","A) 语法目标",0],["li","1. To use the present, the past and the future tenses.","1. 使用现在时、过去时和将来时。",0],["li","2. To use pronouns, possessive adjectives, and possessive pronouns.","2. 使用代词、所有格形容词和所有格代词。",0],["li","3. To use adverbs of frequency.","3. 使用频率副词。",0],["li","4. To use the \"Why...?\" \"Because...\"questions.","4. 使用 \"Why...?\" \"Because...\" 问答。",0],["li","5. To use quantifiers \"some\" and \"any.\"","5. 使用数量词 \"some\" 和 \"any\"。",0],["li","6. To use particular words to itemize or count.","6. 使用特定的字来逐项列举或计数（量词）。",0],["li","7. To use the \"How many...\" and \"How much...\"questions.","7. 使用 \"How many...\" 和 \"How much...\" 问句。",0],["li","8. To use adverbs.","8. 使用副词。",0],["li","9. To use comparatives and superlatives.","9. 使用比较级和最高级。",0],["h2","B) Communication Goals","B) 沟通目标",0],["li","1. To analyze complex grammatical structures in reading.","1. 分析阅读中较复杂的语法结构。",0],["li","2. To memorize short passages and to report them to the class in one's own words.","2. 背诵短文，并用自己的话向全班报告。",0],["li","3. To use quantifiers while shopping.","3. 购物时使用数量词。",0],["li","4. To make comparisons.","4. 做比较。",0],["li","5. To use adverbs.","5. 使用副词。",0],["li","6. To use all grammatical forms in communication.","6. 在沟通中使用所有语法形式。",0],["h2","C) Vocabulary Goals","C) 单词目标",0],["p","Class 1: why, because, delicious, wet, bought, department, store, crayon, storybook Class 2: think , cloth, ever, funny,ride, around, change, often, seldom Class 3: excuse,show, same, silly, mistake Class 4: None. Class 5: drive/drove, chase(d),growl(ed),bite/bit,polar bear, zebra, kangaroo, seal Class 9: started, air, balloon, turn, if, a lot of, a little, sugar Class 10: mess, crazy, lick(ed),piece, cup, bar, bottle, bowl, bag Class 11: cloud, light, only, meat, sauce, charcoal, slice of bread Class 12: things, of course, vanilla, make up your mind Class 13: None. Class 17: important, news, Africa, doctor, excited, carefully, carelessly, happily,sadly, quietly, noisily, quickly, slowly Class 18: airport, gate, older, than, smarter, stewardess, taller, longer, fatter, bigger Class 19: arrive(d),oldest, kill(ed), missing, smaller, smallest, happier, happiest, tallest, fattest, longest Class 20: point, shoulder, more, afraid, better, the best, most, expensive Class 21: grade, joking",null,0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"第 1 课","t":"Class 1","k":"class","p":[12,13,14,15],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["li","- To learn the sentence patterns: Why _________? Because ________________.","- 学习句型：Why _________? Because ________________.",1],["li","- To give reasons for past feelings and behaviors.","- 说明过去的感受和行为的原因。",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 1","Classroom Readers 第 1 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","why, because, delicious, wet",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 8A Lesson 1","课堂活动 8A 第 1 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","bought, department store, crayon(s), storybook",null,1],["h3","Sentence pattern","句型",1],["p","Why _________? Because ________________.","Why _________?（为什么……？）Because ________________.（因为……）",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Counting using the Roman numeric system.","用罗马数字系统计数。",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","One set of letter cards for each student, photocopies of page 10 in CA S8 book A","每位学生一套字母卡、S8 课堂活动 A 册第 10 页的复印件",1],["h3","EEC4 Lesson 7","EEC4 第 7 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Shopping cart, cashier, money, cash, register, bill, coin, pack",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","How many cans of tuna fish did you take?","A",1],["d","Seven","B",1],["d","How about drinks?","A",1],["d","Ten","B",1],["d","Too many, dear.","A",1],["d","Come on, mom. I love this juice.","B",1],["d","Put back six, please.","A",1],["d","OK. Can I take some candy?","B",1],["d","Next time, dear. Help me put the groceries in the bags.","A",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["h3","Review vocabulary from S8","复习 S8 的单词",0],["p","Game: Word Scramble","游戏：字母重组",0],["li","- Put students into groups of 3-4. Each student has a set of letter cards. In each group, students mix their cards.","- 把学生分成 3–4 人一组，每位学生一套字母卡，每组学生把卡片混在一起。",0],["li","- Students have five minutes to make as many words as they can in groups using the letter cards. These words may or may not have to be words from S7 depending on what you would like to focus on.","- 学生有五分钟，在组内用字母卡拼出越多字越好。这些字是否要限定 S7 的字，看你想着重什么。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (35 mins) Lesson 1 Snack Time","课堂读本（35 分钟）第 1 课 Snack Time（点心时间）",0],["h3","1. Prediction","1. 预测",0],["li","- Have students open their books to lesson 1 and look at the pictures. Ask students to tell you what they see in the pictures.","- 让学生打开书到第 1 课看图，请学生说出图中看到什么。",0],["li","- Pre-teach new words by asking questions using the pictures. For example, teach delicious by asking the students: \"Do the cookies look delicious to you? Do you think they taste good?\" Lead the students to say: \"Yes, they look delicious to me.\"/ \"No, they don't look delicious to me.\" Teach the other new words using the same idea.","- 用图片问问题来预先教新单词。例如教 delicious 时问学生：\"Do the cookies look delicious to you? Do you think they taste good?\"，引导学生说：\"Yes, they look delicious to me.\" / \"No, they don't look delicious to me.\"。用同样方式教其他新单词。",0],["li","- Ask students to predict the story.","- 请学生预测故事内容。",0],["h3","2. Listen to the story","2. 听故事",0],["li","- Play the story on MP3. Ask students questions about the story. Ask students if their predictions were right.","- 用 MP3 播放故事，问学生关于故事的问题，问他们预测得对不对。",0],["h3","3. Reader","3. 读本",0],["li","- Play the story on the website. Students read and listen to the story silently.","- 在网站上播放故事，学生默读并听故事。",0],["li","- Play the story again. This time, pause after every sentence and ask students to repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 再播一次故事，这次每句后暂停，让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["h3","4. New words","4. 新单词",0],["li","- Students should be pretty familiar with the new words by now. To reinforce it, play the New Word' section on the website and have students repeat after it.","- 学生这时应该已经相当熟悉新单词了。为了加强，播放网站上的“New Word”部分，让学生跟着念。",0],["h3","5. Role-play","5. 角色扮演",0],["li","- Get students to form groups of 3.","- 让学生三人一组。",0],["li","- Assign the roles of Small Sally, Tiny Tom, and Fido.","- 分配 Small Sally、Tiny Tom 和 Fido 的角色。",0],["li","- Have students act the story out in groups.","- 让学生分组演出故事。",0],["li","- Have one group act out in front of the class if there is enough time.","- 时间够的话，请一组在全班面前演出。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (40 min) Lesson 1","课堂活动（40 分钟）第 1 课",0],["h2","My Birthday Plans","My Birthday Plans（我的生日计划）",0],["h2","1.1 Vocabulary","1.1 单词",0],["li","- Show the new words on the touchscreen all-in-one","- 在触控一体机上展示新单词。",0],["li","- Ask the students to try to pronounce one of the words, 'bought' for example, by applying phonics rules.","- 请学生运用自然拼读规则试着念出其中一个字，例如 'bought'。",0],["li","- Click on the word to show the picture as well as to play the sound. Have the students repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 点这个字显示图片并播放声音，让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["li","- Repeat the same procedure with the other three words.","- 其他三个字照同样程序进行。",0],["h2","1.2 Look at the picture and practice with your teacher","1.2 看图和老师练习",0],["li","- Click 1.2 on the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 在触控一体机上点 1.2。",0],["li","- Move the magnifier to Little Larry and ask students what he bought. Click to check the answer. Have students repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 把放大镜移到 Little Larry，问学生他买了什么，点击核对答案，让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["li","- Do the same with Small Sally, Tiny Tom, and Bitsy Betty.","- Small Sally、Tiny Tom 和 Bitsy Betty 也照同样方式做。",0],["h3","A. Look at the passage below with your teacher.","A. 和老师一起看下面的短文。",0],["li","- Play the passage on the website.","- 在网站上播放短文。",0],["h3","B. Answer the questions about the passage.","B. 回答关于短文的问题。",0],["li","- Play the questions on the website one by one. Have students answer as a class.","- 在网站上逐题播放问题，让全班一起回答。",0],["li","- Have the students open their books to page 9 and complete the answers individually.","- 让学生打开书到第 9 页，各自完成答案。",0],["h2","1.3 Match the questions to the correct answer.","1.3 把问题和正确的答案配对。",0],["li","- Make photocopies of page 10 and cut out boxes 1-6 and a-f into to sets of 12 cards. Put students into groups of 3-4, and each group should have one set of the cards.","- 复印第 10 页，把方格 1–6 和 a–f 剪成两组共 12 张卡片。把学生分成 3–4 人一组，每组一套卡片。",0],["li","- Ask the students to place the cards face down on the table/floor. When you say 'Start!' they turn over the cards and match the questions to the correct answers. They should shout 'Done!' when they have finished matching. Check if they have got it right. The group that finishes matching correctly first wins.","- 请学生把卡片面朝下放在桌上／地上。你说“Start!”时，他们翻开卡片把问题和正确答案配对，配对完要喊“Done!”。检查是否正确，最先正确配对完的组获胜。",0],["li","- Have the students open their books to page 10 and do the matching individually.","- 让学生打开书到第 10 页，各自做配对。",0],["h2","1.4 Choose the best answers for the questions below.","1.4 为下面的问题选出最好的答案。",0],["li","- Demonstrate the activity by doing question A as a class.","- 全班一起做 A 题来示范活动。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["li","- Have students do the rest of their questions individually in their books.","- 让学生在书上各自完成其余题目。",0],["li","- After students have all completed the exercise, check answers by having individual students click their answers on the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 学生都完成练习后，让个别学生在触控一体机上点击答案来核对。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See And Say.\"","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["h3","Context Introduction","情境介绍",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students to listen to the monolog of \"Let's See and Say\" section in lesson seven. The teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below.","老师让学生听第七课“Let's See and Say”的独白来引入本课。老师可以念出或用 MP3 播放下面的独白给全班听。",0],["h3","Monolog Of Let's See And Say","Let's See And Say 独白",0],["p","The girl is shopping with her mother at the supermarket. Let's listen to what they bought at the supermarket.","女孩和妈妈在超市购物。我们来听听她们在超市买了什么。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasise for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialogue. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialog that the students have practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialogue and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with the others. At this stage, The teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the type of conversation in the real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialog with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the book.","- 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","- Preview homework. Write a few examples on the board to make sure students know what to do.","- 预习作业。在白板上写几个例子，确定学生知道要做什么。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","- Write down the points covered in the lesson and have students copy them down in their progress reports.","- 写下本课涵盖的重点，让学生抄到进度报告上。",0],["li","- Check progress reports and give comments.","- 检查进度报告并写评语。",0]],"g":[[34,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V","Book 8","Classroom Readers","Lesson 1"]],[34,["Reader","New Words"]],[52,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V","Book 8","Classroom Activities","Lesson 1","1. 1","1.2","1.4"]],[96,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Snack Time"],"bd":"","m":110},{"z":"第 2 课","t":"Class 2","k":"class","p":[16,17,18,19],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["li","- To talk about habits","- 谈论习惯",1],["li","- To talk about frequency","- 谈论频率",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 2","Classroom Readers 第 2 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","think, just right, wear, clothes, ever, funny, ride, around, change(d)",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 8A Lesson 2","课堂活动 8A 第 2 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Usually, often, sometimes, seldom, never",null,1],["h3","Sentence patterns","句型",1],["p","Do/ Does _________ever ____________? Yes, I do/he does/she does. I/He/She usually/often/sometimes __________. No, I don't/he doesn't/she doesn't. I/He/She seldom/never _________.","Do/Does _________ ever ____________?（……曾经……吗？）Yes, I do / he does / she does. I/He/She usually/often/sometimes __________. No, I don't / he doesn't / she doesn't. I/He/She seldom/never _________.",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Counting using the Roman numeric system.","用罗马数字系统计数。",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["li","- A set of cards each of which has a new word from CR lesson 2 on it","- 一套卡片，每张写一个课堂读本第 2 课的新单词",1],["li","- Role cards: Each card has one of the characters' names on it. You may need more than one set of role cards. You will need an equal number of cards to the number of students in your class.","- 角色卡：每张卡写一个角色的名字。可能需要不只一套角色卡，卡片数量要和班上学生人数一样。",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 7","EEC 4 第 7 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Shopping cart, cashier, money, cash, register, bill, coin, pack",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","How many cans of tuna fish did you take?","A",1],["d","Seven","B",1],["d","How about drinks?","A",1],["d","Ten","B",1],["d","Too many, dear.","A",1],["d","Come on, mom. I love this juice.","B",1],["d","Put back six, please.","A",1],["d","OK. Can I take some candy?","B",1],["d","Next time, dear. Help me put the groceries in the bags. :","A",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["p","Review \"Why_____? Because ______\".","复习 \"Why_____? Because ______\"。",0],["li","- Start by asking a couple of students 'why' questions about themselves. For example:","- 一开始先问几位学生关于他们自己的 \"why\" 问题。例如：",0],["p","\"Why are you wearing sport shoes today, Tom?\" Tom's reply might be something like this: \"Because we had physical education class today.\"","\"Why are you wearing sport shoes today, Tom?\"　Tom 可能会这样回答：\"Because we had physical education class today.\"",0],["li","- Ball Drill:","- 丢球操练：",0],["p","Students ask one another questions using the sentence patterns.","学生用句型互相提问。",0],["d","\"Why ___________?\" (throwing the ball to S2)","S1",0],["d","\"Because _________.\" \"Why ___________?\" (throwing the ball to S3)","S2",0],["d","\"Because _________.\" \"Why ___________?\" (throwing the ball to S4)","S3",0],["d","...........","S4",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (25 mins) Lesson 2 Hiss! It's Fat Cat!","课堂读本（25 分钟）第 2 课 Hiss! It's Fat Cat!（嘶！是胖猫！）",0],["h3","1. Prediction","1. 预测",0],["li","- Have students open their books to lesson 2 and look at the pictures. Ask students to tell you what they see in the pictures.","- 让学生打开书到第 2 课看图，请学生说出图中看到什么。",0],["li","- Pre-teach some of the new words, think, wear, clothes, and ride, by asking questions using the pictures. For example, you can ask students what the characters are wearing and what they are doing to teach wear, clothes, and ride.","- 用图片问问题，预先教部分新单词：think、wear、clothes 和 ride。例如可以问学生角色穿什么、在做什么，来教 wear、clothes 和 ride。",0],["li","- Pre-teach \"Do you ever ____________?\" by asking students questions such as \"Do you ever play with a doll/drive a car?\"","- 问学生 \"Do you ever play with a doll / drive a car?\" 之类的问题，预先教 \"Do you ever ____________?\"。",0],["li","- Ask students to predict the story.","- 请学生预测故事内容。",0],["h3","2. Reader","2. 读本",0],["li","- Play the story on the touchscreen all-in-one. Students read and listen to the story silently. Ask students comprehension questions about the story and ask them if their predictions were right.","- 在触控一体机上播放故事，学生默读并听故事。问学生关于故事的理解问题，问他们预测得对不对。",0],["li","- Play the story again. This time, pause after every sentence and ask students to repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one. Explain the other new words, just right, funny, around, change, when they come up. Get students to guess the meaning of these words from the context first, and if they fail to guess, explain the new words with gestures, body movements, pictures or example sentences.","- 再播一次故事，这次每句后暂停，让学生跟着触控一体机念。其他新单词 just right、funny、around、change 出现时加以解释。先让学生从上下文猜意思，猜不出来再用手势、肢体动作、图片或例句解释。",0],["li","3. New words","3. 新单词",0],["li","- Students should be pretty familiar with the new words by now. To reinforce the learning of the new vocabulary, play the 'New Words' section on the touchscreen all-in-one and have students repeat after it.","- 学生这时应该已经相当熟悉新单词了。为了加强新单词的学习，在触控一体机上播放“New Words”部分，让学生跟着念。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (50 mins) Lesson 2 Do you ever go to","课堂活动（50 分钟）第 2 课 Do you ever go to",0],["h3","school late?","school late?（你曾经上学迟到吗？）",0],["h3","2.1 Vocabulary","2.1 单词",0],["li","- Show the new words on the touchscreen all-in-one","- 在触控一体机上展示新单词。",0],["li","- Ask the students to try to pronounce one of the words by applying phonics rules.","- 请学生运用自然拼读规则试着念出其中一个字。",0],["li","- Click on the word and show the picture as well as to play the sound. Have the students to repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 点这个字显示图片并播放声音，让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["li","- Ask students the question: \"Do you ever go to school late?\" and elicit answers using the structure: \"Yes, I do. I usually/often/sometimes __________.\" Or \"No, I don't. I seldom/never _________.\"","- 问学生：\"Do you ever go to school late?\"，引导他们用这个结构回答：\"Yes, I do. I usually/often/sometimes __________.\" 或 \"No, I don't. I seldom/never _________.\"",0],["h3","2.2 Look at the chart and practice with your teacher.","2.2 看表和老师练习。",0],["li","- Have students open their books to page 12. Ask students to make sentences according to the chart, e.g. \"Tiny Tom usually goes to school late.\"","- 让学生打开书到第 12 页，请学生依表格造句，例如 \"Tiny Tom usually goes to school late.\"",0],["li","- Click 2.2 on the touchscreen all-in-one and read as a class.","- 在触控一体机上点 2.2，全班一起念。",0],["h3","2.3 Look at the chart and practice the dialogues.","2.3 看表练习对话。",0],["li","- Assign a role card to each of the students.","- 发给每位学生一张角色卡。",0],["li","- Go to 2.3 on the touchscreen all-in-one and demonstrate the activity by doing question 1 yourself. You should have a card with 'Tiny Tom' on it at this point.","- 进到触控一体机上的 2.3，自己做第 1 题来示范活动。这时你手上应该拿着写有“Tiny Tom”的卡片。",0],["li","- Show the students your card and say: \"I am Tiny Tom.\" and then look at the chart in 2.2. Answer the question: \"Yes, I do. I usually go to school late.\"","- 给学生看你的卡片并说 \"I am Tiny Tom.\"，然后看 2.2 的表，回答问题：\"Yes, I do. I usually go to school late.\"",0],["li","- Click Answer in 2.3 and check the answer.","- 点 2.3 的 Answer 核对答案。",0],["li","- Tell the students that they will answer the questions according to the chart in 2.2 as they","- 告诉学生，他们要依手上的卡片，根据 2.2 的表",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","have the cards in their hands. For example, in Question 1, the students who have 'Tiny Tom' should answer: \"Yes, I do. I usually go to school late.\", whereas the rest of the students should reply: \"Yes, he does. He usually goes to school late.\"","回答问题。例如第 1 题，拿“Tiny Tom”卡的学生要回答：\"Yes, I do. I usually go to school late.\"，其他学生则回答：\"Yes, he does. He usually goes to school late.\"",0],["li","- Do Question 2 as a class to check understanding.","- 全班一起做第 2 题，确认大家都懂。",0],["li","- Continue with the rest of the questions on the touchscreen all-in-one. Students should reply accordingly. After they've finished their answers to each question, play the answer on the touchscreen all-in-one and have the students repeat after it.","- 在触控一体机上继续做其他题目，学生依此回答。每题答完后在触控一体机上播放答案，让学生跟着念。",0],["h3","2.4 Make questions for the answers below.","2.4 为下面的答案写出问题。",0],["li","- Have students open their book to page 15","- 让学生打开书到第 15 页。",0],["li","- Demonstrate how to do the exercise by doing Question 1 as a class.","- 全班一起做第 1 题，示范怎么做练习。",0],["li","- Students complete the questions individually. Walk around the room and monitor.","- 学生各自完成问题。在教室里走动观察。",0],["li","- Check answers on the website.","- 在网站上核对答案。",0],["h3","Activity Sheet 1","活动单 1",0],["li","- Have students look at activity 1 on their activity sheet.","- 让学生看活动单上的活动 1。",0],["li","- Ask the students to draw at least 5 places in on the map.","- 请学生在地图上画出至少 5 个地点。",0],["li","- After they have finished drawing, ask students to show their drawing to the class. Ask individual students: \"Do you ever eat at the Mall ?\" based on what they have drawn.","- 画完后请学生向全班展示，依他们画的内容问个别学生：\"Do you ever eat at the Mall?\"",0],["li","- Ask the students to do one more activity on the sheet. They make sentences to talk about frequency. For example, \"I often play at school.\"","- 请学生再做活动单上的另一个活动：造句谈论频率，例如 \"I often play at school.\"",0],["h3","2.5 Write the opposites for the words below.","2.5 写出下面单词的相反词。",0],["li","- Write examples of opposites on the board (long/short. fat/thin). Elicit more examples from students.","- 在白板上写相反词的例子（long/short、fat/thin），引导学生说出更多例子。",0],["li","- Write the words in the book on the board. Ask students to tell you the opposites of the words and have individuals write their answers on the board.","- 把书上的字写在白板上，请学生说出它们的相反词，让个别学生到白板写答案。",0],["li","- Erase the words on the board. Have students open their books to page 16 and complete the exercise individually.","- 擦掉白板上的字，让学生打开书到第 16 页各自完成练习。",0],["h3","2.6 Practice the pronunciation and fill in the blanks.","2.6 练习发音并填空。",0],["li","- Read the words as a class and then have the students do the exercise individually.","- 全班一起念这些字，再让学生各自做练习。",0],["li","- After they have finished the exercise, have individual students type their answers on the touchscreen all-in-one to check answers.","- 做完后让个别学生在触控一体机上输入答案来核对。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","To start the class","开始上课",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Bill and Sam are shopping. Listen and connect the shopping list to the finger","Bill 和 Sam 正在购物。听一听，把购物清单和手指数字手势",0],["h3","symbols.","连起来。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog of \"Let's Check\" section as the introduction of the second listening exercise, as indicated below.","播放 Let's Check 部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导，如下。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","Monolog Of Let's Check:","Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","What can we see in the supermarket? We can see shopping carts, the check -out counter, cashiers, money, cash registers and bills. Please turn to page 30. Let's check. Bill and Sam are shopping. Listen and connect the shopping list to the finger symbols.","我们在超市可以看到什么？可以看到购物车、结账柜台、收银员、钱、收银机和纸钞。请翻到第 30 页。Let's check。Bill 和 Sam 正在购物。听一听，把购物清单和手指数字手势连起来。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["li","- Review / point out the key words to the class in the listening exercise.","- 向全班复习／指出听力练习中的关键字。",0],["li","- Explain the exercise to the students and make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise while listening to the MP3.","- 向学生说明练习方式，确定说明够清楚，让学生能一边听 MP3 一边做练习。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","继续为全班播放 MP3 做听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teachers can play the dialog to the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the book.","- 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","- Preview homework. Write a few examples on the board to make sure students know what to do.","- 预习作业。在白板上写几个例子，确定学生知道要做什么。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","- Write down the points covered in the lesson and have students copy them down in their progress reports.","- 写下本课涵盖的重点，让学生抄到进度报告上。",0],["li","- Check progress reports and give comments.","- 检查进度报告并写评语。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 1","电话教学教材 1",0],["li","1. Are you happy?","1. Are you happy?（你开心吗？）",0],["li","2. Why were you late for school?","2. Why were you late for school?（你上学为什么迟到？）",0],["li","3. Do you ever borrow a book from the library?","3. Do you ever borrow a book from the library?（你曾经向图书馆借书吗？）",0],["li","4. Do you ever have steak for dinner?","4. Do you ever have steak for dinner?（你晚餐曾经吃牛排吗？）",0],["li","5. Why do you want some money?","5. Why do you want some money?（你为什么想要钱？）",0]],"g":[[30,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶"]],[41,["Lesson V","Book 8","Classroom Reader","Lesson 2","Reader","New Words"]],[52,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V","Book 8","Classroom Activities","Lesson 2","2.1","2.2","2.3","2.4","2.6"]],[110,["● Follow the same","steps above"]]],"tp":["Hiss! It's Fat Cat!","Do you ever go to"],"bd":"","m":110},{"z":"第 3 课","t":"Class 3","k":"class","p":[20,21,22],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["li","- To talk about possessions using possessive pronouns mine, yours, his, hers and ours.","- 用所有格代词 mine、yours、his、hers 和 ours 谈论所有物。",1],["li","- To make an apology","- 道歉",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 8A Lesson 3","课堂活动 8A 第 3 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","excuse me, show, same, made a mistake, silly",null,1],["h3","Sentence patterns","句型",1],["p","This _______ is mine/yours/his/hers/ours. Is this _______ mine/yours/his/hers/ours?","This _______ is mine/yours/his/hers/ours.（这个……是我的／你的／他的／她的／我们的。）Is this _______ mine/yours/his/hers/ours?",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Counting using the Roman numeric system","用罗马数字系统计数",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["li","- A bag","- 一个袋子",1],["li","- Photocopies of the passage on CA page 22 and a set of cards, each of which has a word from the box on page 22 on it","- 课堂活动第 22 页短文的复印件，以及一套卡片，每张写一个第 22 页框中的字",1],["h3","EEC4 Lesson 7","EEC4 第 7 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Shopping cart, cashier, money, cash, register, bill, coin, pack",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","How many cans of tuna fish did you take?","A",1],["d","Seven","B",1],["d","How about drinks?","A",1],["d","Ten","B",1],["d","Too many, dear.","A",1],["d","Come on, mom. I love this juice.","B",1],["d","Put back six, please.","A",1],["d","OK. Can I take some candy?","B",1],["d","Next time, dear. Help me put the groceries in the bags.","A",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (25 mins)","热身（25 分钟）",0],["p","Review possessive adjectives my, your, his, her; and our; introduce possessive pronouns mine, yours, his, hers and ours. Activity: Whose ____is this?","复习所有格形容词 my、your、his、her 和 our；介绍所有格代词 mine、yours、his、hers 和 ours。活动：Whose ____ is this?（这是谁的……？）",0],["li","- Have a bag ready. The bag has to be one that is not see-through. Ask students to put in one of their belongings each into this bag without anyone else seeing what it is that they put in.","- 准备一个不透明的袋子。请学生各放一样自己的东西进袋子，不让别人看到放了什么。",0],["li","- Take one of the things out of the bag and have students guess whose belonging it is by asking: \"Whose _____ is it?\" Encourage students to guess by saying: \"I think it's his/her ________.\" while pointing at that person.","- 从袋子里拿出一样东西，让学生问 \"Whose _____ is it?\" 来猜是谁的。鼓励学生指着那个人说：\"I think it's his/her ________.\"",0],["li","- After students have made their guesses, ask individual students: \"Is this yours?\" They reply: \"No, it's not mine.\" or \"Yes, it's mine.\" accordingly. As a variation, you could also ask the class: \"Whose _____ is this?\" The student who possesses this object should reply: \"It's mine.\" Give that object back to the student.","- 学生猜完后，问个别学生：\"Is this yours?\"，他们依实际情况回答：\"No, it's not mine.\" 或 \"Yes, it's mine.\"。也可以变化一下问全班：\"Whose _____ is this?\"，拥有这样东西的学生要回答：\"It's mine.\"，然后把东西还给他。",0],["li","- Have the class repeat after you: \"It's his/hers.\" The students who made the correct guess scores a point.","- 让全班跟着你说：\"It's his/hers.\"，猜对的学生得一分。",0],["li","- Continue with other objects in the bag until all the belongings are out of the bag and are returned to their owners.","- 继续拿出袋子里的其他东西，直到所有物品都拿出来并还给主人。",0],["li","- Ask students some more questions to practice: \"It's/They're mine/yours/his/hers/ours.\"","- 再问学生一些问题来练习：\"It's/They're mine/yours/his/hers/ours.\"",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (60 mins) Lesson 3","课堂活动（60 分钟）第 3 课",0],["h3","3.1 Vocabulary","3.1 单词",0],["li","- Introduce the new words using the website.","- 用网站介绍新单词。",0],["li","- Ask the students to try to pronounce one of the words by applying phonics rules.","- 请学生运用自然拼读规则试着念出其中一个字。",0],["li","- Click the word and show the picture as well as to play the sound. Have the stu dents repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 点这个字显示图片并播放声音，让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["li","- Continue with the rest of the new words.","- 其余新单词照同样方式进行。",0],["h3","3.2 Choose two partners and practice the dialogue below.","3.2 选两位伙伴练习下面的对话。",0],["li","- Play the dialogue on MP3. Have the students listen silently.","- 用 MP3 播放对话，让学生安静听。",0],["li","- Ask students questions about the dialogue.","- 问学生关于对话的问题。",0],["li","- Play the dialogue again on the touchscreen all-in-one, pause after every sentence and have students repeat after it.","- 在触控一体机上再播一次对话，每句后暂停，让学生跟着念。",0],["li","- Put students into groups of 3 and assign roles of Bitsy Betty, Small Sally and Woman. Students practice the dialogue in groups.","- 把学生分成三人一组，分配 Bitsy Betty、Small Sally 和 Woman 的角色，分组练习对话。",0],["li","- Practice the dialogue again using the 'Look up and Say' technique. A student looks at the line he/she needs to say next and then looks up and says the line while maintaining eye contact with the person he/she is supposed to be speaking to.","- 用“抬头说”技巧再练习一次对话：学生先看下一句要说的台词，再抬头看着说话对象，保持眼神接触说出台词。",0],["h3","3.3 Arrange the sentences in correct order.","3.3 把句子排成正确的顺序。",0],["li","- Have students open their book and complete the exercise individually.","- 让学生打开书各自完成练习。",0],["li","- Check the answers on the website.","- 在网站上核对答案。",0],["h3","Activity Sheet 2","活动单 2",0],["li","- Pair-work. Ask students to compare what they have in their school bags in pairs. For example, ask them to put their pencil cases together and say \"This pencil case is mine, and that pencil case is yours.\"","- 两人一组。请学生两两比较书包里的东西，例如把铅笔盒放在一起说 \"This pencil case is mine, and that pencil case is yours.\"",0],["li","- They draw 4 things they both have on their worksheets and write sentences.","- 他们在练习纸上画出两人都有的 4 样东西并写句子。",0],["h3","3.4 Fill in the blanks with the given words.","3.4 用提供的字填空。",0],["li","- Give each group one photocopy of the passage on page 22.","- 每组发一张第 22 页短文的复印件。",0],["li","- Stick the word cards on the wall around the classroom.","- 把单词卡贴在教室四周的墙上。",0],["li","- When you say \"Go!\", students go around the room and look at the words on the wall and try to fill in the blanks on the photocopied sheet using the words they see.","- 你说“Go!”时，学生在教室里走动看墙上的字，用看到的字填写复印件上的空格。",0],["li","- When they have finished, check answers on the website.","- 完成后在网站上核对答案。",0],["li","- The groups that have done it correctly score a point.","- 做对的组得一分。",0],["li","- Have students open their books and complete the exercise individually.","- 让学生打开书各自完成练习。",0],["li","- Play the passage on the touchscreen all-in-one and have students repeat after it.","- 在触控一体机上播放短文，让学生跟着念。",0],["h3","3.5 Answer the questions below according to the previous passage.","3.5 根据上一篇短文回答下面的问题。",0],["h3","Quiz","小测验",0],["li","- Demonstrate the activity by doing Question 1 as a class.","- 全班一起做第 1 题来示范活动。",0],["li","- Put students into 2 teams.","- 把学生分成 2 队。",0],["li","- Have one student from each team stand up. Play Question 2 on the touchscreen all-in-one. These two students should answer the question as fast as they can. The one who does it correctly and faster scores one point for his/her team.","- 每队派一位学生站起来，在触控一体机上播放第 2 题，这两位学生要尽快回答，答对又较快的人为自己的队伍得一分。",0],["li","- Another student from each team stands up. Play the answer to Question 3 and continue the game.","- 每队再派一位学生站起来，播放第 3 题的答案，继续游戏。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["li","- Have students open their book to page 23 and complete the questions individually.","- 让学生打开书到第 23 页各自完成题目。",0],["h2","EEC (15mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the suitable place for their performance. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation about what they can do to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生依照自己的表现在适当的位置打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group to do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease in terms of achieving the functional goals of this lesson. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation. Please refer to the appendix for the MP3 script and answers of \"Let's Check\" section.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，达到本课的功能目标，同时注意学生的发音和语调。注意：“Let's Check”部分的 MP3 对话稿和答案请参考附录。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the book.","- 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","- Preview homework. Write a few examples on the board to make sure students know what to do.","- 预习作业。在白板上写几个例子，确定学生知道要做什么。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","- Write down the points covered in the lesson and have students copy them down in their progress reports.","- 写下本课涵盖的重点，让学生抄到进度报告上。",0],["li","- Check progress reports and give comments.","- 检查进度报告并写评语。",0]],"g":[[36,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V","Book 8","Classroom Activities","Lesson 3","3.1","3.2","3.3","3.4","3.5"]],[78,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":110},{"z":"第 4 课","t":"Class 4","k":"class","p":[23,24,25,26],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["li","- To review the language learned in Class 1, 2 and 3.","- 复习第 1、2、3 堂课学过的语言。",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 8A Lesson 4","课堂活动 8A 第 4 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","None","无",1],["h3","Sentence patterns","句型",1],["p","Why was/were/did ___________? Because _______________. Do/Does ________ever ________? It's mine/yours/his/hers/ours.","Why was/were/did ___________? Because _______________.　Do/Does ________ ever ________?　It's mine/yours/his/hers/ours.",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Be able to talk about a race with friends","能和朋友谈论一场比赛",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["li","- A photocopy of page 27. Cut out boxes 1-6 and a-f.","- 第 27 页的复印件，剪下方格 1–6 和 a–f。",1],["li","- Verb phrase cards, each of which has one of the following verb phrases on it: eat hamburger for lunch, go to school late, swim in winter, borrow books from the library, go home/to school by taxi, eat in class, etc.","- 动词短语卡，每张写一个下列动词短语：eat hamburger for lunch、go to school late、swim in winter、borrow books from the library、go home / to school by taxi、eat in class 等。",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 8","EEC 4 第 8 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["li","-pig, sheep, cow, bull, donkey, chick, horse, goat, overall.",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","I can catch more chicks than you.","A",1],["d","I don't think so.","B",1],["d","Let's have a race.","A",1],["d","Alright!","B",1],["p","N:( Few minutes later, they come back with some chicks.)","N：（几分钟后，他们带着几只小鸡回来。）",1],["d","How many chicks did you catch?","A",1],["d","12. How many did you catch? 12?","B",1],["d","14.","A",1],["d","14? How did you catch so many?","B",1],["d","I've put some in my overalls.","A",1],["d","I want another chance.","B",1],["d","Really? OK, let's start again.","A",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["p","Review vocabulary from Class 1-3: Put the letters in the right order","复习第 1–3 堂课的单词：把字母排成正确的顺序",0],["li","- Choose some of the words from class 1-3, mix up the letters and write them on the board, e.g. \"ryacno\" (crayon), and \"ldoiuecsi\" (delicious).","- 从第 1–3 堂课选几个字，把字母打乱写在白板上，例如 \"ryacno\"（crayon）和 \"ldoiuecsi\"（delicious）。",0],["li","- Put students into groups of 3-4. They try to figure out what the words are and put the letters in the right order on a piece of paper.","- 把学生分成 3–4 人一组，让他们想出这些字是什么，并在纸上把字母排成正确的顺序。",0],["li","- The group which have done so correctly first wins the game.","- 最先正确完成的组赢得游戏。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (75 mins) Lesson 4 Why is Teeny","课堂活动（75 分钟）第 4 课 Why is Teeny",0],["h2","Tina Unhappy?","Tina Unhappy?（Teeny Tina 为什么不开心？）",0],["h3","4.1 Solve the puzzle and fill in the blanks.","4.1 解谜并填空。",0],["li","- Point to some of the students' or your own belongings and ask: \"Whose _____ is this?\" Elicit answers: \"It's mine/yours/his/hers/ours.\"","- 指着几位学生或你自己的东西问：\"Whose _____ is this?\"，引导回答：\"It's mine/yours/his/hers/ours.\"",0],["li","- Use the website. Ask students to look at the objects on the touchscreen all-in-one. Ask them which objects they think belong to Small Sally by saying: \"I think the _______is/are Small Sally's\".","- 使用网站。请学生看触控一体机上的物品，问他们认为哪些东西属于 Small Sally，让他们说：\"I think the _______ is/are Small Sally's.\"",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["li","- Pair-work: In pairs, students write down their guesses on a piece of paper. Encourage them to discuss their answers by saying \"I think the _______is/are ______'s\".","- 两人一组：学生两两把猜测写在纸上，鼓励他们用 \"I think the _______ is/are ______'s.\" 讨论答案。",0],["li","- Check answers using the website and ask each pair how many of the items they guessed right.","- 用网站核对答案，问每组猜对几样。",0],["li","- Have students open their books to page 24. Have them look at the pictures and make sentences about each picture. For example: \"She is Small Sally. This storybook is hers.\"","- 让学生打开书到第 24 页，看图为每张图造句。例如：\"She is Small Sally. This storybook is hers.\"",0],["li","- Have the students do the exercise on page 25 individually.","- 让学生各自做第 25 页的练习。",0],["li","- Check answers using the website.","- 用网站核对答案。",0],["h3","4.2 Look at the pictures and answer the questions","4.2 看图回答问题",0],["li","- Write on the board a) happening right now, b) true in general; happens sometimes or all the time, and c) has already taken place","- 在白板上写 a) 正在发生、b) 一般事实；有时或一直发生、c) 已经发生。",0],["li","- Have the students look at the pictures on the website and decide which pictures show something that is a) happening right now, which ones show something that is b) true in general or happens sometimes or all the time and which ones c) has already taken place.","- 让学生看网站上的图，判断哪些图表示 a) 正在发生的事，哪些表示 b) 一般事实或有时／一直发生的事，哪些是 c) 已经发生的事。",0],["li","- Go through the questions one by one with the students. Make sure they can use the correct tenses.","- 和学生逐题讨论，确定他们能用正确的时态。",0],["li","- Have the students do the exercise individually. Walk around the classroom and monitor.","- 让学生各自做练习。在教室里走动观察。",0],["h3","4.3 Practice the dialogue below.","4.3 练习下面的对话。",0],["h3","Activity A \"Do you ever...?\"","活动 A \"Do you ever...?\"（你曾经……吗？）",0],["li","- Have cards with verb phrases on them ready before the lesson. These phrases can include: eat hamburger for lunch, go to school late, swim in winter, borrow books from the library, go home by taxi, eat in class, etc.","- 上课前准备好写有动词短语的卡片，短语可以包括：eat hamburger for lunch、go to school late、swim in winter、borrow books from the library、go home by taxi、eat in class 等。",0],["li","- Write adverbs of frequency on the board.","- 把频率副词写在白板上。",0],["li","- Have Student A come to the front and pick one of the cards. He then asks Student B one \"Do you ever _____?\" question using the verb phrase on the card. Student B then replies using one of the adverbs of frequency on the board. For example, \"No, I seldom ______.\"","- 让学生 A 到前面抽一张卡，用卡上的动词短语问学生 B 一个 \"Do you ever _____?\" 问题。学生 B 用白板上的一个频率副词回答，例如 \"No, I seldom ______.\"",0],["li","- Remind the students that they can only use \"seldom\" and \"never\" in conjunction with a 'no' reply.","- 提醒学生 \"seldom\" 和 \"never\" 只能搭配 \"no\" 的回答。",0],["li","- Student B then picks another card and asks Student C a question using the verb phrase on his/her card.","- 接着学生 B 再抽一张卡，用卡上的动词短语问学生 C。",0],["li","- Continue until all students have had a turn asking and answering questions.","- 持续进行直到所有学生都轮过提问和回答。",0],["h3","Activity B Find your partner","活动 B 找伙伴",0],["li","- Make a photocopy of the page and cut out boxes 1-6 and a-f. Give each student one of the boxes.","- 复印这一页，剪下方格 1–6 和 a–f，每位学生发一个方格。",0],["li","- When you say 'Go!' a student should go around the room looking for his/her \"partner\" - the one who has the answer to his/her question or the one who has the question of his/her answer.","- 你说“Go!”时，学生在教室里走动找自己的“伙伴”——拥有自己问题答案的人，或拥有自己答案问题的人。",0],["li","- Students sit down once they have found their \"partners\".","- 找到“伙伴”后就坐下。",0],["li","- Have students read their questions and answers out to the class.","- 让学生向全班念出问题和答案。",0],["li","- Check answers using the website.","- 用网站核对答案。",0],["li","- Have the students open their books to page 10 and do the matching individually.","- 让学生打开书到第 10 页，各自做配对。",0],["h3","4.4 Fill in the blanks and answer one question using circled letters.","4.4 填空，并用圈起来的字母回答一个问题。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["li","- Explain to the students that they need to use the circled letters to fill in the blanks in the sentence at the right-bottom corner of the page.","- 向学生说明，他们要用圈起来的字母填写页面右下角句子中的空格。",0],["li","- Put students into groups of 3-4. When you say \"Go! The students should try to complete the puzzle in groups and write the sentence they have figured out on the board.","- 把学生分成 3–4 人一组。你说“Go!”时，学生分组完成谜题，并把解出的句子写在白板上。",0],["li","- The group who writes the correct sentence on the board first wins the game.","- 最先在白板上写出正确句子的组赢得游戏。",0],["h3","4.5 Circle the correct verb and write the correct tense in the blank.","4.5 圈出正确的动词，并在空格写出正确的时态。",0],["li","- Have students do the exercise individually. Walk around the classroom and monitor.","- 让学生各自做练习。在教室里走动观察。",0],["h3","4.6 Look at the verb chart below and practice with your teacher.","4.6 看下面的动词表并和老师练习。",0],["li","- Drill the verbs in the chart with students.","- 和学生操练表中的动词。",0],["li","- Say: \"ask\" and \"right now\", and then make a present continuous sentence such as \"He is asking the teacher a question right now.\" Say \"yesterday\", and make a sentence: \"He asked the teacher a question yesterday\"","- 说 \"ask\" 和 \"right now\"，再造一个现在进行时的句子，例如 \"He is asking the teacher a question right now.\"。说 \"yesterday\"，再造句：\"He asked the teacher a question yesterday.\"",0],["li","- Say \"answer\", \"right now\" and encourage students to make present continuous sentences with these two words. Say \"yesterday\", and encourage students to make past tense sentences with \"answer\" and \"yesterday\".","- 说 \"answer\"、\"right now\"，鼓励学生用这两个字造现在进行时的句子。说 \"yesterday\"，鼓励学生用 \"answer\" 和 \"yesterday\" 造过去时的句子。",0],["li","- Continue with other verbs in the chart.","- 表中其他动词照同样方式进行。",0],["h3","4.7 Sing along with your teacher.","4.7 跟着老师一起唱。",0],["li","- Play the song using the website.","- 用网站播放歌曲。",0],["li","- Play the game 'Musical Chairs\".","- 玩“大风吹（抢椅子）”游戏。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["p","Motivation:","导入：",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See And Say.\"","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["h3","Context Introduction","情境介绍",0],["p","Teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students to listen to the monolog of \"Let's See And Say\" section in lesson eight. Teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's See And Say:","老师让学生听第 5 课“Let's See and Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听，如下所示。Let's See And Say 独白：",0],["p","Simon and Lily had a race on the farm. Do you know what they did and who won the race? Let's check it out. Listen to the conversation carefully.","Simon 和 Lily 在农场比赛。你知道他们做了什么、谁赢了吗？我们来看看。仔细听对话。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasise for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students to repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialog that the students have practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with the others. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the type of conversation in the real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialog with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the book.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Preview homework. Write a few examples on the board to make sure students know what to do. .","预习作业。在白板上写几个例子，确定学生知道要做什么。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write down the points covered in the lesson and have students copy them down in their progress reports.","(1) 写下本课涵盖的重点，让学生抄到进度报告上。",0],["li","(2) Check progress reports and give comments.","(2) 检查进度报告并写评语。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 2","电话教学教材 2",0],["li","1. Did small Sally make a mistake?","1. Did Small Sally make a mistake?（Small Sally 犯错了吗？）",0],["li","2. Was she a silly girl?","2. Was she a silly girl?（她是个傻女孩吗？）",0],["li","3. Were the umbrellas the same?","3. Were the umbrellas the same?（那些雨伞一样吗？）",0],["li","4. Do you ever make a mistake?","4. Do you ever make a mistake?（你曾经犯错吗？）",0],["li","5. Are you ever a silly girl/boy?","5. Are you ever a silly girl/boy?（你曾经是个傻女孩／傻男孩吗？）",0]],"g":[[35,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 8","Classroom Activities","Lesson 4"]],[35,["4.1","4.2","4.3","4.7"]],[35,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V","Book 8","Classroom Activities","Lesson 4","4.1"]],[98,["● Follow the same","steps above"]]],"tp":["Why is Teeny"],"bd":"","m":110},{"z":"第 5 课","t":"Class 5","k":"class","p":[27,28,29,30],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["li","- To talk about animals in the zoo.","- 谈论动物园里的动物。",1],["li","- To learn the use of some/any","- 学习 some/any 的用法",1],["li","- To review the present, past and future tenses","- 复习现在时、过去时和将来时",1],["h3","Classroom Reader Lesson 3","课堂读本第 3 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","drive/drove, chase(d), growl(ed), bite/bit, ouch",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 8A Lesson 5","课堂活动 8A 第 5 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Polar bear, zebra, kangaroo, seal",null,1],["h3","Sentence patterns","句型",1],["p","Was/Were there any _______? Yes, there was/were. There was/were some __________. No, there weren't/wasn't. There wasn't/weren't any _________. Did _________ any _________? Yes, ____ did. ________some ___________. No, _____ didn't. _________any _________.",null,1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Be able to talk about a race with friends","能和朋友谈论一场比赛",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["li","- A ball","- 一颗球",1],["li","- Question cards and answer cards made for Activity 5.3 on page 35.","- 为第 35 页活动 5.3 制作的问题卡和答案卡。",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 8","EEC 4 第 8 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","pig, sheep, cow, bull, donkey, chick, horse, goat, overall.",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","I can catch more chicks than you.","A",1],["d","I don't think so.","B",1],["d","Let's have a race.","A",1],["d","Alright!","B",1],["p","N:( Few minutes later, they come back with some chicks.)","N：（几分钟后，他们带着几只小鸡回来。）",1],["d","How many chicks did you catch?","A",1],["d","12. How many did you catch? 12?","B",1],["d","14.","A",1],["d","14? How did you catch so many?","B",1],["d","I've put some in my overalls.","A",1],["d","I want another chance.","B",1],["d","Really? OK, let's start again.","A",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["p","Re-tell the Story","重述故事",0],["li","- Write the following words on the board, and ask the students to say the words. cookies, milk, snack, hungry, delicious, wet, play room, toys, doll house, right for us, change, ride, around","- 把下列单词写在白板上，请学生念出来：cookies、milk、snack、hungry、delicious、wet、play room、toys、doll house、right for us、change、ride、around",0],["li","- Have the students look at lesson 1 and 2 in the Classroom Reader. Ask them if they still remember the story. Tell them that they are going to tell you the story in a minute. Let the students look at the two previous lessons for a minute or two.","- 让学生看课堂读本第 1 和第 2 课，问他们是否还记得故事。告诉他们等一下要把故事讲给你听，让学生看前两课一两分钟。",0],["li","- Have students close their books and look at the board. Tell them that they should include the words on the board in their stories.","- 让学生合上书看白板，告诉他们故事中要用到白板上的字。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["li","- Hold a ball in your hands and start the story yourself by saying: \"Small Sally, Tiny Tom and Fido come to the house and they see some cookies on the table.\" Throw the ball to Student A, and he/she should continue the story and he must say the word milk before he/she can pass the ball to Student B.","- 你手上拿着球，自己先开始说故事：\"Small Sally, Tiny Tom and Fido come to the house and they see some cookies on the table.\"。把球丢给学生 A，他／她要接着说故事，而且要说到 milk 这个字才能把球传给学生 B。",0],["li","- Continue the story-telling until all the words on the board have been used and the stories from lesson 1 and 2 have been completed.","- 持续说故事，直到白板上的字都用过，第 1、2 课的故事都说完为止。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (30 mins) Lesson 3 Who's Stupid","课堂读本（30 分钟）第 3 课 Who's Stupid",0],["h2","Now, Fat Cat?","Now, Fat Cat?（胖猫，现在谁才是笨蛋？）",0],["h3","1. Prediction","1. 预测",0],["li","- Have students open their books to lesson 3 and look at the pictures. Ask students to predict what will happen in today's story.","- 让学生打开书到第 3 课看图，请学生预测今天的故事会发生什么事。",0],["li","- Pre-teach new words by asking questions about the pictures. For example, teach drove by asking the students: \"What did Tiny Tom and Small Sally do when they saw Fat Cat?\" Lead the students to say: \"The drove the car out of the room.\" Teach the other new words using the same idea.","- 用图片问问题预先教新单词。例如教 drove 时问学生：\"What did Tiny Tom and Small Sally do when they saw Fat Cat?\"，引导学生说：\"They drove the car out of the room.\"。用同样方式教其他新单词。",0],["h3","2. Listen to the story","2. 听故事",0],["li","- Play the story on MP3. Ask students questions about the story. Ask students if their predictions were right.","- 用 MP3 播放故事，问学生关于故事的问题，问他们预测得对不对。",0],["h3","3. Reader","3. 读本",0],["li","- Play the story again on the website.","- 在网站上再播一次故事。",0],["li","- Pause after every sentence. Ask the students to repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 每句后暂停，让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["h3","4. New words","4. 新单词",0],["li","- Students should be pretty familiar with the new words by now. To reinforce it, play the 'New Word' section on the website and have students repeat after it.","- 学生这时应该已经相当熟悉新单词了。为了加强，播放网站上的“New Word”部分，让学生跟着念。",0],["li","- Have students make sentences with the new words.","- 让学生用新单词造句。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (55 mins) Lesson 5","课堂活动（55 分钟）第 5 课",0],["h3","5.1 Vocabulary","5.1 单词",0],["li","- Show the new words on the touchscreen all-in-one","- 在触控一体机上展示新单词。",0],["li","- Ask the students to try to pronounce one of the words by applying phonics rules.","- 请学生运用自然拼读规则试着念出其中一个字。",0],["li","- Click on the word to show the picture and then play the sound. Have the students to repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 点这个字显示图片，再播放声音，让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["li","- Do the same with other words.","- 其他字照同样方式进行。",0],["h3","5.2 Look at the picture and practice with your teacher.","5.2 看图和老师练习。",0],["li","- Look at the picture on the website. Tell the students that Tiny Tom and Small Sally went to the zoo on Saturday. Ask students what they see in the picture. Move the magnifier for students to focus on different animals. Elicit: \"There were some _______.\"","- 看网站上的图。告诉学生 Tiny Tom 和 Small Sally 星期六去了动物园，问学生在图中看到什么。移动放大镜让学生注意不同的动物，引导说出：\"There were some _______.\"",0],["li","- Ask students questions using the structure: \"Where there any ______?\" Elicit answers:","- 用 \"Were there any ______?\" 的结构问学生问题，引导回答：",0],["p","\"Yes, there were. There were some _______.\" or \" No, there weren't. There weren't any _______.\"","\"Yes, there were. There were some _______.\" 或 \"No, there weren't. There weren't any _______.\"",0],["h3","5.2 A",null,0],["li","- Use the website.","- 使用网站。",0],["li","- Click on the question numbers to play the questions.","- 点题号播放问题。",0],["li","- Call on individual students to say the answers. Check the answers by clicking the","- 叫个别学生说出答案。点",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","brown ant.","棕色蚂蚁核对答案。",0],["h3","Quiz show","问答秀",0],["li","- Have students each write 3 questions about the zoo on cards using the structure \"Were there any ________?\"","- 让每位学生用 \"Were there any ________?\" 的结构在卡片上写 3 个关于动物园的问题。",0],["li","- Collect the question cards after they have finished writing.","- 写完后收回问题卡。",0],["li","- Play the game. Put students into two teams. Pick one question card from the pile and read out the question. Each time you read out a question, there should be only one student from each team who plays the game. They should say the answer as fast as they can. The one who answers in the correct form faster scores one pint for his/her team.","- 开始游戏。把学生分成两队，从卡堆中抽一张问题卡念出问题。每念一题，每队只派一位学生参加，要尽快说出答案，用正确形式回答又较快的人为自己的队伍得一分。",0],["h3","5.2 B",null,0],["li","- Have the students turn their book to page 34 and complete the exercise individually.","- 让学生把书翻到第 34 页各自完成练习。",0],["li","- Check the answers using the website.","- 用网站核对答案。",0],["h3","5.3 Make questions for the answers below.","5.3 为下面的答案写出问题。",0],["h3","Find Your Partner","找伙伴",0],["li","- Make one card each for the following questions:","- 为下列每个问题各做一张卡：",0],["p","\"Are there any students in the room?\" \"Is she a student?\" \"Do you like cookies?\" \"Does she like cookies?\" \"Did you have some soda?\" \"Did they have some soda?\" \"Was there any juice on the table?\" \"Will she have some juice?\"",null,0],["li","- Make one card each for the following answers:","- 为下列每个答案各做一张卡：",0],["p","\"Yes, there are.\" \"Yes, she is.\" \"No, I don't.\" \"No, she doesn't.\" \"Yes, I did.\" \"No, they didn't\" \"No, there wasn't\" \"Yes, she will.\"","\"Yes, there are.\" \"Yes, she is.\" \"No, I don't.\" \"No, she doesn't.\" \"Yes, I did.\" \"No, they didn't.\" \"No, there wasn't.\" \"Yes, she will.\"",0],["li","- Give each student one of the cards and make sure that there is one answer card to go with one question card.","- 每位学生发一张卡，确定每张问题卡都有一张对应的答案卡。",0],["li","- When you say \"Go!\" A student should walk around the room and find the answer to his/her question or the question of his/her answer. The students should sit down together once they have found their \"partners\".","- 你说“Go!”时，学生在教室里走动，找自己问题的答案或自己答案的问题，找到“伙伴”后一起坐下。",0],["li","- Have students display their cards to the class. Have the students read the questions and answer as a class. After each question and answer , encourage students to extend the answer. For example, \"Is she a student?\" \"Yes, she is. She is a student.\"","- 让学生向全班展示卡片，全班一起念出问题和答案。每组问答后，鼓励学生延伸答案。例如：\"Is she a student?\" \"Yes, she is. She is a student.\"",0],["li","- Open the book to page 35. Look at the example with the students, and do question 2 as a class.","- 打开书到第 35 页，和学生一起看例子，全班一起做第 2 题。",0],["li","- Students complete questions 3-8 individually. Walk around the class and monitor.","- 学生各自完成第 3–8 题。在教室里走动观察。",0],["li","- Have students to do the exercise individually. Walk around the classroom and monitor.","- 让学生各自做练习。在教室里走动观察。",0],["li","- Continue with other verbs in the chart.","- 表中其他动词照同样方式进行。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","To start the class","开始上课",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles. Listening Comprehension:","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["p","Listen to the animal's features and the sounds they make. Write the correct numbers in the boxes.","听动物的特征和叫声，在方格中写出正确的号码。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog of \"Let's Check\" section as the introduction of the second listening exercise, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's Check:","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导，如下所示。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","What kinds of animals can you see on the farm? There are pigs, sheep, cows, bulls, donkeys, chicks, horses, and goats. Can you talk about their features? Please turn to page","农场上可以看到哪些动物？有猪、羊、乳牛、公牛、驴子、小鸡、马和山羊。你能说说它们的特征吗？请翻到第",0],["li","34. Let's check. Listen to the animal's features and the sounds they make. Write the correct numbers in the boxes.","34 页。Let's check。听动物的特征和叫声，在方格中写出正确的号码。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["li","- Review / point out the key words to the class in the listening exercise.","- 向全班复习／指出听力练习中的关键字。",0],["li","- Explain the exercise to the students and make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise while listening to the MP3.","- 向学生说明练习方式，确定说明够清楚，让学生能一边听 MP3 一边做练习。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","继续为全班播放 MP3 做听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teachers can play the dialog to the class again .","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the book.","- 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","- Preview homework. Write a few examples on the board to make sure students know what to do.","- 预习作业。在白板上写几个例子，确定学生知道要做什么。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","- Write down the points covered in the lesson and have students copy them down in their progress reports.","- 写下本课涵盖的重点，让学生抄到进度报告上。",0],["li","- Check progress reports and give comments.","- 检查进度报告并写评语。",0]],"g":[[43,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 8","Classroom Reader","Lesson 3","New Words"]],[55,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V","Book 8","Classroom Activities","Lesson 5","5.1","5.2","5.2A","5.2B"]],[110,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Who's Stupid"],"bd":"","m":120},{"z":"第 6 课","t":"Class 6","k":"class","p":[31,32],"b":[["h3","Review Day 1","复习日 1",1],["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","Classroom readers:","课堂读本：",1],["p","Review lesson 1 to lesson 3","复习第 1 课到第 3 课",1],["h3","Classroom Activities",null,1],["p","Review lesson 1 to lesson 5.","复习第 1 课到第 5 课。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Be able to talk about a race with friends.","能和朋友谈论一场比赛。",1],["h3","Teaching aids","教具",1],["p","Flashcards, tape recorder, S8 listening lab tape, copy of the test.","单词卡、录音机、S8 听力测验录音带、考卷复印件。",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson8","EEC 4 第 8 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","- pig, sheep, cow, bull, donkey, chick, horse, goat, overall.",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","I can catch more chicks than you.","A",1],["d","I don't think so.","B",1],["d","Let's have a race.","A",1],["d","Alright!","B",1],["p","N:( Few minutes later, they come back with some chicks.)","N：（几分钟后，他们带着几只小鸡回来。）",1],["d","How many chicks did you catch?","A",1],["d","12. How many did you catch? 12?","B",1],["d","14.","A",1],["d","14? How did you catch so many?","B",1],["d","I've put some in my overalls.","A",1],["d","I want another chance.","B",1],["d","Really? OK, let's start again.","A",1],["h2","Review (20 mins)","复习 Review（20 mins）",0],["li","1. Use this time to catch up on lessons that students did not have time for previously. Make use of games and let the students compete against each other. Make use of drills and a variety of activities.","1. 利用这段时间补上学生之前没来得及完成的课程。用游戏让学生互相比赛，并用操练和各种活动。",0],["li","2. Review the test with the students. Get a copy of it and go over each portion with the class. Use quesions that are similar but not identical to those in the test. 3.Revew","2. 和学生复习考试范围。拿一份考卷和全班逐部分讲评，用和考卷类似但不相同的题目。3. 复习",0],["li","(1) vocabulary","(1) 单词",0],["li","(2) sentence patterns","(2) 句型",0],["li","(3) phonics","(3) 自然拼读",0],["h2","Quiz (30 mins)","小测验 Quiz（30 mins）",0],["p","Have the students put away all their books before you hand out the quiz. Make sure the students understand all the instructions. Walk around the room to check the students' progress. Make sure no students talk or cheat during the test.","发考卷前让学生收好所有书本。确定学生理解所有说明。在教室里走动检查学生的进度，确定考试时没有学生说话或作弊。",0],["h2","Listening Quiz (20 mins)","听力小测验 Listening Quiz（20 mins）",0],["p","Check the tape and the recorder before the students come back from the break, prepare for the listening quiz. Play the tape and let the students fill in the answer on the test paper. Play the tape a few times. The students need to listen carefully.","学生下课回来前先检查录音带和录音机，准备听力小测验。播放录音带让学生在考卷上填答案，录音播几次，学生要仔细听。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the suitable place for their performance. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation about what they can do to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生依照自己的表现在适当的位置打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group to do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front of the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease in terms of achieving the functional goals of this lesson. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation. Please refer to the appendix for the MP3 script and answers of \"Let's Check\" section. Reinforcement","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，达到本课的功能目标，同时注意学生的发音和语调。注意：“Let's Check”部分的 MP3 对话稿和答案请参考附录。",0],["li","1. Review the day's work using the touchscreen all-in-one","1. 用触控一体机复习当天的内容",0],["h3","Homework exercises.","家庭作业。",0],["p","Remind the students to correct mistakes they have made in previous homework exercises.","提醒学生订正之前作业中的错误。",0],["h2","Progress Report Book","学习进度手册",0],["li","1. Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in the progress report book.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","2. Check their progress reports individually. Write comments in it.","2. 逐一检查他们的进度报告并写评语。",0],["li","3. Remind students about test #1","3. 提醒学生第 1 次考试。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 3","电话教学教材 3",0],["li","1. Were there any cats in the zoo?","1. Were there any cats in the zoo?（动物园里有猫吗？）",0],["li","2. Were there any zebras in the zoo?","2. Were there any zebras in the zoo?（动物园里有斑马吗？）",0],["li","3. Do you ever have steak for dinner?","3. Do you ever have steak for dinner?（你晚餐曾经吃牛排吗？）",0],["li","4. Why do you want some money?","4. Why do you want some money?（你为什么想要钱？）",0],["li","5. Please spell \"because\".","5. Please spell \"because\".（请拼出 \"because\"。）",0]],"g":[[26,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 8","Classroom Readers","Lesson 1- Lesson 3"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Review Day","m":85},{"z":"第 7 课","t":"Class 7","k":"class","p":[33],"b":[["h2","Test Day 1","测验日 1",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Attendance (15 mins)","点名（15 分钟）",0],["p","Do a quick warm-up activity such as attendance spelling. Select one exercise on digital that is concise and suitable for review, such as exercise 5.2B. Do the digital exercise in the classroom; allow the students to give all the answers. Reading from a copy of the test, do a quick overview with the students. Cover all the work that is important for the test. Do the vocabulary, sentence patterns, and phonics. Do not give the students any answers to questions directly from the test.","做个快速的热身活动，例如拼写点名。选一个简洁且适合复习的数字练习，例如练习 5.2B，在课堂上做，让学生说出所有答案。看着考卷复印件，和学生快速总览一遍，涵盖考试所有重要内容：单词、句型和自然拼读。不要直接给学生考卷题目的答案。",0],["h2","Review (20 mins)","复习 Review（20 mins）",0],["p","Go over the quiz with the students, correcting mistakes that were made. Make sure that the students are aware of the areas where improvement is needed. Show them ways in which they can monitor their own mistakes and correct it.","和学生讲评小测验，订正错误，确定学生知道哪些地方需要加强。告诉他们如何自己检查错误并改正。",0],["h2","Break(10mins)","下课（10 分钟）",0],["h2","Test(50mins)","考试（50 分钟）",0],["h2","Make sure students' books are out of the way before","发考卷前确定学生的书都已收好。",0],["h3","handing out the test.",null,0],["p","The test is designed to take about 60 minutes. If students finish early let them draw or read, or let them watch a video program in the TV room.","考试设计约 60 分钟。如果学生提早写完，让他们画画或阅读，或到电视室看视频。",0],["h2","Oral Test (3-5mins per student)","口试（每位学生 3–5 分钟）",0],["p","The teacher should conduct the oral test outside the classroom and individually with students. Each question is worth four points, one each for comprehension, grammar, pronunciation and fluency. Give students the opportunity to correct themselves if they have made a mistake. Assign a classroom leader to the class to monitor the students' behavior while you are out of the class, or position yourself so that you can observe the students through the window. The oral test is worth 20% of the test total.","老师应在教室外与学生个别进行口试。每题 4 分，理解、语法、发音和流畅度各 1 分。学生出错时给他们自己改正的机会。你离开教室时指派一位班长维持秩序，或站在能从窗户看到学生的位置。口试占考试总分的 20%。",0],["h2","The Oral Test","口语测验题目",0],["li","1. Why were you late for school? Because...","1. Why were you late for school? Because...（你上学为什么迟到？因为……）",0],["li","2. Do you ever go to the department store?","2. Do you ever go to the department store?（你曾经去百货公司吗？）",0],["li","3. Do you ever go to school by bicycle?","3. Do you ever go to school by bicycle?（你曾经骑自行车上学吗？）",0],["li","4. Were there any pigs in the zoo?","4. Were there any pigs in the zoo?（动物园里有猪吗？）",0],["li","5. Were there any lions in the zoo?","5. Were there any lions in the zoo?（动物园里有狮子吗？）",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["p","Write the quiz and listening grades in their report books and ask them to get signatures from their parents. Ask them to write the correct answer 5 to 10 times for every mistake they've made in the last two quizzes.","把小测验和听力成绩写在他们的报告本上，请他们让家长签名。请他们把最近两次小测验的每个错误的正确答案写 5 到 10 遍。",0],["h2","Progress Report Book","学习进度手册",0],["p","Check their progress reports individually. Write comments and encouragement in it.","逐一检查他们的进度报告，写上评语和鼓励。",0]],"g":[[2,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson IV","Book 8","Classroom Activities","Lesson1-Lesson 5"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Test Day","m":95},{"z":"第 8 课","t":"Class 8","k":"class","p":[34,35],"b":[["h2","Activity Day 1","活动日 1",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Test Review (20mins)","考试讲评（20 分钟）",0],["p","After you have handed out the test, ask the students to quietly check their mistakes and try to correct those mistakes by themselves. Go over the most commonly made mistakes and explain the key grammar points again.","发下测验卷后，请学生安静地检查自己的错误，试着自己订正。讲评最常见的错误，再说明一次重要的语法重点。",0],["h2","Games and Activities (40mins)","游戏与活动（40 分钟）",0],["p","Today is the first game/activity day for S8. The teacher should conduct games or activities that reflect the material learned (i.e. new Verbs, past tense, vocabulary, sentence patterns, IPA phonetics, the future tense, etc....) The games chosen can be longer in duration today.","今天是 S8 第一次游戏／活动日。老师应进行反映所学内容的游戏或活动（例如新动词、过去时、单词、句型、国际音标、将来时等）。今天选的游戏可以玩久一点。",0],["li","1. Relay race: have the students divided into two teams. Have the following diagram on the board: three columns drawn - one for future tense verbs, one for the past tense verbs and one for present progressive tense verbs. Have one verb written in each column as an example. Have the students lined up in two rows. Each team must keep an equal distance from the board. The teacher whispers to the first student in line a sentence in the past tense, present progressive tense or future tense,. The sentence is passed on in whispering mode to the last student in the line. The last student in line writes the verb of the sentence in the right column according to the verb's tense. The first team to complete this task wins the points every time.","1. 接力赛：把学生分成两队。在白板上画三栏：一栏是将来时动词，一栏是过去时动词，一栏是现在进行时动词，每栏先写一个动词当例子。让学生排成两排，每队和白板保持相同距离。老师悄悄对每排第一位学生说一个过去时、现在进行时或将来时的句子，句子以悄悄话方式传到最后一位学生。最后一位学生依动词的时态把句子中的动词写在正确的栏。每次最先完成的队伍得分。",0],["li","2. King of the mountain (game #9). Use this game to practice the negative statements of \"some/any\" from lesson 5.","2. 山大王（游戏 #9）。用这个游戏练习第 5 课 \"some/any\" 的否定句。",0],["li","3. Spelling Bee","3. 拼写比赛",0],["li","4. IPA phonetics; play a game to review phonetic spelling with students. First review some symbols and then, starting with three-letter words, hold a competition between two teams. First person to spell the word correctly wins a point for his team.","4. 国际音标：玩游戏和学生复习音标拼写。先复习一些音标，再从三个字母的字开始，举行两队比赛。最先拼对的人为自己的队伍得一分。",0],["h2","Dramatic Play (20 mins)","戏剧扮演（20 分钟）",0],["p","1.Have a little \"stage\" in the class ready. Get someone to act as Fortune teller with \"crystal ball\" or similar object to foretell the future to the students in class who volunteers for it.. Do ask some help from one of the other teachers for this activity. Discuss any ideas about the activity beforehand.","1. 在教室里准备一个小“舞台”。请一个人扮演算命师，拿着“水晶球”或类似物品，为班上自愿的学生预言未来。这个活动可以请另一位老师帮忙，事先讨论活动的想法。",0],["li","2. The purpose of the activity is to reinforce the use of the future tense. For instance, the fortune teller can say to a student, \"You will be a nurse\" or \"You will be very big\", etc.","2. 这个活动的目的是加强将来时的使用。例如算命师可以对学生说 \"You will be a nurse.\" 或 \"You will be very big.\" 等。",0],["li","3. Afterwards ask questions to the students and let them engage in conversation using the future tense so they will become familiar with it. For example, \"Who will be a farmer?\", etc.","3. 之后问学生问题，让他们用将来时对话，以熟悉将来时。例如 \"Who will be a farmer?\" 等。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["p","Remind the students they are going to have telephone teaching today. Progress report Write comments about the student's participation and his/her speaking skills. Give positive encouragement where needed.","提醒学生今天有电话教学。进度报告：写下学生的参与情况和口语能力的评语，需要时给予正面鼓励。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 4","电话教学教材 4",0],["li","1. Are you happy? Why/Why not?","1. Are you happy? Why/Why not?（你开心吗？为什么／为什么不？）",0],["li","2. Do you ever go to the bookstore?","2. Do you ever go to the bookstore?（你曾经去书店吗？）",0],["li","3. Does your father go to bed late?","3. Does your father go to bed late?（你爸爸很晚睡吗？）",0],["li","4. Were there any dogs in the zoo?","4. Were there any dogs in the zoo?（动物园里有狗吗？）",0],["li","5. Were there any polar bears in the zoo?","5. Were there any polar bears in the zoo?（动物园里有北极熊吗？）",0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"Activity Day","m":80},{"z":"第 9 课","t":"Class 9","k":"class","p":[36,37,38,39],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["li","- To make a shopping list.","- 列购物清单。",1],["li","- To talk about quantity","- 谈论数量",1],["li","- To review IPA phonetic symbols","- 复习国际音标",1],["h3","Classroom Reader Lesson 4","课堂读本第 4 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","start(ed), air, balloon, turn, if, a lot of, a little, sugar, coffee",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 8A Lesson 6","课堂活动 8A 第 6 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","A lot of, a little, sugar, coffee",null,1],["h3","Sentence patterns","句型",1],["p","How much ______is there/do we have? There is a little/a lot of ________. There isn't any/enough ________. We have a little/a lot of ________. We don't have any/enough _______.","How much ______ is there / do we have?（……有多少？）There is a little / a lot of ________. There isn't any / enough ________. We have a little / a lot of ________. We don't have any / enough _______.",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Be able to perceive a pat on the back as praise Be able to praise a smart idea To talk about resources for research","能理解拍背是一种称赞；能称赞好点子；谈论做研究的资源",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["li","- A piece of blank paper for each student.","- 每位学生一张白纸。",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 9","EEC 4 第 9 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Volcano, typhoon, waterfall, island, wave, ocean, mountain, river",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","This research was very difficult to do..","A",1],["d","I don't think so.","B",1],["d","Did you finish everything?","A",1],["d","Yeah! Geography is my favorite subject.","B",1],["d","Where did you find these pictures?","A",1],["d","On the Internet!","B",1],["d","Oh. I didn't think about that.","A",1],["d","You can find almost anything on the Internet.","B",1],["d","Very smart!","A",1],["p","N: (The boy pats the girl gently on her back to praise her good work!","N：（男孩轻拍女孩的背，称赞她做得好！）",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["p","Game: the Past Tense","游戏：过去时",0],["li","- Give each student a piece of paper. Each student should write one verb on his/her piece of paper.","- 每位学生发一张纸，在纸上写一个动词。",0],["li","- Have students stand in a circle each with his/her writing on paper facing inward so that everybody can see the word being written.","- 让学生站成一圈，把写字的那面朝内，让大家都看得到。",0],["li","- Join the game yourself. Start by shouting out the past tense of one of the verbs, \"Drove.\" for example, the person with \"Drive.\" written on his/her paper then should shout out the past tense of the verb on your piece of paper while two of you run and exchange places.","- 你也加入游戏。先喊出某个动词的过去时，例如 \"Drove.\"，纸上写着 \"Drive.\" 的人要喊出你纸上动词的过去时，同时你们两人跑去交换位置。",0],["li","- Have other students do the same at the same time, so that means there will be pairs running exchanging places at the same time.","- 让其他学生同时也这样做，所以会有好几组人同时跑着交换位置。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["li","- Students should at least exchange places once with every student. They can sit down once they have done so. - (This game can be very chaotic but don't worry and just enjoy the fun as it works really well as a warm-up activity.)","- 学生至少要和每位同学交换过一次位置，做到后就可以坐下。（这个游戏可能会很混乱，但别担心，尽情享受，它当热身活动效果非常好。）",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (25 mins) Lesson 4 I want to Go","课堂读本（25 分钟）第 4 课 I want to Go",0],["h2","Home!","Home!（我想回家！）",0],["h3","1. Prediction","1. 预测",0],["li","- Have students open their books to lesson 4 and look at the pictures.","- 让学生打开书到第 4 课看图。",0],["li","- Pre-teach \"air\" and \"balloon\" using the pictures.","- 用图片预先教 \"air\" 和 \"balloon\"。",0],["li","- Ask students to predict what will happen in the story.","- 请学生预测故事会发生什么事。",0],["h3","2. Listen to the story","2. 听故事",0],["li","- Play the story on the website. Ask students questions about the story. Ask students if their predictions were right.","- 在网站上播放故事，问学生关于故事的问题，问他们预测得对不对。",0],["h3","3. Reader","3. 读本",0],["li","- Play the story again on the website.","- 在网站上再播一次故事。",0],["li","- Pause after every sentence. Ask the students to repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 每句后暂停，让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["li","- Teach the words turn, if, and started as they come up in the reading. Teach by using gestures and example sentences.","- 在阅读中出现 turn、if 和 started 时加以教学，用手势和例句教。",0],["h3","4. New words","4. 新单词",0],["li","- Students should be pretty familiar with the new words by now. To reinforce it, play the 'New Words' section on the website and have students repeat after it.","- 学生这时应该已经相当熟悉新单词了。为了加强，播放网站上的“New Words”部分，让学生跟着念。",0],["li","- Have students make sentences with the new words.","- 让学生用新单词造句。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (50 mins) Lesson 6","课堂活动（50 分钟）第 6 课",0],["h3","6.1 Vocabulary","6.1 单词",0],["li","- Show the new words on the touchscreen all-in-one","- 在触控一体机上展示新单词。",0],["li","- Click on the word to show the picture and then play the sound. Have the students to repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 点这个字显示图片，再播放声音，让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["li","- Do the same with other words.","- 其他字照同样方式进行。",0],["h3","6.2 Look at the picture and practice with your teacher.","6.2 看图和老师练习。",0],["li","- Look at the picture on the website. Ask students what is there in the kitchen. Elicit:","- 看网站上的图，问学生厨房里有什么。引导说出：",0],["p","\"There is/were a lot of/a little _______.\"","\"There is/were a lot of / a little _______.\"",0],["h3","6.3 Practice the dialogue below.","6.3 练习下面的对话。",0],["li","- Use the website. Click on the question numbers to show Bitsy Betty and her mother on the screen.","- 使用网站。点题号让 Bitsy Betty 和妈妈出现在屏幕上。",0],["li","- Click on Mother so that she will speak while Bitsy Betty diluted and finally disappearing from the screen.","- 点妈妈让她说话，此时 Bitsy Betty 会渐渐淡出并从屏幕上消失。",0],["li","- Have the students respond to Mother's question looking at the picture on page 36 in their books. Click on Mother again so that Bitsy Betty will reappear. Click on Bitsy Betty to check the answer.","- 让学生看课本第 36 页的图回答妈妈的问题。再点妈妈让 Bitsy Betty 重新出现，点 Bitsy Betty 核对答案。",0],["li","- Go over the rest of the questions, and call on individual students to say the answers.","- 继续其他题目，叫个别学生说出答案。",0],["li","- Role-play. Have students role-play in pairs. Give them a few minutes to practice the dialogue first, and then have them do the role-play simply by looking at the picture on page 36 without looking at the dialogue in 6.3.","- 角色扮演。让学生两两角色扮演。先给他们几分钟练习对话，再让他们只看第 36 页的图、不看 6.3 的对话来演出。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h3","Activity Sheet 3","活动单 3",0],["li","- Tell students to imagine what they have in their fridges and draw it in the fridge in Activity 1.","- 请学生想象自己的冰箱里有什么，画在活动 1 的冰箱里。",0],["li","- Put students into groups of 3-4. Tell them that they are going to have a party with the people in the group. In activity 2, make a list of what they would like to have at the party and how much of everything they would need.","- 把学生分成 3–4 人一组，告诉他们要和组员办一场派对。在活动 2 中列出派对上想要的东西，以及每样需要多少。",0],["li","- Compare what everybody has in his/her fridge. Make a shopping list.","- 比较每个人冰箱里的东西，列出购物清单。",0],["li","- Write three sentences to describe the situation. For example: \"We don't have any coke. We have to buy some!\"","- 写三个句子描述情况。例如：\"We don't have any coke. We have to buy some!\"",0],["h3","6.4 Look at the pictures and answer the questions.","6.4 看图回答问题。",0],["li","- Look at the pictures on page 40 and make sentences about each picture. For example, \"There is a little water in Fido's bowl.\"","- 看第 40 页的图，为每张图造句。例如：\"There is a little water in Fido's bowl.\"",0],["li","- Students complete the exercise individually. Walk around the classroom and monitor.","- 学生各自完成练习。在教室里走动观察。",0],["h3","6.5 Practice the IPA phonetic pronunciation and fill in the blanks.","6.5 练习国际音标发音并填空。",0],["li","- Write some phonetic symbols ( [m], [p], [uː], etc. on the board and ask students to pronounce them.","- 在白板上写一些音标（[m]、[p]、[uː] 等），请学生念出来。",0],["li","- Utter a few sounds (but not entire words, [luːn] from balloon for example) from page 41 and ask students to write down their IPA phonetic symbols on the board.","- 念出第 41 页的一些音（不是整个字，例如 balloon 中的 [luːn]），请学生在白板上写出它们的国际音标。",0],["li","- Students complete the exercise individually.","- 学生各自完成练习。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See And Say.\"","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["h3","Context Introduction","情境介绍",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students to listen to the monolog of Let's See and Say section in lesson one. Teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's See And Say:","老师让学生听第 5 课“Let's See and Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听，如下所示。Let's See And Say 独白：",0],["p","We can use the Internet to do different things. What can we do with the Internet? We can find information we want. We can do the shopping. We can talk to our friends. The two students are talking about using the Internet to find information for their geography report. Let's listen to what they say.","我们可以用网络做各种事。用网络可以做什么？可以找想要的资料、购物、和朋友聊天。这两位学生正在讨论用网络为地理报告找资料。我们来听听他们说什么。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasise for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students to repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. Teachers also need to listen carefully to the","第二次为全班播放对话，让学生跟着旁白念。提醒学生练习每句对话时，要仔细听旁白的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialog that the students have practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialog to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with the others. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the type of conversation in the real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the book.","- 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","- Preview homework. Write a few examples on the board to make sure students know what to do.","- 预习作业。在白板上写几个例子，确定学生知道要做什么。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","- Write down the points covered in the lesson and have students copy them down in their progress reports.","- 写下本课涵盖的重点，让学生抄到进度报告上。",0],["li","- Check progress reports and give comments.","- 检查进度报告并写评语。",0]],"g":[[31,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 8","Classroom Activities","Lesson 6"]],[31,["Reader","lesson4","New Words"]],[54,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 8","Classroom Activities","Lesson 6","6.1","6.2","6.3"]],[81,["● Follow the same steps","above"]],[100,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["I want to Go"],"bd":"","m":110},{"z":"第 10 课","t":"Class 10","k":"class","p":[40,41,42,43],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["li","- To talk about what one is buying.","- 谈论正在买什么。",1],["li","- To learn words to indicate quantity/terms of measurement: a piece of, a cup of, a bar of, a bottle of, a bowl of, a bag of, etc.","- 学习表示数量／计量单位的字：a piece of、a cup of、a bar of、a bottle of、a bowl of、a bag of 等。",1],["h3","Classroom Reader Lesson 5","Classroom Reader 第 5 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","mess, bark, crazy, woof, lick(ed)",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 8A Lesson 7","课堂活动 8A 第 7 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","a piece of cake, a cup of tea, a bar of chocolate, a bottle of milk, a bowl of noodles, a bag of candy",null,1],["h3","Sentence patterns","句型",1],["p","What are you buying? I'm buying ______. How much is ________? It's _____ dollars.","What are you buying?（你在买什么？）I'm buying ______. How much is ________?（……多少钱？）It's _____ dollars.",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","To be able to perceive a pat on the back as praise To be able to praise a smart idea To talk about resources for research","能理解拍背是一种称赞；能称赞好点子；谈论做研究的资源",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["li","- Photocopies of Classroom Reader page 23 and 24. Cut out the paragraphs.","- 课堂读本第 23 和 24 页的复印件，把段落剪下来。",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 9","EEC 4 第 9 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Volcano, typhoon, waterfall, island, wave, ocean, mountain, river",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","This research was very difficult to do..","A",1],["d","I don't think so.","B",1],["d","Did you finish everything?","A",1],["d","Yeah! Geography is my favorite subject.","B",1],["d","Where did you find these pictures?","A",1],["d","On the Internet!","B",1],["d","Oh. I didn't think about that.","A",1],["d","You can find almost anything on the Internet.","B",1],["d","Very smart!","A",1],["p","N: (The boy pats the girl gently on her back to praise her good work!","N：（男孩轻拍女孩的背，称赞她做得好！）",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["p","Game: Backward Spelling","游戏：倒着拼写",0],["li","- Choose words that you want to practice and spell them backwards, starting with the last letter. Then the last two letters, the last three letters, and so on. For drive, this would go \"E\", \"EV\", \"EVI\", \"EVIR\", \"EVIRD\".","- 选要练习的字，从最后一个字母开始倒着拼，接着是最后两个字母、最后三个字母，依此类推。以 drive 为例：\"E\"、\"EV\"、\"EVI\"、\"EVIR\"、\"EVIRD\"。",0],["li","- If students thinks they know the word before you get to the end, they can put their hand up and spell it (in the normal way).","- 如果学生在你拼完前就猜到是什么字，可以举手（用正常顺序）拼出来。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (30 mins) Lesson 5 What A Mess!","课堂读本（30 分钟）第 5 课 What A Mess!（真是一团乱！）",0],["h3","1. Prediction","1. 预测",0],["li","- Have students open their books to lesson 5 and look at the pictures.","- 让学生打开书到第 5 课看图。",0],["li","- Pre-teach new words using the pictures. For example, teach mess by saying:","- 用图片预先教新单词。例如教 mess 时，指着房间里乱七八糟的地方说：",0],["p","\"Look at the room. It's a mess.\" while pointing to the mess in the room. Ask individual students: \"Is your room usually a mess?\" Teach the other new words using the same idea.","\"Look at the room. It's a mess.\"，再问个别学生：\"Is your room usually a mess?\"。用同样方式教其他新单词。",0],["li","- Ask students to predict what will happen in today's story.","- 请学生预测今天的故事会发生什么事。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h3","2. Listen to the story","2. 听故事",0],["li","- Play the story on the website. Ask students questions about the story. Ask students if their predictions were right.","- 在网站上播放故事，问学生关于故事的问题，问他们预测得对不对。",0],["h3","3. Reader","3. 读本",0],["li","- Play the story again on the website.","- 在网站上再播一次故事。",0],["li","- Pause after every sentence. Ask the students to repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 每句后暂停，让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["h3","4. New words","4. 新单词",0],["li","- Students should be pretty familiar with the new words by now. To reinforce it, play the 'New Word' section on the website and have students repeat after it.","- 学生这时应该已经相当熟悉新单词了。为了加强，播放网站上的“New Word”部分，让学生跟着念。",0],["li","- Have students make sentences with the new words.","- 让学生用新单词造句。",0],["h3","5. Game: Put the paragraphs in order","5. 游戏：把段落排好顺序",0],["li","- Photocopies of Classroom Reader page 23 and 24. Cut out the paragraphs.","- 课堂读本第 23 和 24 页的复印件，把段落剪下来。",0],["li","- Put students into groups of 3-4. Give each group a set of the paragraphs. They should put the paragraphs in the correct order.","- 把学生分成 3–4 人一组，每组一套段落，让他们把段落排成正确的顺序。",0],["li","- The group that first does so correctly wins.","- 最先正确排好的组获胜。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (45 mins) Lesson 7","课堂活动（45 分钟）第 7 课",0],["h3","7.1 Vocabulary","7.1 单词",0],["li","- Show the new words on the website.","- 在网站上展示新单词。",0],["li","- Click on the word to show the picture and then play the sound. Have the students to repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 点这个字显示图片，再播放声音，让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["li","- Make a list of countable and uncountable nouns on the board. Encourage students to give you more examples. Make sure that they know they use \"a\" before countable nouns and \"some\" with uncountable nouns. countable uncountable a banana some cake a flower some coffee an umbrella some chocolate a book some milk a dress some noodles a balloon some candy some soap some toothpaste","- 在白板上列出可数和不可数名词，鼓励学生举更多例子。确定他们知道可数名词前用 \"a\"，不可数名词用 \"some\"。可数：a banana、a flower、an umbrella、a book、a dress、a balloon；不可数：some cake、some coffee、some chocolate、some milk、some noodles、some candy、some soap、some toothpaste",0],["li","- Explain to the students that you can count an uncountable noun by using a particular word to describe its shape (a bar, a piece, etc.) or the container (a bottle, a bag, a bowl, etc.) it comes with.","- 向学生解释，不可数名词可以用描述形状的字（a bar、a piece 等）或容器（a bottle、a bag、a bowl 等）来计数。",0],["li","- Encourage students to use words they can think of to practice counting other non-countable nouns, \"a bar of soap\" and \"a tube of toothpaste\", for example.","- 鼓励学生用想得到的字练习计数其他不可数名词，例如 \"a bar of soap\" 和 \"a tube of toothpaste\"。",0],["h3","7.2 Look at the picture and practice with your teacher.","7.2 看图和老师练习。",0],["li","- Look at the picture on the website. Ask students what they are buying. Elicit answers. \"Tiny Tom is buying two bowls of noodles.\" for example.","- 看网站上的图，问学生他们在买什么，引导回答，例如 \"Tiny Tom is buying two bowls of noodles.\"",0],["h3","7.3 Look at the pictures and practice.","7.3 看图练习。",0],["li","- Look at picture 1 and 2 and practice the dialogues as a class.","- 看图 1 和图 2，全班一起练习对话。",0],["li","- Put students into two groups. Students from one group ask questions and students from the other answer.","- 把学生分成两组，一组提问，另一组回答。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["li","- Pair-work: Students practice the dialogue in pairs using the 'Look up and Say' technique. A student looks at the picture and the line he/she needs to say next and then looks up and says the line while maintaining eye contact with the person he/she is supposed to be speaking to.","- 两人一组：学生用“抬头说”技巧两两练习对话。学生先看图和下一句要说的台词，再抬头看着说话对象，保持眼神接触说出台词。",0],["li","- Use the website. Have individual students to complete the sentences on the touchscreen all-in-one and check answers.","- 使用网站。让个别学生在触控一体机上完成句子并核对答案。",0],["h3","7.4 Look at the sentences and choose the best answer.","7.4 看句子选出最好的答案。",0],["li","- Say, \"Sugar.\" Ask for possible ways of counting sugar from students, \"a bag of sugar\" and \"a jar of sugar\" for example.","- 说 \"Sugar.\"，请学生说出糖的计量方式，例如 \"a bag of sugar\" 和 \"a jar of sugar\"。",0],["li","- Continue with other non-countable nouns.","- 其他不可数名词照同样方式进行。",0],["li","- Have students do the exercise on page 44 individually.","- 让学生各自做第 44 页的练习。",0],["li","- Check the answers on the website. Calling on individual students to do the exercises on the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 在网站上核对答案，叫个别学生在触控一体机上做练习。",0],["h3","7.5 Make questions for the answers below.","7.5 为下面的答案写出问题。",0],["li","- Make some sentences that are similar to the ones in this exercise but not exactly the same, and ask students to make questions for these answers.","- 造一些和这个练习类似但不完全相同的句子，请学生为这些答案提出问题。",0],["li","- Have students complete the exercise individually. Walk around the room and monitor.","- 让学生各自完成练习。在教室里走动观察。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["p","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","To start the class","开始上课",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","That's a Geography class. Listen and circle what the teacher is talking about.","这是一堂地理课。听一听，圈出老师在讲什么。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog of \"Let's Check\" section as the introduction of the second listening exercise, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's Check:","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导，如下所示。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","Look at the picture. Geography is the study of the earth's surface and the people who live on it. Can you talk about the geographical topics? Topics about countries, volcanoes, typhoons, waterfalls, waves, oceans, mountains and rivers. Please turn to page 38. Let's check. That's a Geography class. Listen and circle what the teacher is talking about.","看看这张图。地理是研究地球表面和住在上面的人们的学问。你能谈谈地理主题吗？例如国家、火山、台风、瀑布、海浪、海洋、山和河流。请翻到第 38 页。Let's check。这是一堂地理课。听一听，圈出老师在讲什么。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["li","- Review / point out the key words to the class in the listening exercise.","- 向全班复习／指出听力练习中的关键字。",0],["li","- Explain the exercise to the students and make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise while listening to the MP3.","- 向学生说明练习方式，确定说明够清楚，让学生能一边听 MP3 一边做练习。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","继续为全班播放 MP3 做听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the corrections by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teachers can play the dialog to the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the book.","- 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","- Preview homework. Write a few examples on the board to make sure students know what to do.","- 预习作业。在白板上写几个例子，确定学生知道要做什么。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","- Write down the points covered in the lesson and have students copy them down in their progress reports.","- 写下本课涵盖的重点，让学生抄到进度报告上。",0],["li","- Check progress reports and give comments.","- 检查进度报告并写评语。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 5","电话教学教材 5",0],["li","1. How much fruit do you have?","1. How much fruit do you have?（你有多少水果？）",0],["li","2. How much money do you have?","2. How much money do you have?（你有多少钱？）",0],["li","3. Make a sentence with \"a cup of\"","3. 用 \"a cup of\" 造一个句子。",0],["li","4. Make a sentence with \"a bottle of\"","4. 用 \"a bottle of\" 造一个句子。",0],["li","5. How do you spell \"crazy\"?","5. How do you spell \"crazy\"?（\"crazy\" 怎么拼？）",0]],"g":[[34,["儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 8","Classroom Readers","Lesson 5"]],[53,["儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 8","Classroom Activities","Lesson 7","7.1","7.2","7.3","7.4"]],[96,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["What A Mess!"],"bd":"","m":110},{"z":"第 11 课","t":"Class 11","k":"class","p":[44,45,46],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["li","- To talk about quantity","- 谈论数量",1],["li","- To talk about a barbecue","- 谈论烤肉",1],["li","- To review IPA phonetic symbols.","- 复习国际音标。",1],["h3","Classroom Reader Lesson 6","课堂读本第 6 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","take care, cloud, light, only, each other, at last",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 8A Lesson 8","课堂活动 8A 第 8 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","meat, sauce, charcoal. A slice of bread",null,1],["h3","Sentence patterns","句型",1],["p","How many/much _____________?","How many/much _____________?（……有多少？）",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","To be able to perceive a pat on the back as praise To praise a smart idea To talk about resources for research","能理解拍背是一种称赞；称赞好点子；谈论做研究的资源",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","- 3 photocopies of Classroom Activity 8A page 47. Paper.","- 课堂活动 8A 第 47 页的复印件 3 份、纸。",1],["h3","EEC4 Lesson 9","EEC4 第 9 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Volcano, typhoon, waterfall, island, wave, ocean, mountain, river",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","This research was very difficult to do.","A",1],["d","I don't think so.","B",1],["d","Did you finish everything?","A",1],["d","Yeah! Geography is my favorite subject.","B",1],["d","Where did you find these pictures?","A",1],["d","On the Internet!","B",1],["d","Oh. I didn't think about that.","A",1],["d","You can find almost anything on the Internet.","B",1],["d","Very smart!","A",1],["p","N: (The boy pats the girl gently on her back to praise her good work!","N：（男孩轻拍女孩的背，称赞她做得好！）",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["p","To review spelling Game: Secret codes Write the alphabet in eight numbered sections on the board as follows:","复习拼写　游戏：密码　把字母分成八个有编号的区段写在白板上，如下：",0],["p","1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 abc def ghi jkl mno pqrs tuv wxyz Think of a word and write the section number for each letter on the board, eg 5266 is mess. Get the students to decode the word by choosing letters from the appropriate sections.","1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8　abc def ghi jkl mno pqrs tuv wxyz　想一个字，在白板上写出每个字母所在的区段号码，例如 5266 是 mess。让学生从对应的区段选字母来解出这个字。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (25 mins) Lesson 6 Home at Last!","课堂读本（25 分钟）第 6 课 Home at Last!（终于到家了！）",0],["h3","1. Prediction","1. 预测",0],["li","- Have students open their books to lesson 6 and look at the pictures. Ask students to predict what will happen in today's story.","- 让学生打开书到第 6 课看图，请学生预测今天的故事会发生什么事。",0],["li","- Pre-teach new words by asking questions about the pictures. For example, teach \"take","- 用图片问问题预先教新单词。例如教 \"take",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","care\" by asking students: \"What might Tiny Tom and Small Sally have said when they waved goodbye?\" \"What can you say when you say goodbye to someone?\" Teach other new words using the same idea. If you find it difficult to teach some of the new words this way, teach them later while the students are reading the story.","care\" 时问学生：\"What might Tiny Tom and Small Sally have said when they waved goodbye?\" \"What can you say when you say goodbye to someone?\"。用同样方式教其他新单词。如果有些新单词很难用这种方式教，就等学生读故事时再教。",0],["h3","2. Listen to the story","2. 听故事",0],["li","- Play the story on MP3. Ask students questions about the story. Ask students if their predictions were right.","- 用 MP3 播放故事，问学生关于故事的问题，问他们预测得对不对。",0],["h3","3. Reader","3. 读本",0],["li","- Play the story again on the website.","- 在网站上再播一次故事。",0],["li","- Pause after every sentence. Ask the students to repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 每句后暂停，让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["li","- Explain new words using gestures, example sentences and so on.","- 用手势、例句等解释新单词。",0],["h3","4. New words","4. 新单词",0],["li","- Students should be pretty familiar with the new words by now. To reinforce it, play the 'New Word' section on the website and have students repeat after it.","- 学生这时应该已经相当熟悉新单词了。为了加强，播放网站上的“New Word”部分，让学生跟着念。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (50 mins) Lesson 8","课堂活动（50 分钟）第 8 课",0],["h3","8.1 Vocabulary","8.1 单词",0],["li","- Show the new words on the touchscreen all-in-one","- 在触控一体机上展示新单词。",0],["li","- Ask the students to try to pronounce one of the words by applying phonics rules.","- 请学生运用自然拼读规则试着念出其中一个字。",0],["li","- Click on the word to show the picture and then play the sound. Have the students to repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 点这个字显示图片，再播放声音，让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["li","- Do the same with other words.","- 其他字照同样方式进行。",0],["h3","8.2 Look at the picture and practice with your teacher.","8.2 看图和老师练习。",0],["li","- Look at the picture on the website. Tell the students that the kids had a barbecue on Saturday afternoon. Ask students what they had at the barbecue. Encourage students to make sentences about the barbecue. For example: \"They had 15 pieces of meat.\"","- 看网站上的图，告诉学生孩子们星期六下午烤肉，问学生他们烤肉时吃了什么，鼓励学生针对烤肉造句。例如：\"They had 15 pieces of meat.\"",0],["li","- Ask students questions using the structure: \"How many/much ______did they have?\" Elicit answers.","- 用 \"How many/much ______ did they have?\" 的结构问学生问题，引导回答。",0],["h2","A. Read the passage below with your teacher.","A. 和老师一起读下面的短文。",0],["p","Game: Running Dictation","游戏：跑步听写",0],["li","- Put students into pairs: Student A and B.","- 让学生两两一组：学生 A 和 B。",0],["li","- Stick 3 photocopies of page 47 on the wall, one at the back of the classroom, one in the middle and one in the front.","- 把第 47 页的 3 份复印件贴在墙上，一份在教室后面、一份在中间、一份在前面。",0],["li","- Books closed. Give each pair a piece of blank paper.","- 合上书，每组发一张白纸。",0],["li","- When you say \"Go!\" Student A from each pair should run to their nearest passage, memorize part of it, run back to Student B and read out what he/she has memorized. Student B should write down what Student A says.","- 你说“Go!”时，每组的学生 A 跑到最近的短文前，记住一部分，跑回来念给学生 B 听，学生 B 要写下学生 A 说的内容。",0],["li","- Student A runs back to the passage and memorizes the next part of the passage and continues the same procedure.","- 学生 A 再跑回短文前记住下一部分，照同样程序继续。",0],["li","- When you say: \"Change!\" Student A and Student B should change roles, that is, Student B should be the runner and Student B the writer.","- 你说“Change!”时，学生 A 和学生 B 交换角色，也就是学生 B 负责跑，学生 A 负责写。",0],["li","- You may want to make this into a competition. The pairs that have done so faster and more accurately win.","- 你也可以做成比赛，又快又正确的组获胜。",0],["h3","Use the website","使用网站",0],["li","- Read and listen to the passage on the website.","- 在网站上读并听短文。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","B. Answer the questions about the passage.","B. 回答关于短文的问题。",0],["li","- Do question 1 and 2 as a class. Have students complete the rest of the exercise individually. Walk around the room and help when needed.","- 全班一起做第 1 和第 2 题，让学生各自完成其余练习。在教室里走动，需要时给予协助。",0],["h3","8.3 Look at the pictures and answer the questions.","8.3 看图回答问题。",0],["h3","Quiz show","问答秀",0],["li","- Put students into two teams. Play the questions one by one.","- 把学生分成两队，逐题播放问题。",0],["li","- Students look at the pictures and try to shout their answer out as fast as they can. The student who answers in the correct form faster scores one point for his/her team.","- 学生看图尽快喊出答案，用正确形式回答又较快的人为自己的队伍得一分。",0],["h3","8.4 Practice the IPA phonetic pronunciation and fill in the blanks.","8.4 练习国际音标发音并填空。",0],["li","- Write some phonetic symbols ( [k], [r], [iː], etc) on the board and ask students to pronounce them.","- 在白板上写一些音标（[k]、[r]、[iː] 等），请学生念出来。",0],["li","- Utter a few sounds (but not entire words, [kreɪ] from crazy for example) from page 52 and 53 and ask students to write down their IPA phonetic symbols on the board.","- 念出第 52 和 53 页的一些音（不是整个字，例如 crazy 中的 [kreɪ]），请学生在白板上写出它们的国际音标。",0],["li","- Students complete the exercise individually.","- 学生各自完成练习。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What can I do?\" and let them check the suitable place for their performance. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation about what they can do to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生依照自己的表现在适当的位置打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group to do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease in terms of achieving the functional goals of this lesson. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation. Please refer to the appendix for the MP3 script and answers of \"Let's Check\" section.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，达到本课的功能目标，同时注意学生的发音和语调。注意：“Let's Check”部分的 MP3 对话稿和答案请参考附录。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the book.","- 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","- Preview homework. Write a few examples on the board to make sure students know what to do.","- 预习作业。在白板上写几个例子，确定学生知道要做什么。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","- Write down the points covered in the lesson and have students copy them down in their progress reports.","- 写下本课涵盖的重点，让学生抄到进度报告上。",0],["li","- Check progress reports and give comments.","- 检查进度报告并写评语。",0]],"g":[[34,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V"]],[34,["Book 8","Classroom Reader","Lesson 6","Reader","New Words"]],[48,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V","Book 8","Classroom Activities","Lesson 8","8.1","8.2","8.2A","8.3"]],[87,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Home at Last!"],"bd":"","m":110},{"z":"第 12 课","t":"Class 12","k":"class","p":[47,48,49],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["li","- To review the language learned in Class 9 and 10.","- 复习第 9 和第 10 堂课学过的语言。",1],["li","- To practice the language for shopping.","- 练习购物用语。",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 8B Lesson 9","课堂活动 8B 第 9 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","things, of course, vanilla ice- cream, make up your mind",null,1],["h3","Sentence patterns","句型",1],["p","Review:","复习：",1],["p","a ____ of + uncountable noun I want ________. I'm going to buy _______.","a ____ of + 不可数名词　I want ________.（我想要……）I'm going to buy _______.（我要买……）",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Shake your finger to forbid something","摇手指表示禁止某事",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["d","a small piece of paper, a toy ice-cream, a five-hundred dollar note","Props",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 10","EEC 4 第 10 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Broom, hammer, nail, bolt, rope, ladder, license, plate, tire",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","What are you doing, Maggie?","A",1],["d","I'm picking up these pieces of glass.","B",1],["d","You didn't break the vase, did you?","A",1],["d","I'm sorry.","B",1],["d","How did you do that?","A",1],["d","I was bouncing the ball and..","B",1],["d","I've talked to you about that.","A",1],["d","I know. I'm sorry.","B",1],["d","It's OK. Accidents happen but don't play with the ball in the garage.","A",1],["p","N:( The mother is disappointed and shakes her finger at the girl.","N：（妈妈很失望，对女孩摇摇手指。）",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (15 mins)","热身 Warm Up（15 mins）",0],["h3","A Grocery Store","杂货店",0],["li","- Ask students what a grocery store is. Ask them if there are any around the school or near their homes.","- 问学生什么是杂货店，问他们学校附近或家附近有没有。",0],["li","- Ask them to think for a couple of minutes what they can buy at a grocery store.","- 请他们想几分钟，在杂货店可以买到什么。",0],["li","- Put the students into three teams. Write on the upper part of the board:","- 把学生分成三队，在白板上方写：",0],["p","Team A Team B Team C","A 队　B 队　C 队",0],["li","- When you say: \"Go!\" Students from each team come to the board one at a time and each writes an item they think they can by at a grocery store under the name of his/her team.","- 你说“Go!”时，各队学生一次一人到白板前，在自己队名下写一样他们认为在杂货店可以买到的东西。",0],["li","- Set a time limit of 3 minutes. Compare answers from different teams and discuss whether they agree with answers from other teams.","- 设定 3 分钟时限。比较各队的答案，讨论是否同意其他队的答案。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (70 mins) Lesson 9","课堂活动（70 分钟）第 9 课",0],["h3","9.1 Vocabulary","9.1 单词",0],["li","- Review the new words on the touchscreen all-in-one","- 在触控一体机上复习新单词。",0],["li","- Click on the word to show the picture and then play the sound. Have the students to repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 点这个字显示图片，再播放声音，让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["li","- Look at the pictures 1-5. Ask students to guess what's happening in the pictures.","- 看图 1–5，请学生猜猜图中发生什么事。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["li","- Pair-work. Have students cover page 5 with another book and write out a dialogue for the pictures in pairs. Walk around the room and help when needed.","- 两人一组。让学生用另一本书盖住第 5 页，两两为这些图写出一段对话。在教室里走动，需要时给予协助。",0],["li","- Have a couple of pairs of students read their dialogues out to the class.","- 请几组学生向全班念出他们的对话。",0],["h3","9.2 Practice the dialogue below with a partner.","9.2 和伙伴练习下面的对话。",0],["li","- Play the dialogue on the website. Ask students how the dialogue is different from theirs.","- 在网站上播放对话，问学生这段对话和他们写的有什么不同。",0],["li","- Play it again. This time pause after every sentence and ask students to repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one. Encourage students to put emotion into the dialogue.","- 再播一次，这次每句后暂停，让学生跟着触控一体机念，鼓励学生把情感放进对话。",0],["li","- Have the props ready for role-play: a small piece of paper, a toy ice-cream, a five-hundred dollar note.","- 准备角色扮演的道具：一小张纸、一个玩具冰淇淋、一张五百元钞票。",0],["li","- Pair-work: students practice role-play in pairs. Encourage students to personalize the dialogue by changing some details. They can also make their own props.","- 两人一组：学生两两练习角色扮演，鼓励他们改变一些细节，让对话更贴近自己，也可以自己做道具。",0],["li","- Have them act out the dialogue using the props in front of the class.","- 让他们用道具在全班面前演出对话。",0],["h3","9.3 Fill in the blanks with the given words.","9.3 用提供的字填空。",0],["li","- Books closed. Write the answers of the exercises on the board.","- 合上书，把练习的答案写在白板上。",0],["li","- Ask students to make sentences using the words to review the use of the words.","- 请学生用这些字造句，复习字的用法。",0],["li","- Books opened. Have students fill in the blanks individually. Walk around the classroom and monitor.","- 打开书，让学生各自填空。在教室里走动观察。",0],["li","9.4 Arrange the dialogue in the correct order and practice with a partner.","9.4 把对话排成正确的顺序，并和伙伴练习。",0],["li","- Go over the sentences as a class. Check understanding.","- 全班一起看一遍句子，确认理解。",0],["li","- Pair-work: Students complete this exercise in pairs.","- 两人一组：学生两两完成这个练习。",0],["li","- Students practice the dialogue in pairs.","- 学生两两练习对话。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See And Say.\"","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Context Introduction:","情境介绍：",0],["p","Teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students to listen to the monologue of \"Let's See and Say\" section in lesson one. The teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's See & Say:","老师让学生听第 3 课“Let's See and Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听，如下所示。Let's See & Say 独白：",0],["p","What do you say when you break something or make a mistake? Maggie was not careful and she broke a vase in the garage. How did this happen? Let's listen to the conversation.","打破东西或犯错时你会说什么？Maggie 不小心在车库打破了一个花瓶。这是怎么发生的？我们来听听对话。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have just listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasize for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students to repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialogue. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again combining the dialog that the students have just practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with the others. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the type of conversation in the real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the book.","- 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one. ●","- 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。●",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","- Preview homework. Write a few examples on the board to make sure students know what to do.","- 预习作业。在白板上写几个例子，确定学生知道要做什么。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","- Write down the points covered in the lesson and have students copy them down in their progress reports.","- 写下本课涵盖的重点，让学生抄到进度报告上。",0],["li","- Check progress reports and give comments.","- 检查进度报告并写评语。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 6","电话教学教材 6",0],["li","1. How much is a bag of candy?","1. How much is a bag of candy?（一袋糖果多少钱？）",0],["li","2. Is there enough juice? Yes...","2. Is there enough juice? Yes...（果汁够吗？够……）",0],["li","3. How many pieces of fruit do you have?","3. How many pieces of fruit do you have?（你有几个水果？）",0],["li","4. How much bread do you have?","4. How much bread do you have?（你有多少面包？）",0],["li","5. How do you spell \"sauce\"?","5. How do you spell \"sauce\"?（\"sauce\" 怎么拼？）",0]],"g":[[36,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V","Book 8","Classroom Activities","Lesson 9","9.1-9.4"]],[79,["Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":110},{"z":"第 13 课","t":"Class 13","k":"class","p":[50,51,52],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["li","- To review language learned in Class 9-12.","- 复习第 9–12 堂课学过的语言。",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 8B Lesson 10","课堂活动 8B 第 10 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Review","复习",1],["h3","Sentence patterns","句型",1],["p","Review:","复习：",1],["p","Do you ____ any _______? How many/much ________are there? How many/much ________ do you have? a ____ of + uncountable nouns","Do you ____ any _______?　How many/much ________ are there?　How many/much ________ do you have?　a ____ of + 不可数名词",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Shake your finger to forbid something","摇手指表示禁止某事",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["li","- Digital medium","- 数字教材",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 10","EEC 4 第 10 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Broom, hammer, nail, bolt, rope, ladder, license, plate, tire",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","What are you doing, Maggie?","A",1],["d","I'm picking up these pieces of glass.","B",1],["d","You didn't break the vase, did you?","A",1],["d","I'm sorry.","B",1],["d","How did you do that?","A",1],["d","I was bouncing the ball and..","B",1],["d","I've talked to you about that.","A",1],["d","I know. I'm sorry.","B",1],["d","It's OK. Accidents happen but don't play with the ball in the garage.","A",1],["p","N:( The mother is disappointed and shakes her finger at the girl.","N：（妈妈很失望，对女孩摇摇手指。）",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (15 mins)","热身 Warm Up（15 mins）",0],["h3","Re-tell the Story","重述故事",0],["li","- Write the following words on the board, and ask the students to say the words. started, air, balloon, turn, if, mess, licked, go up, take care, sky, cloud, home at last","- 把下列单词写在白板上，请学生念出来：started、air、balloon、turn、if、mess、licked、go up、take care、sky、cloud、home at last",0],["li","- Have the students look at lesson 4, 5 and 6 in the Classroom Reader. Ask them if they still remember the story. Tell them that they are going to tell you the story in a minute. Let the students look at the two lessons for a minute or two.","- 让学生看课堂读本第 4、5、6 课，问他们是否还记得故事。告诉他们等一下要把故事讲给你听，让学生看这几课一两分钟。",0],["li","- Have students close their books and look at the board. Tell them that they should include the words on the board in their stories.","- 让学生合上书看白板，告诉他们故事中要用到白板上的字。",0],["li","- Hold a ball in your hands and start the story yourself by saying: \"Small Sally started to cry because she wanted to go home.\" Throw the ball to Student A, and he/she should continue the story and he must say the word air before he/she can pass the ball to Student B.","- 你手上拿着球，自己先开始说故事：\"Small Sally started to cry because she wanted to go home.\"。把球丢给学生 A，他／她要接着说故事，而且要说到 air 这个字才能把球传给学生 B。",0],["li","- Continue the story-telling until all the words on the board have been used and the stories from lesson 1 and 2 have been completed.","- 持续说故事，直到白板上的字都用过，第 1、2 课的故事都说完为止。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (70 mins) Lesson 10","课堂活动（70 分钟）第 10 课",0],["h3","10.1 Look at the picture and practice with your teacher.","10.1 看图和老师练习。",0],["li","- Look at the picture on page 8. Ask students what they see in the picture.","- 看第 8 页的图，问学生在图中看到什么。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["li","- Ask students questions about the picture to review some, any, how much, how many, and phrases for counting uncountable nouns.","- 问学生关于图片的问题，复习 some、any、how much、how many 以及计量不可数名词的短语。",0],["h3","10.2 Answer the questions about the picture.","10.2 回答关于图片的问题。",0],["li","- Go through the questions with students and have them answered orally. Make sure that students use some/any correctly.","- 和学生逐题看问题并口头回答，确定学生正确使用 some/any。",0],["li","- Students complete the exercise in their books individually. Walk around the classroom and monitor.","- 学生在书上各自完成练习。在教室里走动观察。",0],["li","- Pair-work: Students practice asking and answering questions in pairs.","- 两人一组：学生两两练习问答。",0],["li","- Put students into groups of 3-4. Each group of students come up with 3 more questions about the picture.","- 把学生分成 3–4 人一组，每组再想 3 个关于图片的问题。",0],["li","- Students take turns asking students from different groups questions","- 学生轮流向不同组的学生提问。",0],["h3","Activity Sheet 4","活动单 4",0],["li","- Tell the students to imagine that they were at a barbecue on the weekend and that they had meat, soda, juice, sauce, fruit, chocolate and one thing of their choice at the barbecue. But only they themselves know the quantity of the things that were at the barbecue. Therefore, they should draw these things with the right quantity in Activity 1.","- 告诉学生想象周末去烤肉，烤肉时有肉、汽水、果汁、酱料、水果、巧克力，再加一样自己选的东西。只有他们自己知道烤肉时这些东西的数量，所以要在活动 1 中依正确数量画出这些东西。",0],["li","- Pair-work. Students find out what each other had at the barbecues by asking questions and draw the answers in Activity 2 on their own activity sheets. Make sure they don't look at each other's sheets while doing this. You can do this by having students sit opposite each other or sit back to back while asking each other questions.","- 两人一组。学生互相提问，找出对方烤肉时有什么，并把答案画在自己活动单的活动 2 中。进行时要确定他们不看对方的单子，可以让学生面对面坐或背对背坐着互相提问。",0],["li","- Students compare their activity sheets with their partners to see if they have got the answers right.","- 学生和伙伴比较活动单，看答案是否正确。",0],["h3","10.3 Choose the correct answer.","10.3 选出正确的答案。",0],["li","- Have students complete the exercise in their books individually.","- 让学生在书上各自完成练习。",0],["li","- Use the website to check answers. Have individual students take turns to do the questions on the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 用网站核对答案，让个别学生轮流在触控一体机上做题目。",0],["h3","10.4 Fill in the blanks and complete the puzzle.","10.4 填空并完成谜题。",0],["li","- Have students complete the exercise in their books individually.","- 让学生在书上各自完成练习。",0],["li","- Compare answers with a partner when finished.","- 完成后和伙伴比对答案。",0],["h3","10.5 Look at the verb chart below and practice with your teacher.","10.5 看下面的动词表并和老师练习。",0],["li","- Drill the verbs in the chart with students.","- 和学生操练表中的动词。",0],["li","- Say: \"climb\" and \"right now\", and make a present continues sentence such as \"He is climbing a tree right now.\" Say \"yesterday\", and make a sentence:","- 说 \"climb\" 和 \"right now\"，再造一个现在进行时的句子，例如 \"He is climbing a tree right now.\"。说 \"yesterday\"，再造句：",0],["p","\"He climbed a tree yesterday\"","\"He climbed a tree yesterday.\"",0],["li","- Say \"laugh\", \"right now\" and encourage students to make present continuous sentences with these two words. Say \"yesterday\", and encourage students to make past tense sentences with \"answer\" and \"yesterday\".","- 说 \"laugh\"、\"right now\"，鼓励学生用这两个字造现在进行时的句子。说 \"yesterday\"，鼓励学生用这个动词和 \"yesterday\" 造过去时的句子。",0],["li","- Continue with other verbs in the chart.","- 表中其他动词照同样方式进行。",0],["h3","10.6 Sing along with your teacher.","10.6 跟着老师一起唱。",0],["li","- Play the song using the website and sing along with the students.","- 用网站播放歌曲，和学生一起唱。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Second Class","第二节课",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","To start the class","开始上课",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Mr. and Mrs. Liu want to fix and clean up their home. They need something from","刘先生和刘太太想修理并整理家里。他们需要车库里的一些东西。",0],["h3","the garage. Listen and connect the situations to the suitable object.","听一听，把情境和适合的物品连起来。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog of \"Let's Check\" section as the introduction of the second listening exercise, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's Check:","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导，如下所示。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","People often leave many things in the garage. What can we find in the picture? We can find a broom, a hammer, nails, screws, rope and a ladder. We also see a license plate and tires for the car. Please turn to page 42. Let's check. Mr. and Mrs. Liu want to fix and clean up their home. They need something from the garage. Listen and connect the situations to the suitable object.","人们常把很多东西放在车库里。我们在图中可以找到什么？可以找到扫帚、锤子、钉子、螺丝、绳子和梯子，也看到汽车的车牌和轮胎。请翻到第 42 页。Let's check。刘先生和刘太太想修理并整理家里，他们需要车库里的一些东西。听一听，把情境和适合的物品连起来。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["li","- Review / point out the key words to the class in the listening exercise.","- 向全班复习／指出听力练习中的关键字。",0],["li","- Explain the exercise to the students and make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise while listening to the MP3.","- 向学生说明练习方式，确定说明够清楚，让学生能一边听 MP3 一边做练习。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","继续为全班播放 MP3 做听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teachers can play the dialog to the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the book.","- 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","- Preview homework. Write a few examples on the board to make sure students know what to do.","- 预习作业。在白板上写几个例子，确定学生知道要做什么。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","- Write down the points covered in the lesson and have students copy them down in their progress reports.","- 写下本课涵盖的重点，让学生抄到进度报告上。",0],["li","- Check progress reports and give comments.","- 检查进度报告并写评语。",0]],"g":[[34,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V"]],[34,["Book 8","Classroom Readers","Lesson 10","10.3","10.4","10.5"]],[85,["● Follow the steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":110},{"z":"第 14 课","t":"Class 14","k":"class","p":[53,54],"b":[["h2","Review Day 2","复习日 2",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","Classroom readers:","课堂读本：",0],["h3","Lesson 4 to lesson 6","第 4 课到第 6 课",0],["h3","Classroom Activities",null,0],["p","Lesson 6 to lesson 10","第 6 课到第 10 课",0],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",0],["p","Lesson6 to lesson 10","第 6 课到第 10 课",0],["h3","Sentence patterns","句型",0],["p","Lesson 6 to lesson 10","第 6 课到第 10 课",0],["h3","IPA Phonetics","国际音标",0],["p","Lesson6 to lesson 10","第 6 课到第 10 课",0],["h3","EEC",null,0],["p","To shake your finger to forbid something Teaching aids: Flashcards, digital equipment, test papers, tape recorder, S8 listening quiz, cassette tape","摇手指表示禁止某事　教具：单词卡、数字设备、考卷、录音机、S8 听力小测验、录音带",0],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 10","EEC 4 第 10 课",0],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",0],["p","Broom, hammer, nail, bolt, rope, ladder, license, plate, tire",null,0],["h3","Dialogue","对话",0],["d","What are you doing, Maggie?","A",0],["d","I'm picking up these pieces of glass.","B",0],["d","You didn't break the vase, did you?","A",0],["d","I'm sorry.","B",0],["d","How did you do that?","A",0],["d","I was bouncing the ball and..","B",0],["d","I've talked to you about that.","A",0],["d","I know. I'm sorry.","B",0],["d","It's OK. Accidents happen but don't play with the ball in the garage.","A",0],["p","N:( The mother is disappointed and shakes her finger at the girl.","N：（妈妈很失望，对女孩摇摇手指。）",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Review (30 mins)","复习 Review（30 mins）",0],["p","The teacher can use the first thirty minutes of the class for focusing on work that students need to know for the test. The teacher should spend this time reviewing areas where the students seem to be having difficulty. Do a review of phonics, sentence patterns and dialogue, as well as vocabulary. Make use of the touchscreen all-in-one for drill work and consult the section: \"To the teachers\" in the manual to select more useful games and activities. . Review for the quiz. Get a copy of it and go over each portion. Do not ask any questions directly from the test. Rephrase the questions or ask similar questions to the students. Do one example from each section of the test.","老师可以用这堂课前三十分钟，着重在学生考试需要知道的内容。这段时间应复习学生似乎有困难的地方：自然拼读、句型和对话，以及单词。用触控一体机做操练，并参考手册中“给老师”的部分选择更多有用的游戏和活动。小测验复习：拿一份小测验卷逐部分讲评。不要直接问考卷上的题目，换个说法或问学生类似的问题。考卷的每个部分各做一个例子。",0],["h2","Quiz (30 mins)","小测验 Quiz（30 mins）",0],["p","Get every student settled down and hand out the quiz. Do tell students that everyone should concentrate on his/her own work only and not lend help to anyone else. Make sure nobody copies answers from someone else.","让每位学生安静坐好并发下小测验卷。告诉学生每个人只能专心做自己的，不能帮别人。确定没有人抄别人的答案。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Listening Quiz (20 mins)","听力小测验 Listening Quiz（20 mins）",0],["p","After the students have finished the quiz, prepare them for the listening quiz. Play the tape, and let them write down their responses. Only play the tape once or twice.","学生考完小测验后，让他们准备听力小测验。播放录音带让他们写下答案，录音只播一两次。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the suitable place for their performance. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation about what they can do to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生依照自己的表现在适当的位置打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group to do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease in terms of achieving the functional goals of this lesson. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation. Please refer to the appendix for the MP3 script and answers of \"Let's Check\" section.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，达到本课的功能目标，同时注意学生的发音和语调。注意：“Let's Check”部分的 MP3 对话稿和答案请参考附录。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 7","电话教学教材 7",0],["li","1. Does your father go to bed early?","1. Does your father go to bed early?（你爸爸很早睡吗？）",0],["li","2. How much money do you have?","2. How much money do you have?（你有多少钱？）",0],["li","3. How much is a bottle of milk?","3. How much is a bottle of milk?（一瓶牛奶多少钱？）",0],["li","4. How many pieces of meat do you have?","4. How many pieces of meat do you have?（你有几块肉？）",0],["li","5. How do you spell \"meat\"?","5. How do you spell \"meat\"?（\"meat\" 怎么拼？）",0]],"g":[[29,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson IV","Book 8","Classroom Readers","Lesson6- Lesson 10"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Review Day","m":95},{"z":"第 15 课","t":"Class 15","k":"class","p":[55],"b":[["h2","Test Day 2","测验日 2",0],["p","Classroom readers:","课堂读本：",0],["p","Lesson 4 to lesson 6 Classroom Activities:","第 4 课到第 6 课　课堂活动：",0],["p","Lesson 6 to lesson 10","第 6 课到第 10 课",0],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",0],["p","Lesson6 to lesson 10","第 6 课到第 10 课",0],["h3","Sentence patterns","句型",0],["p","Lesson 6 to lesson 10 IPA Phonetics:","第 6 课到第 10 课国际音标：",0],["p","Lesson6 to lesson 10 Teaching aids: Flashcards, digital equipment, test papers.","第 6 课到第 10 课　教具：单词卡、数字设备、考卷。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Review","复习",0],["h3","(40 mins)","（40 mins）",0],["p","Give an overview of the quiz to the students. Identify problem areas for the students and explain the grammar where most of them have a lack of proper understanding. Then ask the students to correct their own mistakes. Monitor the progress of the students and their ability to do corrections independently. Now review all the quiz answers and ask students to check their corrections. Do a quick review of lessons 6 to lesson 10.","和学生总览小测验。找出学生的问题所在，针对大多数人理解不够的语法加以解释，再让学生自己订正错误。观察学生的进度和独立订正的能力。接着讲评所有小测验答案，让学生检查自己的订正。快速复习第 6 课到第 10 课。",0],["h2","Test (50mins)","测验 Test（50 mins）",0],["p","Take one example from each section of the test paper and review it with the students. Do not take questions direct from the paper, but use questions similar to those in the test when you give the students examples on the board. Hand out the test and monitor the students to make sure they understand the instructions. If one finish early, let them draw, read, or take a quiet break.","从考卷每个部分各挑一个例子和学生复习。不要直接用考卷上的题目，在白板上举例时用和考题类似的题目。发下考卷并观察学生，确定他们理解说明。如果有人提早写完，让他们画画、阅读或安静休息。",0],["h2","The Oral Test 3-5 mins (each student)","口试 3–5 分钟（每位学生）",0],["p","Conduct the oral test outside the classroom with each student individually. Each question is worth four points, one for question comprehension, grammar, fluency and pronunciation. Give students enough time to answer a question and to correct themselves if they had made a mistake initially. Assign a classroom leader to monitor students' behavior","在教室外与每位学生个别进行口试。每题 4 分，理解问题、语法、流畅度和发音各 1 分。给学生足够的时间回答问题，并在一开始出错时有机会自己改正。指派一位班长维持学生秩序。",0],["h2","The Oral Test","口语测验题目",0],["li","1. How do you spell \"light\"?","1. How do you spell \"light\"?（\"light\" 怎么拼？）",0],["li","2. How much money do you have?","2. How much money do you have?（你有多少钱？）",0],["li","3. Is there enough juice? Yes....","3. Is there enough juice? Yes....（果汁够吗？够……）",0],["li","4. How many pieces of meat do you have? (Four)","4. How many pieces of meat do you have? (Four)（你有几块肉？（四块））",0],["li","5. How much is a bag of candy?","5. How much is a bag of candy?（一袋糖果多少钱？）",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["p","Inform the students that they are going to have an oral test today. Progress Report Book Check the students' progress and write comments in the progress report books","告知学生今天有口试。进度报告本：检查学生的进度，并在进度报告本上写评语。",0]],"g":[[10,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 8","classroom activities","Lesson 6-10"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Test Day","m":50},{"z":"第 16 课","t":"Class 16","k":"class","p":[56,57,58],"b":[["h2","Activity Day 2","活动日 2",0],["p","Classroom readers:","课堂读本：",0],["h3","Lesson 4 to lesson 6","第 4 课到第 6 课",0],["h3","Classroom Activities",null,0],["p","Lesson 6 to lesson 10","第 6 课到第 10 课",0],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",0],["p","Lesson6 to lesson 10","第 6 课到第 10 课",0],["h3","Sentence patterns","句型",0],["p","Lesson 6 to lesson 10","第 6 课到第 10 课",0],["h3","IPA Phonetics","国际音标",0],["p","Lesson 6 to lesson 10","第 6 课到第 10 课",0],["h3","Teaching aids","教具",0],["p","Flashcards, digital equipment, test papers.","单词卡、数字教学设备、测验卷",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Warm Up (15 mins)","热身 Warm Up（15 mins）",0],["p","Today is the second games/activities day for S8. There will be no field trip in this level. The focus for today is to reinforce things learned in the first two thirds of the S8 grammar practice and vocabulary. Follow the digital guide in the column on the right to find a digital exercise suitable for introducing today's activity class. The dialogue in exercise 7.3 is a good way to let the children use the grammar they have learned in sentences and conversation. Divide the class in two teams. Get a member from each team to say the parts in the dialogue. If anyone makes a mistake, then the team doesn't score a point.","今天是 S8 第二次游戏／活动日。这一级没有户外教学。今天的重点是加强 S8 前三分之二学过的语法练习和单词。依右栏的数字指引，找一个适合引入今天活动课的数字练习。练习 7.3 的对话很适合让孩子在句子和对话中运用学过的语法。把全班分成两队，每队派一人说出对话中的台词，出错的话该队就不得分。",0],["h2","Part one - Grammar Review.(40 mins)","第一部分——语法复习（40 分钟）",0],["li","1. Write the following sentences on the board just as they appear here. Do not add the correct grammar. After listing them on the board, choose individuals (one for each sentence) to come to the front to add the correct grammar. After they've finished, go over them with the class. Ask them if the grammar is right or wrong, and if not, have them correct it. All words are spelled correctly and no words need to be added, just grammar correction.","1. 把下面的句子照原样写在白板上，不要改正语法。写好后选几位学生（每句一位）到前面改正语法。改完后和全班一起讲评，问他们语法对不对，不对的话让他们改正。所有字的拼法都正确，也不需要加字，只需要改正语法（标点与大小写）。",0],["li","1. is Sarah older than, Joey.",null,0],["li","2. these Cookies are big?",null,0],["li","3. Sarah does her homework carefully",null,0],["li","4. does Joey play the piano!",null,0],["li","5. Ann is walking to school quickly",null,0],["li","6. how did Sarah write, her homework",null,0],["li","7. I like to play ball: but I'm sick today",null,0],["li","8. Joey's pencils are in My bag",null,0],["li","9. are Joey's pencils longer than Sarah's",null,0],["li","10. these cookies are big But those cookies are bigger",null,0],["h3","2. English spelling Bee","2. 英语拼写比赛",0],["li","- If you have time, conduct a spelling bee with the class. Let all the students stand up. They have to spell one of the words that were learned in S8. If they cannot spell a word, they sit down. The last one standing is the winner. You may ask the same student more than once to spell a word!","- 有时间的话，和全班举行拼写比赛。让所有学生站起来，每人要拼一个 S8 学过的字，拼不出来就坐下，最后站着的人获胜。同一位学生可以被问不只一次！",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Part two - More Grammar practice (45 mins)","第二部分——更多语法练习（45 分钟）",0],["li","1. Exercise more grammar practice using the first page of the classroom reader (lesson six). Make a photocopy of the page and erase some of the words. Now make copies for the whole class; the students must work according to the close procedure and correct the grammar by inserting the missing words . First let the class read from their books chorally and individually. Then let everybody close their books and put the books away as well. Give the students time to complete the exercise by filling in the words. Then divide the class into two groups and give the members of each group one sentence to read. If they read the sentence with the grammar inserted correctly, then the team scores one point.","1. 用课堂读本（第六课）第一页做更多语法练习。复印这一页并擦掉一些字，再为全班复印。学生要用克漏字的方式填入缺少的字来改正语法。先让全班看书齐声念和个别念，再让大家合上书并收起来。给学生时间填字完成练习。然后把全班分成两组，给每组成员一句念，正确填入语法并念出句子的队伍得一分。",0],["li","2. IPA spelling: again let the class members compete in two teams. Tell the students you have a list of words in English(together, suddenly, arrived, trouble, quickly, vacation, carefully, important, understand, enough, tomorrow, smaller, happier, longest, better). Line the teams up facing the board. Give the first student from each team the English word. They must run to the board and spell it in IPA If they are able to, they run back and touch the next person. You give the next word to the next person. The first team to spell all fifteen words correctly is the winner. If the student cannot spell the word, the other team members may yell the answer to help him/her along. Allow only one team member at the board at a time. If possible, give different words to the two teams, so that they can not copy from one another at the board.","2. 国际音标拼写：再让全班分成两队比赛。告诉学生你有一张英文单词表（together、suddenly、arrived、trouble、quickly、vacation、carefully、important、understand、enough、tomorrow、smaller、happier、longest、better）。让两队面向白板排好，给各队第一位学生一个英文字，他们要跑到白板用国际音标拼出来。拼得出来就跑回来碰下一个人，你再给下一个人下一个字。最先正确拼完全部十五个字的队伍获胜。学生拼不出来时，队友可以大声喊答案帮忙。白板前一次只能有一位队员。可能的话给两队不同的字，让他们无法在白板前互相抄。",0],["li","2. Words of measurement. Again have the class compete in two teams. Before starting, have the following words written on separate slips of paper.","2. 计量词。再让全班分成两队比赛。开始前把下列字写在不同的纸条上。",0],["h3","A slice of--------","A slice of--------（一片……）",0],["p","A piece of-------A piece of--------A cup of--------A bar of --------A bag of--------A bottle of------A bowl of--------Put all the slips into a bag and let one of the first team members draw a slip out of the bag. He/She must then Add a noun to the words of measurement to make a correct phrase (e.g. a bowl of rice, etc..) Other teammates are not allowed to help. If he/she is unable to answer correctly, ask the other team if they are able to answer. Award a point if they can. Only one person should try at a time. No one may say the same noun twice. Do write the phrases on the board as they are said, :e.g. a bottle of","A piece of------- A piece of-------- A cup of-------- A bar of -------- A bag of-------- A bottle of------ A bowl of--------　把所有纸条放进袋子，让第一队的一位队员抽一张，他／她要在计量词后加一个名词组成正确的短语（例如 a bowl of rice 等），其他队友不准帮忙。答不出来的话，问另一队能不能回答，答对就给分。一次只能一个人回答，同一个名词不能说两次。说出的短语要写在白板上，例如：a bottle of",0],["h3","milk, juice, water.","milk、juice、water。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["p","Remind the students about today 's telephone teaching. Ask a few questions similar to the contents of telephone teaching #8. Progress Report Book Check the progress of students individually. Write positive comments for enthusiastic participation in the activities.","提醒学生今天有电话教学。问几个类似电话教学 #8 内容的问题。进度报告本：逐一检查学生的进度，为热烈参与活动的学生写正面的评语。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 8","电话教学教材 8",0],["li","1. How do you spell \"light\"?","1. How do you spell \"light\"?（\"light\" 怎么拼？）",0],["li","2. How much is a cup of coffee?","2. How much is a cup of coffee?（一杯咖啡多少钱？）",0],["li","3. How much bread do you have?","3. How much bread do you have?（你有多少面包？）",0],["li","4. How many bags of candy do you have? Two","4. How many bags of candy do you have? Two（你有几袋糖果？两袋）",0],["li","5. Make a sentence with \"a bowl of\".","5. 用 \"a bowl of\" 造一个句子。",0]],"g":[[14,["Big kids","Lesson IV","Book 8","Classroom","Activities","Lesson 6 to lesson 10"]],[31,["● Follow the same steps","above"]],[31,["None"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Activity Day","m":110},{"z":"第 17 课","t":"Class 17","k":"class","p":[59,60,61,62],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["li","- To learn to use adverbs.","- 学习使用副词。",1],["li","- To review the present and the past tenses.","- 复习现在时和过去时。",1],["h3","Classroom Reader Lesson 7","课堂读本第 7 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","calm, important, news, Africa, doctor, excited",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 8B Lesson 11","课堂活动 8B 第 11 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","carefully, carelessly, happily, sadly, quietly, noisily, quickly, slowly",null,1],["h3","Sentence patterns","句型",1],["p","How is/was/were/do/does/did________? Subject+ Verb+ adverb","How is/was/were/do/does/did________?　主语＋动词＋副词",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Move your arms to celebrate Express happiness and encouragement","挥动手臂庆祝；表达快乐和鼓励",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Digital material","数字教材",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 11","EEC 4 第 11 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Twenty, seventeen, twelve, forty-two, nine, twenty-two, eight",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","This Bingo is exciting!","A",1],["d","Not for me.","B",1],["d","Did you hear? Did you hear?","A",1],["d","Yes...number eighteen","B",1],["d","Yippee!","A",1],["d","I guess you win...","B",1],["d","yes, yes , yes! Bingo!","A",1],["d","Good for you","B",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (15 mins)","热身 Warm Up（15 mins）",0],["h3","Pre-teach the use of adverbs","预先教副词的用法",0],["li","- Students stand in a circle.","- 学生站成一圈。",0],["li","- Clap your hands and have the students follow you.","- 拍手并让学生跟着你拍。",0],["li","- Ask students: \"What are we doing?\" Students say: \"We're clapping our hands. \" Say \"Quickly.\" while starting to clap your hands quickly. Have the students to follow you. Say: \"We're clapping our hands quickly.\" Have the students repeat after you.","- 问学生：\"What are we doing?\"，学生说：\"We're clapping our hands.\"。说 \"Quickly.\" 同时开始快速拍手，让学生跟着你。说：\"We're clapping our hands quickly.\"，让学生跟着你说。",0],["li","- Do the same with a couple more verbs and different adverbs (carefully, carelessly, happily, sadly, quietly, noisily, quickly, slowly) while performing the actions.","- 再用几个动词和不同的副词（carefully、carelessly、happily、sadly、quietly、noisily、quickly、slowly）一边做动作一边练习。",0],["li","- Have individual students give the instructions while the rest of the class follows.","- 让个别学生下指令，其他人跟着做。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (30 mins) Lesson 7 Important News!","课堂读本（30 分钟）第 7 课 Important News!（重要消息！）",0],["h3","10. Prediction","10. 预测",0],["li","- Introduce the new characters on page 30 and 31 in the book or on the website.","- 用书上第 30、31 页或网站介绍新角色。",0],["li","- Have students open their books to lesson 7 and look at the pictures. Ask students the following questions about the story:","- 让学生打开书到第 7 课看图，问学生下列关于故事的问题：",0],["p","\"What can you see in the pictures?\" \"Who are they?\"","\"What can you see in the pictures?\"（你在图中看到什么？）\"Who are they?\"（他们是谁？）",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","\"What do you think they do?\" \"How are they feeling? Are they happy or sad?\" (Pre-teach excited here.) \"Why do you think they are excited?\"","\"What do you think they do?\"（你认为他们是做什么的？）\"How are they feeling? Are they happy or sad?\"（他们感觉如何？开心还是难过？）（在这里预先教 excited）\"Why do you think they are excited?\"（你认为他们为什么兴奋？）",0],["li","- Ask students to predict what will happen in today's story.","- 请学生预测今天的故事会发生什么事。",0],["h3","3. Listen to the story","3. 听故事",0],["li","- Play the story on MP3. Ask students questions about the story. Ask students if their predictions were right.","- 用 MP3 播放故事，问学生关于故事的问题，问他们预测得对不对。",0],["h3","4. Reader","4. 读本",0],["li","- Play the story again on the website.","- 在网站上再播一次故事。",0],["li","- Pause after every sentence. Ask the students to repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 每句后暂停，让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["li","- Explain new words when they come up in the story using gestures, pictures, example sentences and so on.","- 故事中出现新单词时，用手势、图片、例句等解释。",0],["h3","5. New words","5. 新单词",0],["li","- Students should be pretty familiar with the new words by now. To reinforce it, play the 'New Word' section on the website and have students repeat after it.","- 学生这时应该已经相当熟悉新单词了。为了加强，播放网站上的“New Word”部分，让学生跟着念。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (40 mins) Lesson 11","课堂活动（40 分钟）第 11 课",0],["h3","11.1 Vocabulary","11.1 单词",0],["li","- Introduce the adverbs on the touchscreen all-in-one","- 在触控一体机上介绍副词。",0],["li","- Have the students repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["h3","11.2 Look at the picture and practice with your teacher.","11.2 看图和老师练习。",0],["li","- Look at the picture on page 17.","- 看第 17 页的图。",0],["li","- Ask students to talk about the pictures by comparing how Sarah and Joey do things differently. Students make sentences such as: \"Sarah writes homework carefully. Joey writes his homework carelessly.\"","- 请学生比较 Sarah 和 Joey 做事方式的不同来谈论图片，造出这样的句子：\"Sarah writes homework carefully. Joey writes his homework carelessly.\"",0],["h3","11.3 Look at the picture, add the adverbs and make two sentences.","11.3 看图加上副词，造两个句子。",0],["li","- Go through the examples with the students. Have students complete the exercise in pairs so that they can help each other.","- 和学生一起看例子，让学生两两完成练习，互相帮忙。",0],["li","- Call on pairs to read their answers to the class. One read the first answer, and the other the second. Check the answers using the website. You can ask students to type their answers in or simply play the answers.","- 请各组向全班念出答案，一人念第一个答案，另一人念第二个。用网站核对答案，可以让学生输入答案或直接播放答案。",0],["h3","11.4 Answer the questions according to the pictures in Exercise 11.3.","11.4 根据练习 11.3 的图回答问题。",0],["li","- Do this on the website.","- 在网站上做。",0],["li","- Click on the monkeys at the top of the screen to play questions.","- 点屏幕上方的猴子播放问题。",0],["li","- Put the students into two teams. If Team A answers the question: \"Joey writes his homework carelessly.\" and scores a point, Team B should say: \"Joey carelessly writes his homework.\" to also score a point.","- 把学生分成两队。如果 A 队回答 \"Joey writes his homework carelessly.\" 得一分，B 队就要说 \"Joey carelessly writes his homework.\" 也得一分。",0],["li","- At any time when one team fails to answer accurately, the other team gets a chance to score two points for that question by answering in both ways.","- 任何时候一队答得不正确，另一队就有机会用两种说法回答，为那一题得两分。",0],["li","- Have students write down the answers individually. Walk around the classroom and monitor.","- 让学生各自写下答案。在教室里走动观察。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h3","11.5 Change the position of the adverbs in the sentences below.","11.5 改变下面句子中副词的位置。",0],["li","- Go through the exercise orally as a class.","- 全班一起口头做一遍练习。",0],["li","- Have students complete the exercise individually. Walk around the classroom and monitor.","- 让学生各自完成练习。在教室里走动观察。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See And Say.\"","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Context Introduction:","情境介绍：",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students to listen to the monologue of \"Let's See and Say\" section in lesson one. The teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's See & Say:","老师让学生听第 3 课“Let's See and Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听，如下所示。Let's See & Say 独白：",0],["p","What will you do when you feel happy and excited about something? Will you move your arms to celebrate? The boy won the bingo game. He looks very happy. Let's listen to how happy he is.","当你对某件事感到开心兴奋时会怎么做？你会挥动手臂庆祝吗？男孩赢了宾果游戏，他看起来非常开心。我们来听听他有多开心。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have just listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasise for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialogue to the class for the second time and have the students to repeat after the narrator. Remind the students listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialogue. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialog that the students have just practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialog to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with the others. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the type of conversation in the real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the book.","- 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","- Preview homework. Write a few examples on the board to make sure students know what to do.","- 预习作业。在白板上写几个例子，确定学生知道要做什么。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","- Write down the points covered in the lesson and have students copy them down in their progress reports.","- 写下本课涵盖的重点，让学生抄到进度报告上。",0],["li","- Check progress reports and give comments.","- 检查进度报告并写评语。",0]],"g":[[35,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 8"]],[35,["Classroom Readers","Lesson 7","Reader","New Words"]],[51,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V","Book 8","Classroom Activities","Lesson 11","11.1","11.3","11.4"]],[90,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Important News!"],"bd":"","m":110},{"z":"第 18 课","t":"Class 18","k":"class","p":[63,64,65,66],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["li","- To make comparisons: comparatives","- 做比较：比较级",1],["li","- To describe a plane journey","- 描述搭飞机的旅程",1],["h3","Classroom Reader Lesson 8","课堂读本第 8 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","airport, gate, ticket, board(ed), older, than, nerd, smarter, stewardess",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 8B Lesson 12","课堂活动 8B 第 12 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","taller, fatter, longer, bigger",null,1],["h3","Sentence patterns","句型",1],["p","________ is ______er than ______.","________ is ______er than ______.（……比……更……）",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","move your arms to celebrate Express happiness and enthusiasm","挥动手臂庆祝；表达快乐和热情",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["li","- A photocopy of Classroom Activity B page 22. Cut out the pictures.","- 课堂活动 B 册第 22 页的复印件，把图剪下来。",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 11","EEC 4 第 11 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Twenty, seventeen, twelve, forty-two, nine, twenty-two, eight",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","This Bingo is exciting!","A",1],["d","Not for me.","B",1],["d","Did you hear? Did you hear?","A",1],["d","Yes...number eighteen","B",1],["d","Yippee!","A",1],["d","I guess you win...","B",1],["d","yes, yes , yes! Bingo!","A",1],["d","Good for you","B",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (25 mins)","热身（25 分钟）",0],["p","Pre-teach Comparisons","预先教比较",0],["li","- Ask two students stand in the front of the classroom. Ask the class: \"Who's taller, _____ or _____(names of the two students)?\" Say: \"______ is taller.\" and have the students repeat after you.","- 请两位学生站在教室前面，问全班：\"Who's taller, _____ or _____（两位学生的名字）?\"，说：\"______ is taller.\"，让学生跟着你说。",0],["li","- Do a couple more examples to teach older than, thinner than and so on.","- 再做几个例子教 older than、thinner than 等。",0],["li","- Have students make sentences and compare.","- 让学生造句比较。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (30 mins) Lesson 8 On the Airplane!","课堂读本（30 分钟）第 8 课 On the Airplane!（在飞机上！）",0],["h3","1. Prediction","1. 预测",0],["li","- Have students open their books to lesson 7 and look at the pictures. Ask students the following questions about the story:","- 让学生打开书到第 7 课看图，问学生下列关于故事的问题：",0],["p","\"Where were they?\" (Pre-teach airport and gate here) \"Where were they going?\" \"Who is that lady?\" (Pre-teach stewardess here) \"What is she collecting from the father? Why?\" (Pre-teach board here) \"What were they doing on the plane?\"","\"Where were they?\"（他们在哪里？）（在这里预先教 airport 和 gate）\"Where were they going?\"（他们要去哪里？）\"Who is that lady?\"（那位女士是谁？）（在这里预先教 stewardess）\"What is she collecting from the father? Why?\"（她向爸爸收什么？为什么？）（在这里预先教 board）\"What were they doing on the plane?\"（他们在飞机上做什么？）",0],["li","- Ask students to predict what will happen in today's story.","- 请学生预测今天的故事会发生什么事。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h3","2. Listen to the story","2. 听故事",0],["li","- Play the story on MP3. Ask students some more questions about the story. Ask students if their predictions were right.","- 用 MP3 播放故事，再问学生一些关于故事的问题，问他们预测得对不对。",0],["h3","3. Reader","3. 读本",0],["li","- Play the story again on the website.","- 在网站上再播一次故事。",0],["li","- Pause after every sentence. Ask the students to repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 每句后暂停，让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["li","- Explain new words when they come up in the story using gestures, pictures, example sentences and so on.","- 故事中出现新单词时，用手势、图片、例句等解释。",0],["h3","4. New words","4. 新单词",0],["li","- Students should be pretty familiar with the new words by now. To reinforce it, play the 'New Word' section on the website and have students repeat after it.","- 学生这时应该已经相当熟悉新单词了。为了加强，播放网站上的“New Word”部分，让学生跟着念。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (45 mins) Lesson 12","课堂活动（45 分钟）第 12 课",0],["h3","12.1 Vocabulary","12.1 单词",0],["li","- Introduce the new words on the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 在触控一体机上介绍新单词。",0],["li","- Have students try to pronounce the words using phonics rules.","- 让学生运用自然拼读规则试着念出这些字。",0],["li","- Click on the words to play the sound and to show the pictures. Have the students repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 点这些字播放声音并显示图片，让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["h3","12.2 Look at the pictures and practice with your teacher.","12.2 看图和老师练习。",0],["li","- Show pictures 1-6 on the website. Ask students to describe the pictures. Help them to use comparisons: \"______is ______er than _______.\"","- 在网站上展示图 1–6，请学生描述图片，帮助他们使用比较句：\"______ is ______er than _______.\"",0],["h3","A. Practice the sentences below.","A. 练习下面的句子。",0],["li","- Pair-work: students practice saying the sentences in pairs.","- 两人一组：学生两两练习说句子。",0],["h3","B. Answer the questions below.","B. 回答下面的问题。",0],["li","- Go through the examples with the students, and have them complete the exercise in pairs. Walk around and help if needed.","- 和学生一起看例子，让他们两两完成练习。在教室里走动，需要时给予协助。",0],["li","- Photocopy page 22 in Classroom Activity B. Cut out the pictures and put them in a bag.","- 复印课堂活动 B 册第 22 页，把图剪下来放进袋子。",0],["li","- Put students into two teams. Student A from Team A draws a picture from the bag and students from that team make a question together about that picture: \"Is /Are _____ _____er than _____?\" Student A from Team B answers that question in the correct form to score one point for the team.","- 把学生分成两队。A 队的学生 A 从袋子抽一张图，该队学生一起针对那张图提问：\"Is/Are _____ _____er than _____?\"。B 队的学生 A 用正确形式回答，为队伍得一分。",0],["li","- Continue the game by having Student A from Team B draw a picture from the bag and repeat the same procedure.","- 接着由 B 队的学生 A 从袋子抽图，重复同样程序继续游戏。",0],["li","- Play the questions and answers on the website. Have the students repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 在网站上播放问题和答案，让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["h3","12.3 Look at the pictures and make sentences using comparisons.","12.3 看图用比较级造句。",0],["li","- Show the picture on the website. Have students make sentences to describe the pictures as a class.","- 在网站上展示图片，全班一起造句描述图片。",0],["li","- Have students complete the exercise in the book individually. Walk around and help if necessary.","- 让学生在书上各自完成练习。在教室里走动，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","12.4 Choose the correct letter to complete the sentences.","12.4 选出正确的字母完成句子。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["li","- Go through the examples with the students, and have them complete the exercise in pairs. Walk around and help if needed.","- 和学生一起看例子，让他们两两完成练习。在教室里走动，需要时给予协助。",0],["li","- Book closed. Read the first half of the first sentence in the lower part of the page. Have students complete the sentence.","- 合上书。念出页面下方第一句的前半句，让学生完成句子。",0],["li","- Continue with the rest of the sentences and have students to say the second half of the sentences. Encourage them to be creative and make their own sentences.","- 其余句子也照样进行，让学生说出后半句。鼓励他们发挥创意造自己的句子。",0],["h3","12.5 Look at the IPA phonetic spelling. Read and write the word.","12.5 看国际音标拼法，念出并写出这个字。",0],["li","- Go through the examples with the students, and have them complete the exercise in pairs. Walk around and help if needed.","- 和学生一起看例子，让他们两两完成练习。在教室里走动，需要时给予协助。",0],["li","- Call on individual students to pronounce the words.","- 叫个别学生念出这些字。",0],["li","12.6 Listen to the word and write the number of the stressed syllable.","12.6 听单词，写出重音所在的音节号码。",0],["li","- Say a few 3-syllable words that are not on this page. Ask students where the stress is after saying each word.","- 说几个这页没有的三音节字，每说一个就问学生重音在哪里。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","To start the class","开始上课",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["h3","This is a bingo card. Listen and check the numbers.","这是一张宾果卡。听一听，勾出数字。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog of \"Let's Check\" section as the introduction of the second listening exercise, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's Check:","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导，如下所示。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","What is your lucky number? Does it always bring you good luck? Please turn the page Let's check. This is a bingo card. Listen and check the numbers.","你的幸运数字是什么？它总是带给你好运吗？请翻页。Let's check。这是一张宾果卡。听一听，勾出数字。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["li","- Review / point out the key words to the class in the listening exercise.","- 向全班复习／指出听力练习中的关键字。",0],["li","- Explain the exercise to the students and make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise while listening to the MP3.","- 向学生说明练习方式，确定说明够清楚，让学生能一边听 MP3 一边做练习。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","继续为全班播放 MP3 做听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teachers can play the dialog to the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the book.","- 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","- Preview homework. Write a few examples on the board to make sure students know what to do.","- 预习作业。在白板上写几个例子，确定学生知道要做什么。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","- Write down the points covered in the lesson and have students copy them down in their progress reports.","- 写下本课涵盖的重点，让学生抄到进度报告上。",0],["li","- Check progress reports and give comments.","- 检查进度报告并写评语。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 9","电话教学教材 9",0],["li","1. Is your father older than you?","1. Is your father older than you?（你爸爸比你大吗？）",0],["li","2. Is your mother taller than you?","2. Is your mother taller than you?（你妈妈比你高吗？）",0],["li","3. Are your parents smarter than you?","3. Are your parents smarter than you?（你爸妈比你聪明吗？）",0],["li","4. Make a sentence with \"the happiest\"","4. 用 \"the happiest\" 造一个句子。",0],["li","5. Make a sentence with \"the biggest\".","5. 用 \"the biggest\" 造一个句子。",0]],"g":[[33,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 8","Classroom Readers","Lesson 8","Reader"]],[33,["New Words"]],[47,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 8","classroom Activities","Lesson12","Exercise 12.1-12.6"]],[75,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["On the Airplane!"],"bd":"","m":125},{"z":"第 19 课","t":"Class 19","k":"class","p":[67,68,69],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["li","- To make comparisons: Comparatives and superlatives","- 做比较：比较级和最高级",1],["h3","Classroom Reader Lesson 9","课堂读本第 9 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","arrive(d), Kenya, Oldest, kill(ed), missing",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 8B Lesson 13","课堂活动 8B 第 13 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","smaller, smallest, happier, happiest, tallest, fattest, longest",null,1],["h3","Sentence patterns","句型",1],["p","_____ is/was _____. _____ is/was _____er than ______. _____ is/was the _____est.","_____ is/was _____. _____ is/was _____er than ______. _____ is/was the _____est.（……是最……的）",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Move your arms to celebrate Express happiness and enthusiasm","挥动手臂庆祝；表达快乐和热情",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","The digital medium","数字教材",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 11","EEC 4 第 11 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Twenty, seventeen, twelve, forty-two, nine, twenty-two, eight",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","This Bingo is exciting!","A",1],["d","Not for me.","B",1],["d","Did you hear? Did you hear?","A",1],["d","Yes...number eighteen","B",1],["d","Yippee!","A",1],["d","I guess you win...","B",1],["d","yes, yes , yes! Bingo!","A",1],["d","Good for you","B",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["p","Review Comparatives and Pre-teach Superlatives","复习比较级并预先教最高级",0],["li","- Ask students to hold one pencil in their hand without being seen by other students.","- 请学生手上拿一支铅笔，不让其他学生看到。",0],["li","- Ask two students, Student A and B, to come to the front with their pencils.","- 请两位学生 A 和 B 带着铅笔到前面。",0],["li","- Ask the rest of the class to guess who's pencil is longer by saying \"____'s pencil is longer than ____'s.\" Have the two students show their pencils to the class and compare to see if the rest of the students were right.","- 请其他同学猜谁的铅笔比较长，说 \"____'s pencil is longer than ____'s.\"。让两位学生向全班展示铅笔并比较，看其他学生猜得对不对。",0],["li","- Ask one more student, Student C, to come to the front. Ask students to guess who's pencil is the longer, Student A or C? Student B or C? Then compare their pencils.","- 再请一位学生 C 到前面，请学生猜 A 和 C 谁的铅笔比较长？B 和 C 呢？然后比较他们的铅笔。",0],["li","- Say \"______'s pencil is the longest.\" and \"_____'s pencil is the shortest.\" And have the students repeat after you.","- 说 \"______'s pencil is the longest.\" 和 \"_____'s pencil is the shortest.\"，让学生跟着你说。",0],["li","- Do a couple more examples following the same steps to make sure that students grasp the idea.","- 照同样步骤再做几个例子，确定学生掌握这个概念。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (25 mins) Lesson 9 Meeting the","课堂读本（25 分钟）第 9 课 Meeting the",0],["h2","Youngs","Youngs（认识 Young 一家）",0],["h3","1. Prediction","1. 预测",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["li","- Have students open their books to lesson 7 and look at the pictures. Ask students the questions about the story and pre-teach some of the new words while you are doing so.","- 让学生打开书看图，问学生关于故事的问题，同时预先教一些新单词。",0],["li","- Ask students to predict what will happen in today's story.","- 请学生预测今天的故事会发生什么事。",0],["h3","2. Listen to the story","2. 听故事",0],["li","- Play the story on MP3. Ask students questions about the story. Ask students if their predictions were right.","- 用 MP3 播放故事，问学生关于故事的问题，问他们预测得对不对。",0],["h3","3. Reader","3. 读本",0],["li","- Play the story again on the website.","- 在网站上再播一次故事。",0],["li","- Pause after every sentence. Ask the students to repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 每句后暂停，让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["li","- Explain new words when they come up in the story using gestures, pictures, example sentences and so on.","- 故事中出现新单词时，用手势、图片、例句等解释。",0],["h3","4 New words","4 新单词",0],["li","- Students should be pretty familiar with the new words by now. To reinforce it, play the 'New Word' section on the website and have students repeat after it.","- 学生这时应该已经相当熟悉新单词了。为了加强，播放网站上的“New Word”部分，让学生跟着念。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (50 mins) Lesson 13","课堂活动（50 分钟）第 13 课",0],["h3","13.1 Vocabulary","13.1 单词",0],["li","- Introduce the new words on the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 在触控一体机上介绍新单词。",0],["li","- Have the students repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["h3","13.2 Look at the pictures and practice with your teacher.","13.2 看图和老师练习。",0],["h3","A. Make sentences comparing the three pictures.","A. 比较三张图造句。",0],["li","- Show pictures on the website. Ask students to describe the pictures. Help them to use comparisons: \"_____ was ___.\" \" ______is ______er than _______.\" and ______ is the ____est.\"","- 在网站上展示图片，请学生描述图片，帮助他们使用比较句：\"_____ was ___.\"、\"______ is ______er than _______.\" 和 \"______ is the ____est.\"",0],["li","- Have students complete the exercise. Walk around the classroom and help if needed.","- 让学生完成练习。在教室里走动，需要时给予协助。",0],["h3","B. Answer the questions below according to the pictures in A.","B. 根据 A 的图回答下面的问题。",0],["li","- Go through the examples with the students, and have them complete the exercise in pairs. Walk around and help if needed.","- 和学生一起看例子，让他们两两完成练习。在教室里走动，需要时给予协助。",0],["li","- Photocopy page 32 and 33 in Classroom Activity B. Cut out the pictures and put them in a bag.","- 复印课堂活动 B 册第 32 和 33 页，把图剪下来放进袋子。",0],["li","- Put students into two teams. Student A from Team A draws a picture from the bag and makes a question together about that picture: \"Who was _____ , _____ or _____?\" Student A from Team B answers that question in the correct form to score one point for the team.","- 把学生分成两队。A 队的学生 A 从袋子抽一张图，一起针对那张图提问：\"Who was _____, _____ or _____?\"。B 队的学生 A 用正确形式回答，为队伍得一分。",0],["li","- Continue the game by having Student A from Team B draw a picture from the bag and repeat the same procedure.","- 接着由 B 队的学生 A 从袋子抽图，重复同样程序继续游戏。",0],["li","- Play the questions and answers on the website. Have the students repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 在网站上播放问题和答案，让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["h3","13.3 Look at the answers and make questions.","13.3 看答案写出问题。",0],["li","- Go through the questions with students and have them answer orally.","- 和学生逐题看并口头回答。",0],["li","- Students complete the exercise in their books individually. Walk around the","- 学生在书上各自完成练习。在教室里",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","classroom and monitor.","走动观察。",0],["li","- Pair-work: Students practice asking and answering questions in pairs.","- 两人一组：学生两两练习问答。",0],["li","- Put students into groups of 3-4. Each group of students come up with 3 or more questions about the picture.","- 把学生分成 3–4 人一组，每组想 3 个以上关于图片的问题。",0],["li","- Students take turns asking students from different groups questions","- 学生轮流向不同组的学生提问。",0],["h3","Activity Sheet 5","活动单 5",0],["li","- In activity 1, students write sentences to make comparisons about the things in the pictures. Tell students to draw things of their own choice in the blank box.","- 在活动 1 中，学生写句子比较图中的东西。告诉学生在空白方格画自己选的东西。",0],["li","- In activity 2, students get into groups of 3. They compare something that they all have and then write sentences to describe it.","- 在活动 2 中，学生三人一组，比较他们都有的某样东西，再写句子描述。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the suitable place for their performance. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation about what they can do to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生依照自己的表现在适当的位置打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["li","Step3:","步骤 3：",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group to do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease in terms of achieving the functional goals of this lesson. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，达到本课的功能目标，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the book.","- 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","- Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["li","- Preview homework. Write a few examples on the board to make sure students know what to do.","- 预习作业。在白板上写几个例子，确定学生知道要做什么。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","- Write down the points covered in the lesson and have students copy them down in their progress reports.","- 写下本课涵盖的重点，让学生抄到进度报告上。",0],["li","- Check progress reports and give comments.","- 检查进度报告并写评语。",0]],"g":[[36,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 8","Classroom Reader","Lesson 9","Reader","New Word"]],[49,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 8","Classroom Activities","Lesson 13","13.1","13.2A","13.2B"]],[49,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids"]],[49,["儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 8","Classroom Activities","Lesson 13","13.6"]],[74,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Meeting the"],"bd":"","m":110},{"z":"第 20 课","t":"Class 20","k":"class","p":[70,71,72,73],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["li","- To make comparisons: more, the most","- 做比较：more、the most",1],["h3","Classroom Reader Lesson 10","课堂读本第 10 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","point, Masumba, Kiku, shoulder, more, afraid",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 8B Lesson 14","课堂活动 8B 第 14 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","better, the best, more, most, expensive",null,1],["h3","Sentence patterns","句型",1],["p","_____ is _____. _____ is more ______ than ______. _____ is the most _______ of all.","_____ is _____. _____ is more ______ than ______.（……比……更……）_____ is the most _______ of all.（……是所有当中最……的）",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Express a pleasant feeling Express surprise Give a hug","表达愉快的感觉；表达惊讶；给一个拥抱",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["li","- Photos of movie stars/singers.","- 电影明星／歌手的照片。",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 12","EEC 4 第 12 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Jack-o-Lantern, bat , ghost; witch, monster, spider, vampire, cauldron",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","I don't believe my eyes!","A",1],["d","Believe it. It's me.","B",1],["d","Tony! It's so nice to see you again!","A",1],["d","I'm happy to see you too.","B",1],["d","Give me a hug.","A",1],["d","Hey-hey. It's always nice to see friends.","B",1],["d","You look well","A",1],["d","You too, Mike.","B",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["p","Pre-teach \"more\" and \"the most\".","预先教 \"more\" 和 \"the most\"。",0],["li","- Ask Student A, B, C how much their pencil cases cost respectively. Teach more expensive and the most expensive.","- 分别问学生 A、B、C 的铅笔盒多少钱，教 more expensive 和 the most expensive。",0],["li","- Show pictures of three well-know female/male movie starts. Ask them to compare and say who they think is the most beautiful/handsome.","- 展示三位知名女／男电影明星的照片，请学生比较并说出他们认为谁最漂亮／最帅。",0],["li","- Explain to the students that you use more and the most with words with 3 syllables or more because if you add er/est to the end of these words, it would be difficult to pronounce them.","- 向学生解释，三个音节以上的字用 more 和 the most，因为在这些字后面加 er/est 会很难念。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (25 mins) Lesson 10 Making New","课堂读本（25 分钟）第 10 课 Making New",0],["h2","Friends","Friends（交新朋友）",0],["h3","1. Prediction","1. 预测",0],["li","- Have students open their books to lesson 10 and look at the pictures. Ask students the","- 让学生打开书到第 10 课看图，问学生",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","questions about the picture and pre-teach some of the new words while you are doing so.","关于图片的问题，同时预先教一些新单词。",0],["li","- Ask students to predict what will happen in today's story.","- 请学生预测今天的故事会发生什么事。",0],["h3","2. Listen to the story","2. 听故事",0],["li","- Play the story on MP3. Ask students questions about the story. Ask students if their predictions were right.","- 用 MP3 播放故事，问学生关于故事的问题，问他们预测得对不对。",0],["h3","3. Reader","3. 读本",0],["li","- Play the story again on the website.","- 在网站上再播一次故事。",0],["li","- Pause after every sentence. Ask the students to repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 每句后暂停，让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["li","- Explain new words when they come up in the story using gestures, pictures, example sentences and so on.","- 故事中出现新单词时，用手势、图片、例句等解释。",0],["h3","4 New words","4 新单词",0],["li","- Students should be pretty familiar with the new words by now. To reinforce it, play the 'New Word' section on the website and have students repeat after it.","- 学生这时应该已经相当熟悉新单词了。为了加强，播放网站上的“New Word”部分，让学生跟着念。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (50 mins) Lesson 14","课堂活动（50 分钟）第 14 课",0],["h3","14.1 Vocabulary","14.1 单词",0],["li","- Introduce the new words on the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 在触控一体机上介绍新单词。",0],["li","- Have the students repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["h3","14.2 Look at the pictures and practice with your teacher.","14.2 看图和老师练习。",0],["li","- Have students look at the picture on page 37 in their books. Ask students to describe the picture. Help them to use comparisons: \"_____ is ___.\" \" ______is ______more _____ than _______.\" and \"______ is the most _____..\"","- 让学生看书上第 37 页的图，请学生描述图片，帮助他们使用比较句：\"_____ is ___.\"、\"______ is more _____ than _______.\" 和 \"______ is the most _____.\"",0],["li","- Show the pictures on the website. Call on individual students to make sentences about the pictures.","- 在网站上展示图片，叫个别学生针对图片造句。",0],["li","- Click on the pictures to play the sentences. Have students repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 点图片播放句子，让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["h3","14.3 Practice the dialogue below.","14.3 练习下面的对话。",0],["li","- Put students into groups of 4. Assign the roles of Joey, Sarah, Ann and Billy.","- 把学生分成四人一组，分配 Joey、Sarah、Ann 和 Billy 的角色。",0],["li","- Students practice the dialogue in groups. Switch roles until everyone in the group has had a turn playing all roles.","- 学生分组练习对话，交换角色直到每人都演过所有角色。",0],["h3","14.4 Look at the pictures and answer the questions.","14.4 看图回答问题。",0],["li","- Pair-work. Students complete the exercise in pairs, and then practice asking and answering questions with each other.","- 两人一组。学生两两完成练习，再互相练习问答。",0],["h3","Activity Sheet 6","活动单 6",0],["li","- Have students look at the pictures and write down which of the things they like in each picture. Write down the reasons.","- 让学生看图，写下每张图中他们喜欢哪一样，并写出理由。",0],["li","- Pair-work: talk about their choices with their partners.","- 两人一组：和伙伴谈论自己的选择。",0],["d","Which one do you like: the blue bike or the red one?","A",0],["d","The blue one.","B",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["d","Why?","A",0],["d","It's more expensive.","B",0],["h3","14.5 Look at the pictures and fill in the blanks.","14.5 看图填空。",0],["li","- Go through the exercise with the students orally.","- 和学生口头做一遍练习。",0],["li","- Have students complete the exercise in pairs. Walk around and help if needed.","- 让学生两两完成练习。在教室里走动，需要时给予协助。",0],["h2","14.6 Look at the IPA phonetic spelling. Read and write","14.6 看国际音标拼法，念出并写出",0],["h3","the word.","这个字。",0],["li","- Go through the examples with the students, and have them complete the exercise in pairs. Walk around and help if needed.","- 和学生一起看例子，让他们两两完成练习。在教室里走动，需要时给予协助。",0],["li","- Call on individual students to pronounce the words.","- 叫个别学生念出这些字。",0],["h2","14.7 Listen to the word and write the number of the","14.7 听单词，写出重音所在的",0],["h3","stressed syllable.","音节号码。",0],["li","- Say a few 3-syllable words that are not on this page. Ask students where the stress is after saying each word.","- 说几个这页没有的三音节字，每说一个就问学生重音在哪里。",0],["li","- Have them complete the exercise individually.","- 让他们各自完成练习。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["p","Motivation. This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See And Say.\"","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["li","Step 1: Context Introduction:","步骤 1：情境介绍：",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students to listen to the monologue of \"Let's See and Say\" section in lesson one. The teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's See & Say:","老师让学生听第 3 课“Let's See and Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听，如下所示。Let's See & Say 独白：",0],["p","What will you do and say when you see someone that you haven't seen for a long time? Will you give the person a hug and kiss? Tony and Mike meet at a Halloween party. They feel happy to see each other. Let's listen to what they are talking about.","见到很久没见的人时你会做什么、说什么？你会拥抱并亲吻对方吗？Tony 和 Mike 在万圣节派对上碰面，很高兴见到彼此。我们来听听他们在聊什么。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have just listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasise for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students to","第二次为全班播放对话，让学生",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","跟着旁白念。提醒学生练习每句对话时，要仔细听旁白的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialog that the students have practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialog to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with the others. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the type of conversation in the real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement: Total Review","加强：总复习",0],["p","Review today's lesson using the books Review today's lesson using the digital system. Homework: Preview the homework, by doing a section of it on the board. Progress Report Book Write learning items on the board and let the students copy it in their books","用课本复习今天的课程，用数字系统复习今天的课程。作业：在白板上做一部分作业来预习。进度报告本：把学习项目写在白板上，让学生抄到本子上。",0],["h2","Teleplone Teaching Material 10","电话教学教材 10",0],["li","1. Who is taller,your mom or dad?","1. Who is taller, your mom or dad?（你妈妈和爸爸谁比较高？）",0],["li","2. Are you the tallest boy/girl in your class?","2. Are you the tallest boy/girl in your class?（你是班上最高的男生／女生吗？）",0],["li","3. How do you spell \"expensive\"?","3. How do you spell \"expensive\"?（\"expensive\" 怎么拼？）",0],["li","4. Who is the most friendly?","4. Who is the most friendly?（谁最友善？）",0],["li","5. Are you the best student in your class?","5. Are you the best student in your class?（你是班上最好的学生吗？）",0]],"g":[[27,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 8","Classroom Readers","Lesson 10","Reader","New Word"]],[47,["儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 8","Classroom Activities","Lesson 14","14.1","14.2"]],[79,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Making New"],"bd":"","m":100},{"z":"第 21 课","t":"Class 21","k":"class","p":[74,75,76],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["li","- Goals: To make comparisons e.g.: more, the most Classroom Reader","- 目标：做比较，例如 more、the most　课堂读本",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","None","无",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 8B Lesson 15","课堂活动 8B 第 15 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Grade(s), yuck, I can't stand it, joking",null,1],["h3","Sentence patterns","句型",1],["p","_____ is _____. _____ is more ______ than ______. _____ is the most _______ of all. (Comparatives, superlatives.)","_____ is _____. _____ is more ______ than ______. _____ is the most _______ of all.（比较级、最高级）",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 12","EEC 4 第 12 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Jack-o-Lantern, bat , ghost; witch, monster, spider, vampire, cauldron",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","I don't believe my eyes!","A",1],["d","Believe it. It's me.","B",1],["d","Tony! It's so nice to see you again!","A",1],["d","I'm happy to see you too.","B",1],["d","Give me a hug.","A",1],["d","Hey-hey. It's always nice to see friends.","B",1],["d","You look well","A",1],["d","You too, Mike.","B",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","- View the vocabulary on the digital medium. Show the picture, play the sound and let the students repeat. Then show the students one action for every word. Let them do the actions while saying the words. After this, invent some phrase and the students must say one of the vocabulary words suitable to the phrase. For example, if you say \"seventy percent\" the students must say \"grade\". If you say, \"Look, there flies a pig,\" the students must say, \"Joking.\"","- 在数字教材上看单词。展示图片、播放声音，让学生跟着念。然后为每个字示范一个动作，让学生一边说字一边做动作。之后自编一些短语，学生要说出适合这个短语的单词。例如你说 \"seventy percent\"，学生要说 \"grade\"；你说 \"Look, there flies a pig.\"，学生要说 \"Joking.\"",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (55 mins)","课堂活动（55 分钟）",0],["p","Draw two animals on the board. Show the students how to make a comparison by saying, for example, \"A giraffe is taller than a cat.\" Do one or two examples. Then hand out the animal pictures to the students The game is as follows: the teacher calls any two students to come to the front and show the pictures only when they face the class. See which of the two students can first make a comparison between the animals. They have to say something that is true, for instance, \"A mouse is smaller than a rabbit.\"","在白板上画两只动物，示范如何做比较，例如说 \"A giraffe is taller than a cat.\"。做一两个例子后，把动物图片发给学生。游戏方式如下：老师叫任两位学生到前面，面向全班时才展示图片，看两人中谁先比较出两种动物。说的内容必须是真的，例如 \"A mouse is smaller than a rabbit.\"",0],["h3","Exercise 15.2","练习 15.2",0],["p","Divide the class into four groups and each group assumes a role. It can be \"Sarah, Joey, Billy, or Ann.\" Click into the exercise on the website and play the dialog that belongs to the first Picture. Then let the two groups come to the front and assume the roles in the picture,","把全班分成四组，每组扮演一个角色：Sarah、Joey、Billy 或 Ann。在网站上点进练习，播放第一张图的对话。然后让两组到前面扮演图中的角色，",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","let them say the dialog to each other. Give a mark to the best group. Then go to the next picture and follow the same procedure. Do the whole exercise and find out which group is the winner.","互相说出对话，给表现最好的组一分。接着到下一张图，照同样程序进行。做完整个练习，看哪一组获胜。",0],["h3","Exercise15.3","练习 15.3",0],["p","Turn to page 48 in the textbook and let the kids study the large picture. Then let them close the books and stand. Ask questions about the picture and if a student answers correctly, he/she may sit down. See who remain standing! (Do use the sentence pattern, for instance, \"Which animal is the tallest?\") After this activity it is time to put away the books. Play the episode on the digital medium and let the students listen to it as well. Repeat if necessary. Then let the students fill in the answers in their books individually. After completing the exercise, give individual students a chance to read a sentence in the class and say the answer. Walk around and monitor the students. Encourage them to mark their work and correct mistakes.","翻到课本第 48 页，让孩子们仔细看大图，然后合上书站起来。问关于图片的问题，答对的学生可以坐下，看谁一直站着！（一定要用句型，例如 \"Which animal is the tallest?\"）这个活动结束后收起书本，在数字教材上播放这一段让学生听，必要时重播。然后让学生在书上各自填答案。完成后让个别学生在班上念一句并说出答案。在教室里走动观察学生，鼓励他们批改并订正错误。",0],["h3","Exercise 15.4","练习 15.4",0],["p","Play the exercise on digital and let the students look in their books to find the answer. See who in class can find the answers quickly and read them as well. Close the website and let the students work in groups to arrange the dialogue in the correct order. Give them some time to do this and then give each group a turn to read the dialogue. See who does it correctly.","在数字教材上播放练习，让学生在书上找答案，看谁能最快找到答案并念出来。关掉网站，让学生分组把对话排成正确的顺序。给他们一些时间，然后每组轮流念对话，看谁排对了。",0],["h3","Exercise 15.5","练习 15.5",0],["p","Let the students turn over the page to exercise 15.5 in their books. Also click into the exercise on the website. Play the sound with the pictures and let everyone listen. When they hear the word, they must write it in their books. Then walk through the class and monitor the performances. Let individual students who has the answers down correctly in their books write them on the board and give time to the rest for the correction of mistakes.","让学生把书翻到练习 15.5，也在网站上点进这个练习。配合图片播放声音让大家听，听到字时要写在书上。然后在教室里走动观察表现。让书上答案正确的个别学生把答案写在白板上，并给其他人时间订正错误。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["p","To start the class:","开始上课：",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles. Listening Comprehension:","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["p","The students are ready for the Halloween party. Listen and write down the name of the students.","学生们准备好参加万圣节派对了。听一听，写下学生的名字。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog of \"Let's Check\" section as the introduction of the second listening exercise, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's Check:","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导，如下所示。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","What can we see at a Halloween party? Look at the picture. There is a Jack-o-Lantern, bat, ghost, witch, monster, spider, vampire, and a cauldron. Please turn to page 50. Let's check. The students are ready for the Halloween party. Listen and write down the names of the students.","万圣节派对上可以看到什么？看看这张图：有南瓜灯、蝙蝠、鬼、女巫、怪物、蜘蛛、吸血鬼和大锅。请翻到第 50 页。Let's check。学生们准备好参加万圣节派对了。听一听，写下学生的名字。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["li","- Review / point out the key words to the class in the listening exercise.","- 向全班复习／指出听力练习中的关键字。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["li","- Explain the exercise to the students and make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise while listening to the MP3.","- 向学生说明练习方式，确定说明够清楚，让学生能一边听 MP3 一边做练习。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","继续为全班播放 MP3 做听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["li","Step 5:","步骤 5：",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teachers can play the dialog to the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h2","Reinforcement (15 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（15 mins）",0],["li","1. Total review: review the work using the digital system and the books. Remind students about the test scheduled for the next class.","1. 总复习：用数字系统和课本复习内容，提醒学生下堂课要考试。",0],["li","2. Homework : Preview the homework.","2. 作业：预习作业。",0],["li","3. Progress: Report Books: Check the student's progress and write comments. Prepare students for the P.T.A. show (view activities day three). Try to practice for the final performance. (15mins).","3. 进度报告本：检查学生的进度并写评语。让学生准备家长会表演（见第三次活动日），试着练习最后的演出。（15 分钟）",0]],"g":[[22,["儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 8","Classroom Activities","Lesson 15","15.1"]],[24,["Classroom Activities","Lesson 15","15.2- 15.5"]],[53,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":95},{"z":"第 22 课","t":"Class 22","k":"class","p":[77,78],"b":[["h2","Review Day 3","复习日 3",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","To review all previous lessons Classroom readers:","复习前面所有课程　课堂读本：",0],["p","Review lesson 7 to lesson 10","复习第 7 课到第 10 课",0],["h3","Classroom Activities",null,0],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",0],["p","Lesson 11 to lesson 15","第 11 课到第 15 课",0],["h3","Sentence pattern","句型",0],["p","Lesson 11 to lesson 15 IPA phonetics Lesson 11 to lesson 15","第 11 课到第 15 课国际音标第 11 课到第 15 课",0],["h3","EEC",null,0],["p","To express a pleasant feeling To express surprise To give a hug","表达愉快的感觉；表达惊讶；给一个拥抱",0],["h3","Teaching aids","教具",0],["p","Flashcards, tape recorder, S8 listening lab tape, copy of the test.","单词卡、录音机、S8 听力测验录音带、考卷复印件。",0],["h3","EEC4 Lesson 12","EEC4 第 12 课",0],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",0],["p","Jack-o-Lantern, bat , ghost; witch, monster, spider, vampire, cauldron",null,0],["h3","Dialogue","对话",0],["d","I don't believe my eyes!","A",0],["d","Believe it. It's me.","B",0],["d","Tony! It's so nice to see you again!","A",0],["d","I'm happy to see you too.","B",0],["d","Give me a hug.","A",0],["d","Hey-hey. It's always nice to see friends.","B",0],["d","You look well","A",0],["d","You too, Mike.","B",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Total Review (25 mins)","总复习 Total Review（25 mins）",0],["li","1. Review the lessons using the books as well as the touchscreen all-in-one. (See the digital guide in the column on the right.)","1. 用课本和触控一体机复习课程。（见右栏的数字指引。）",0],["li","2. Use the time for explaining grammar rules that are still not clear to the students. Do plenty of examples to illustrate what you aim to explain. Focus on problem areas.","2. 利用时间解释学生还不清楚的语法规则，举很多例子说明你要解释的内容，着重在问题所在。",0],["li","3. Play some interesting games that are related to the work.","3. 玩一些和课程相关的有趣游戏。",0],["li","4. Plan activities that will help the students to review.","4. 规划能帮助学生复习的活动。",0],["li","5. Get the test paper and go over each section with the class. Don't give answers from the test away to the class. Rather formulate questions that are similar to those in the test and do one example of each question type.","5. 拿出考卷和全班逐部分讲评。不要把考卷的答案透露给全班，而是出和考题类似的题目，每种题型各做一个例子。",0],["h2","Quiz (30 mins)","小测验 Quiz（30 mins）",0],["p","Have the students put away all their books before you hand out the quiz. Make sure the students understand all the instructions. Walk around the room to check the students' progress. Make sure students do not talk or cheat during the test.","发考卷前让学生收好所有书本。确定学生理解所有说明。在教室里走动检查学生的进度，确定考试时学生不说话也不作弊。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Listening Quiz (30 mins)","听力小测验 Listening Quiz（30 mins）",0],["p","Check the tape and the recorder before the students come back from the break, prepare for the listening quiz. Play the tape and let the students fill in the answer on the test paper. Play the tape once or twice. The students need to listen carefully.","学生下课回来前先检查录音带和录音机，准备听力小测验。播放录音带让学生在考卷上填答案，录音播一两次，学生要仔细听。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the suitable place for their performance. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation about what they can do in the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生依照自己的表现在适当的位置打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group to do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease in terms of achieving the functional goals of this lesson. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation. Please refer to the appendix for the MP3 script and answers of \"Let's Check\" section. Reinforcement","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，达到本课的功能目标，同时注意学生的发音和语调。注意：“Let's Check”部分的 MP3 对话稿和答案请参考附录。",0],["li","1. Remind the students to prepare for the test in the next lesson.","1. 提醒学生为下一课的考试做准备。",0],["li","2. Inform the students about the telephone teaching today. Homework exercises. Remind the students to pay attention to mistakes they have made in previous homework exercises.","2. 告知学生今天有电话教学。家庭作业：提醒学生注意之前作业中犯过的错误。",0],["h2","Progress Report Book","学习进度手册",0],["li","1. Check their progress reports individually.","1. 逐一检查他们的进度报告。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 11","电话教学教材 11",0],["li","1. Are you careless?","1. Are you careless?（你粗心吗？）",0],["li","2. Are you the tallest boy/girl in your class?","2. Are you the tallest boy/girl in your class?（你是班上最高的男生／女生吗？）",0],["li","3. Is your mom happier than your dad?","3. Is your mom happier than your dad?（你妈妈比你爸爸开心吗？）",0],["li","4. Is your English teacher older than your father?","4. Is your English teacher older than your father?（你的英文老师比你爸爸年纪大吗？）",0],["li","5. Do you eat more quickly than your father?","5. Do you eat more quickly than your father?（你吃得比你爸爸快吗？）",0]],"g":[[26,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 8","Classroom Activities","Lesson 11- Lesson 15"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Review Day","m":100},{"z":"第 23 课","t":"Class 23","k":"class","p":[79],"b":[["h2","Test Day 3","测验日 3",0],["p","To review lesson 11 to lesson 15","复习第 11 课到第 15 课",0],["h3","Teaching aids","教具",0],["p","Flashcards, digital equipment, test papers. Classroom readers:","单词卡、数字设备、考卷。课堂读本：",0],["p","Review lesson 7 to lesson 10","复习第 7 课到第 10 课",0],["h3","Classroom Activities",null,0],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",0],["p","Lesson 11 to lesson 15","第 11 课到第 15 课",0],["h3","Sentence pattern","句型",0],["p","Lesson 11 to lesson 15 IPA phonetics Lesson 11 to lesson 15","第 11 课到第 15 课国际音标第 11 课到第 15 课",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Review Time. (15 mins)","复习时间（15 分钟）",0],["p","Go through the CR with the students, review the chapters covered since the last test. Ask questions to check the students, comprehension. Do attendance spelling. Focus on vocabulary that are important for the test.","和学生一起看课堂读本，复习上次考试以来教过的章节。问问题检查学生的理解程度。做拼写点名，着重在考试重要的单词。",0],["h2","Attendance (15mins)","点名（15 分钟）",0],["p","Read instructions from the test. Make sure the students can understand the instructions. Do a quick review of all the areas, including vocabulary, sentence patterns and grammar. Give examples of questions that are similar to those in the test. Do one or two examples for each question type in the test.","念出考卷上的说明，确定学生理解。快速复习所有范围，包括单词、句型和语法。举出和考题类似的题目，考卷每种题型各做一两个例子。",0],["h2","Test (50 mins)","测验 Test（50 mins）",0],["p","The test is designed to take about fifty minutes. If students finish early, have them draw or read quietly at their desks or watch TV. If everyone finishes early, let them practice for the PTA show. Reinforcement Remind the students about the oral test today. Homework exercises. Remind students about the telephone teaching in the next lesson. Progress Report Book","考试设计约五十分钟。如果学生提早写完，让他们在座位上安静画画、阅读或看电视。如果大家都提早写完，就让他们练习家长会表演。加强：提醒学生今天有口试。家庭作业。提醒学生下一课有电话教学。进度报告本",0],["li","2. Check their progress reports individually.","2. 逐一检查他们的进度报告。",0],["h2","Oral Test 3","口试 3",0],["p","It will take 3 - 5 mins for each student. Instructions:","每位学生约需 3–5 分钟。说明：",0],["p","I. Conduct the oral test outside the classroom, individually, with the students. Each question is worth four points. One each for:","I. 在教室外与学生个别进行口试。每题 4 分，分别是：",0],["p","comprehension, grammar, pronunciation and fluency. II. The foreign teacher should do the oral test. The Chinese teacher can take care of the class while the test is in progress.","理解、语法、发音和流畅度各 1 分。II. 由外籍老师进行口试，口试进行时由中文老师照顾班级。",0],["li","1. What is more expensive, a bicycle or a book?","1. What is more expensive, a bicycle or a book?（自行车和书哪个比较贵？）",0],["li","2. Is your English teacher older than your father?","2. Is your English teacher older than your father?（你的英文老师比你爸爸年纪大吗？）",0],["li","3. Are you the tallest boy/girl in your class?","3. Are you the tallest boy/girl in your class?（你是班上最高的男生／女生吗？）",0],["li","4. Who is the most careless student in your class?","4. Who is the most careless student in your class?（谁是班上最粗心的学生？）",0],["li","5. Is a bird more beautiful than a dog?","5. Is a bird more beautiful than a dog?（鸟比狗漂亮吗？）",0]],"g":[[11,["None"]],[13,["None"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Test Day","m":80},{"z":"第 24 课","t":"Class 24","k":"class","p":[80,81],"b":[["h2","Activity Day 3","活动日 3",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","To review all the previous lessons","复习前面所有课程",0],["h3","Teaching aids","教具",0],["p","Flashcards, digital equipment, test papers.","单词卡、数字教学设备、测验卷",0],["h3","Classroom readers","课堂读本",0],["p","Review lesson 7 to lesson 10","复习第 7 课到第 10 课",0],["h3","Classroom Activities",null,0],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",0],["p","Lesson 11 to lesson 15","第 11 课到第 15 课",0],["h3","Sentence pattern","句型",0],["p","Lesson 11 to lesson 15 IPA phonetics Lesson 11 to lesson 15","第 11 课到第 15 课国际音标第 11 课到第 15 课",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Test Review (10 mins)","讲评测验 Test Review（10 mins）",0],["p","Take this time to review the test. Go over any area where there seem to be a lot of mistakes. Do reinforce explanations by giving enough examples.","利用这段时间讲评考试。讲解错误较多的地方，举足够的例子加强说明。",0],["h2","Rehearsal (30 mins)","彩排（30 分钟）",0],["h3","Classroom activities","课堂活动",0],["li","1. Choose an interesting lesson on the digital site. (see the column on the right for one suggestion about a lesson).","1. 在数字网站上选一课有趣的课程。（右栏有一课的建议。）",0],["li","2. Play the lesson and then click on the \"Translation\"- icon to let the students practice to say some of the sentences aloud. You can play the lesson again if there are still many students who cannot repeat a sentence or phrase.","2. 播放这课，再点“翻译”图示让学生练习大声说出一些句子。如果还有很多学生无法跟着念句子或短语，可以再播一次。",0],["li","3. Ask some of your own questions about the passage that was presented on the digital medium to the students.","3. 针对数字教材呈现的短文，自己出一些问题问学生。",0],["li","3. Divide the class into two teams to see which team can answer the most questions. Dramatic play : Use the script below to let the students practice to perform a dramatic play. Speaking roles: the class, Nancy, Mr. Happy, Mr. Friendly. (Enter Mr. Happy and Nancy)","3. 把全班分成两队，看哪一队答对最多题。戏剧表演：用下面的剧本让学生练习演出短剧。说话的角色：全班、Nancy、Mr. Happy、Mr. Friendly。（Mr. Happy 和 Nancy 上场）",0],["d","Who are you? What's your name?","Class",0],["d","My name is Nancy.","Nancy",0],["p","Mr. Happy: I'm Mr. Happy. Nancy, do you want to go to Happy land with me?","Mr. Happy：I'm Mr. Happy. Nancy, do you want to go to Happy land with me?（我是快乐先生。Nancy，你想和我去快乐国吗？）",0],["d","Sure.","Nancy",0],["p","Mr. Happy: Ok, let's go. What are you good at?","Mr. Happy：Ok, let's go. What are you good at?（好，走吧。你擅长什么？）",0],["d","I'm good at English but I am better at singing and dancing.","Nancy",0],["p","How about you? Mr. Happy: Ha! Ha! I am good at drawing but I am better at reading and spelling. (Enter a man).","How about you?（你呢？）Mr. Happy：Ha! Ha! I am good at drawing but I am better at reading and spelling.（哈哈！我擅长画画，但更擅长阅读和拼写。）（一位男士上场）",0],["d","Look, a man is coming. Who is he?","Class",0],["p","Mr. Friendly: I am Mr. Friendly. Mr. Happy and Nancy: Nice to meet you, Mr. Friendly.","Mr. Friendly：I am Mr. Friendly.（我是友善先生。）Mr. Happy 和 Nancy：Nice to meet you, Mr. Friendly.（很高兴认识你，友善先生。）",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","Mr. Friendly: Nice to meet you two, Mr. Friendly and Nancy.","Mr. Friendly：Nice to meet you two, Mr. Happy and Nancy.（很高兴认识你们两位，快乐先生和 Nancy。）",0],["d","Mr. Friendly likes new friends and he is good at helping others.","Class",0],["p","Mr. Friendly: Yes, right. Do you like stories, Nancy?","Mr. Friendly：Yes, right. Do you like stories, Nancy?（是的，没错。Nancy，你喜欢故事吗？）",0],["d","Yes, everyone loves stories!","Nancy",0],["d","Yes, everyone loves stories!","Class",0],["h3","Classroom readers","课堂读本",0],["li","1. Do play any key lesson (reading). Let the students view the lesson on the touchscreen all-in-one.","1. 播放任何一课重点课程（阅读），让学生在触控一体机上看课程。",0],["li","2. Consult the lists of questions in the back of the book.","2. 参考书后的问题清单。",0],["li","3. Ask questions to test the students understanding of the lesson.","3. 问问题测试学生对课程的理解。",0],["li","4. Ask any suitable questions, also make up some of your own.","4. 问任何适合的问题，也可以自己出题。",0],["h2","Presentation (35 mins)","成果发表（35 分钟）",0],["p","It is time to show the parents how much the students have learned. Do follow the teaching steps above one more time. This time, let the kids show effort.","该让家长看看学生学会了多少！再照上面的教学步骤做一次，这次让孩子们展现努力。",0],["h2","The graduation ceremony (10 mins)","结业典礼（10 分钟）",0],["p","Hand out the awards and certificates to the students. Talk to the parents about the performances of their children. Listen to their ideas. Give information to the parents about the student's behavior in the class during the semester. Reinforcement Inform the students about the telephone teaching today. Homework exercises. Remind the students to pay attention to mistakes they have made in the test sure about the corrections; that it gets done properly. Progress Report Book Check their progress reports individually.","颁发奖状和证书给学生。和家长谈谈孩子的表现，听听他们的想法，并告诉家长学生这学期在课堂上的表现。加强：告知学生今天有电话教学。家庭作业：提醒学生注意考试中犯过的错误，确实把订正做好。进度报告本：逐一检查他们的进度报告。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 12","电话教学教材 12",0],["li","1. Who is the most careless student in your class?","1. Who is the most careless student in your class?（谁是班上最粗心的学生？）",0],["li","2. Is your mother's hair longer than your father's?","2. Is your mother's hair longer than your father's?（你妈妈的头发比你爸爸长吗？）",0],["li","3. What is more expensive, a bicycle or a book?","3. What is more expensive, a bicycle or a book?（自行车和书哪个比较贵？）",0],["li","4. Is a bird more beautiful than a dog?","4. Is a bird more beautiful than a dog?（鸟比狗漂亮吗？）",0],["li","5. Is your English teacher older than your father? their best questions and and to make","5. Is your English teacher older than your father?（你的英文老师比你爸爸年纪大吗？）",0]],"g":[[13,["None"]],[15,["Classroom Readers"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Activity Day","m":85},{"z":"作业本解答","t":"Homework Exercises Answers","k":"img","p":[82,83,84,85,86,87,88],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"语法总整理","t":"Grammar Summaries","k":"img","p":[89,90,91],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"EEC“Let's Check”解答","t":"EEC \"Let's Check\" Answers","k":"img","p":[92,93],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0}];